#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Activation keys are used with traditional and Salt clients to ensure that "
"your clients have the correct software entitlements, are connecting to the "
"appropriate channels, and are subscribed to the relevant groups.  Each "
"activation key is bound to an organization, which you can set when you "
"create the key."
msgstr "Activation keys ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ traditional clients ແລະ Salt clients ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ client ຂອງທ່ານມີສິດທິການນຳໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ໄດ້ສະໝັກເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ແຕ່ລະ activation key ຈະຖືກຜູກໄວ້ກັບອົງກອນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ເມື່ອສ້າງຄີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, an activation key is a group of configuration settings "
"with a label.  You can apply all configuration settings associated with an "
"activation key by adding its label as a parameter to a bootstrap script.  We "
"recommend you use an activation key label in combination with a bootstrap "
"script.  When the bootstrap script is executed all configuration settings "
"associated with the label are applied to the system the script is run on."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່ (Label). ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງມັນເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໃນ bootstrap script. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ bootstrap script. ເມື່ອ bootstrap script ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບປ້າຍຊື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບທີ່ script ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:4
msgid "An activation key can specify:"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ສາມາດລະບຸ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:5
msgid "Channel assignment"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:6
msgid "System types or add-on entitlements"
msgstr "ປະເພດລະບົບ ຫຼື ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນເສີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:7
msgid "Contact method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:11
msgid "Configuration files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:9
msgid "Packages to be installed"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:10
msgid "System group assignment"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Activation keys are used at the time a client is registered, and not used "
"again.  After the client has been registered, the client can be changed in "
"any way, regardless of what the activation key specifies.  The association "
"between the activation key and the client is recorded only for historical "
"purposes."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍລົງທະບຽນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຄືນອີກ. ຫຼັງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ທຸກຮູບແບບ ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສິ່ງທີ່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ລະບຸໄວ້. ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະຫວ່າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງທາງປະຫວັດສາດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "provision-config-keys.png"
msgstr "provision-config-keys.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (Activation Key)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, as an administrator, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:15
msgid "Click the btn:[Create Key] button."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Activation Key Details`` page, in the "
"[guimenu]``Description`` field, enter a description of the activation key."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Activation Key Details``, ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:17
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter a name for the activation key."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:18
msgid "For example, ``SLES15-SP4`` for {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP4."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``SLES15-SP4`` ສຳລັບ {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP4."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Do not use commas or double quotes in the [guimenu]``Key`` field for any "
"{suse} products.  However, you *must* use commas for Red Hat Products."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ (,) ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ (\") ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key`` ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃດໆ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານ *ຕ້ອງ* ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ Red Hat."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:20
msgid ""
"All other characters are allowed, but `<> (){}` (this includes the space) "
"are removed automatically."
msgstr "ອັກສອນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດແມ່ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້, ແຕ່ `<> (){}` (ລວມທັງຍະຫວ່າງ) ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:21
msgid "If the field is left empty, a random string is generated."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫ້ອງນີ້ຖືກປະຫວ່າງໄວ້, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບສຸ່ມຂຶ້ນມາເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Base Channels`` drop-down box, select the appropriate base "
"software channel, and allow the relevant child channels to populate."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງລາຍການ [guimenu]``Base Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຫຼັກ (base software channel) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc#vle.webui.admin.wizard.products[Setup "
"Wizard] and xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc#vle.webui.admin.wizard.products[Setup Wizard] ແລະ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Select the child channels you need (for example, the mandatory {susemgr} "
"tools and updates channels)."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື {susemgr} ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Add-On System Types`` check box if you need to enable "
"any of the options."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກໃນກ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add-On System Types`` ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:26
msgid ""
"We recommend you leave the [guimenu]``Contact Method`` set to "
"[guimenu]``Default``."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານປະຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Contact Method`` ໄວ້ທີ່ [guimenu]``Default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:27
msgid "We recommend you leave the [guimenu]``Universal Default`` setting unchecked."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍຕິກທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [guimenu]``Universal Default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:28
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key] to create the activation key."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key] ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` check box to enable "
"configuration management for this key, and click btn:[Update Activation Key] "
"to save this change."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກໃນກ່ອງ [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດການ ການກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບຄີນີ້, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Update Activation Key] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` check box does not appear "
"until after you have created the activation key.  Ensure you go back and "
"check the box if you need to enable configuration management."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໝາຍ [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະ ສ້າງ activation key ແລ້ວ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ກັບມາໝາຍເລືອກກ່ອງນີ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combining Multiple Activation Keys"
msgstr "ການລວມຫຼາຍ Activation Keys ເຂົ້າກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:32
msgid ""
"You can combine activation keys when executing the bootstrap script on your "
"traditional clients.  Combining keys allows for more control on what is "
"installed on your systems and reduces duplication of keys for large or "
"complex environments."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລວມ activation keys ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບ bootstrap script ໃນ traditional clients. ການລວມຄີຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມສິ່ງທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນຂອງຄີສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Combining activation keys works only on traditional clients.  Salt clients "
"do not support combined activation keys.  If you use a combined key with a "
"Salt client, only the first key is used."
msgstr "ການລວມ activation keys ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ traditional clients ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. Salt clients ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການລວມ activation keys. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຄີທີ່ລວມກັນກັບ Salt client, ຈະມີພຽງ ຄີທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:34
msgid ""
"You can specify multiple activation keys at the command prompt, or in a "
"single autoinstallation profile."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຫຼາຍ activation keys ໄດ້ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ຫຼື ໃນ autoinstallation profile ດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:35
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, use the "
"[command]``rhnreg_ks`` command, and separate the key names with a comma.  To "
"specify multiple keys in a {kickstart} profile, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Autoinstallation] and edit the profile you want to use."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``rhnreg_ks``, ແລະ ແຍກຊື່ຄີດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ. ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຫຼາຍຄີໃນ {kickstart} profile, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation] ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂ profile ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Be careful when combining activation keys, as conflicts between some values "
"could cause client registration to fail.  Check that these values do not "
"have conflicting information before you begin:"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງເມື່ອລວມ activation keys ເຂົ້າກັນ, ເພາະວ່າການຂັດແຍ້ງລະຫວ່າງບາງຄ່າ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນ client ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:37
msgid "Software packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:38
msgid "Software child channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວສາຍຍ່ອຍ (Software child channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:39
msgid "Configuration channels."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configuration channels)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:40
msgid "If conflicts are detected, they are handled like this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າກວດພົບການຂັດແຍ້ງ, ລະບົບຈະຈັດການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:41
msgid "Conflicts in base software channels: registration fails."
msgstr "ການຂັດແຍ້ງໃນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຫຼັກ (base software channels): ການລົງທະບຽນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:42
msgid "Conflicts in system types: registration fails."
msgstr "ການຂັດແຍ້ງໃນປະເພດລະບົບ (system types): ການລົງທະບຽນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Conflicts in the `enable configuration` flag: configuration management is "
"enabled."
msgstr "ການຂັດແຍ້ງໃນແຟລັກ `enable configuration`: ການຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:44
msgid "If one key is system-specific: registration fails."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີຄີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດສະເພາະລະບົບ (system-specific): ການລົງທະບຽນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation Keys"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Reactivation keys can be used once only to re-register a client and regain "
"all {productname} settings.  Reactivation keys are client-specific, and "
"include the system ID, history, groups, and channels."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ (Reactivation keys) ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ທັງໝົດ. ຄີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ລວມມີ System ID, ປະຫວັດ, ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:47
msgid ""
"To create a reactivation key, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to create a reactivation key for, and navigate to the "
"menu:Details[Reactivation] tab.  Click btn:[Generate New Key] to create the "
"reactivation key.  Record the details of the key for later use.  Unlike "
"typical activation keys, which are not associated with a specific system ID, "
"keys created here do not show up on the menu:Systems[Activation Keys] page."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງຄີໃຫ້, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Details[Reactivation]. ຄລິກ btn:[Generate New Key] ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີ. ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ຕ່າງຈາກຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຜູກກັບ System ID ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຄີທີ່ສ້າງຢູ່ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນໜ້າ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:48
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, after you have created a reactivation key, you can use it "
"as the ``management_key`` grain in "
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/susemanager.conf``. For example:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Salt clients, ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງ reactivation key ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນ ເປັນ ``management_key`` grain ໃນ [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/susemanager.conf``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:50
msgid "Restart the [command]``salt-minion`` process to apply the reactivation key."
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ (Restart) ຂະບວນການ [command]``salt-minion`` ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ reactivation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:51
msgid ""
"You can use a reactivation key with a bootstrap script.  For more "
"information about bootstrap scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ຮ່ວມກັບ bootstrap script ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap scripts, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:52
msgid ""
"For traditional clients, after you have created a reactivation key, you can "
"use it with the [command]``rhnreg_ks`` command line utility.  This command "
"re-registers the client and restore its {productname} settings.  On "
"traditional clients, you can combine reactivation keys with activation keys "
"to aggregate the settings of multiple keys for a single system profile.  For "
"example:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ traditional clients, ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງ reactivation key ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດ ໃຊ້ມັນກັບເຄື່ອງມື command line [command]``rhnreg_ks``. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ ຈະລົງທະບຽນ client ຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຂອງມັນ. ໃນ traditional clients, ທ່ານສາມາດລວມ reactivation keys ເຂົ້າກັບ activation keys ເພື່ອລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຫຼາຍຄີສຳລັບ system profile ດຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhnreg_ks --server=<server-url>/XMLRPC \\\n"
"          --activationkey=<reactivation-key>,<activationkey> \\\n"
"          --force\n"
msgstr ""
"rhnreg_ks --server=<server-url>/XMLRPC \\\n"
"          --activationkey=<reactivation-key>,<activationkey> \\\n"
"          --force\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If you autoinstall a client with its existing {productname} profile, the "
"profile uses the reactivation key to re-register the system and restore its "
"settings.  Do not regenerate, delete, or use this key while a profile-based "
"autoinstallation is in progress.  Doing so causes the autoinstallation to "
"fail."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {productname} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລະບົບຄືນ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຫ້າມສ້າງໃໝ່, ລຶບ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄີນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Key Best Practices"
msgstr "ແນວທາງການປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Parent Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default Parent Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Avoid using the [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Default`` parent channel.  This "
"setting forces {productname} to choose a parent channel that best "
"corresponds to the installed operating system, which can sometimes lead to "
"unexpected behavior.  Instead, we recommend you create activation keys "
"specific to each distribution and architecture."
msgstr "ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Default``. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ {productname} ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກົງກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງບາງຄັ້ງອາດນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງ activation keys ທີ່ກຳນົດສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ distribution ແລະ architecture."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping with Activation Keys"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ດ້ວຍ Activation Keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If you are using bootstrap scripts, consider creating an activation key for "
"each script.  This helps you align channel assignments, package "
"installation, system group memberships, and configuration channel "
"assignments.  You also need less manual interaction with your system after "
"registration."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ bootstrap scripts, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ script. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ, ການເປັນສະມາຊິກກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ແລະ ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມາຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼາຍຫຼັງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping LTSS clients"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ສຳລັບ LTSS clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If you are boostrapping clients with LTSS subscription, include the LTSS "
"channels during activation key creation."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrapping ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ LTSS, ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ LTSS ເຂົ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bandwidth Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການແບນວິດ (Bandwidth)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Using activation keys might result in automatic downloading of software at "
"registration time, which might not be desirable in environments where "
"bandwidth is constrained."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ເໝາະສົມໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານແບນວິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:64
msgid "These options create bandwidth usage:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການໃຊ້ແບນວິດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Assigning a SUSE Product Pool channel results in the automatic installation "
"of the corresponding product descriptor package."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Product Pool ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດລາຍລະອຽດຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:66
msgid "Any package in the [guimenu]``Packages`` section is installed."
msgstr "ທຸກໆແພັກເກດໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Packages`` ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Any Salt state from the [guimenu]``Configuration`` section might trigger "
"downloads depending on its contents."
msgstr "Salt state ໃດໆຈາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Configuration`` ອາດຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການດາວໂຫຼດ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Label Naming"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຊື່ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີ (Key Label)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If you do not enter a human-readable name for your activation keys, the "
"system automatically generates a number string, which can make it difficult "
"to manage your keys."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ຄົນເຮົາສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນຕົວເລກໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດການຄີຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມຫຍຸ້ງຍາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Consider a naming scheme for your activation keys to help you keep track of "
"them.  Creating names which are associated with your organization's "
"infrastructure makes it easier for you when performing more complex "
"operations."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ການສ້າງຊື່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:71
msgid "When creating key labels, consider these tips:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງປ້າຍຊື່ຄີ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເຄັດລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:72
msgid ""
"OS naming (mandatory): Keys should always refer to the OS they provide "
"settings for"
msgstr "ຊື່ OS (ຈຳເປັນ): ຄີຄວນຈະອ້າງອີງເຖິງ OS ທີ່ພວກມັນສະໜອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສະເໝີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Architecture naming (recommended): Unless your company is running on one "
"architecture only, for example x86_64, then providing labels with an "
"architecture type is a good idea."
msgstr "ຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (ແນະນຳ): ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ພຽງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳດຽວ ເຊັ່ນ x86_64, ການລະບຸປະເພດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໃນປ້າຍຊື່ແມ່ນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:74
msgid "Server type naming: What is this server being used for?"
msgstr "ຊື່ປະເພດເຊີເວີ: ເຊີເວີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:75
msgid "Location naming: Where is the server located? Room, building, or department?"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະຖານທີ່: ເຊີເວີຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃສ? ຫ້ອງ, ອາຄານ, ຫຼື ພະແນກ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:76
msgid "Date naming: Maintenance windows, quarter, etc."
msgstr "ຊື່ວັນທີ: ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ໄຕມາດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:77
msgid "Custom naming: What naming scheme suits your organizations needs?"
msgstr "ຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ: ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໃດທີ່ເໝາະກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:78
msgid "Example activation key label names:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຊື່ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Do not use commas in the [guimenu]``Key`` field for any {suse} products.  "
"However, you *must* use commas for Red Hat Products.  For more information, "
"see xref:reference:systems/activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key`` ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃດໆ. ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານ *ຕ້ອງ* ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ Red Hat. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Included Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:83
msgid ""
"When creating activation keys you also need to keep in mind which software "
"channels are associated with it.  Keys should have a specific base channel "
"assigned to them.  Using the default base channel is not recommended.  For "
"more information, see the client operating system you are installing at "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບມັນນຳ. ຄີຄວນຈະມີຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເພາະ. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install via a CD-ROM or a USB Key"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For clients that are not yet registered to {productname}, and if network "
"boot over PXE is not an option, a bootable CD-ROM or USB key can be used to "
"install the system."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}, ແລະ ຖ້າການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (PXE) ບໍ່ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB key ທີ່ບູດໄດ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One option to prepare such a removable medium is to use {cobbler}.  For "
"information about using {cobbler} to prepare an ISO image, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Build "
"an ISO Image With {cobbler}]."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນການຕຽມສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For {suse} systems, it is often recommended to prepare an ISO image using "
"KIWI.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Build a "
"SUSE ISO Image With KIWI]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບ {suse}, ມັກຈະແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO ໂດຍໃຊ້ KIWI. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In all cases, you use the resulting image to burn a CD-ROM or prepare a USB "
"key."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ມາເພື່ອເບີນລົງ CD-ROM ຫຼື ຕຽມໃສ່ USB key."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{cobbler} can create ISO boot images that contain a set of distributions, "
"kernels, and a menu that works in a similar way to a PXE installation."
msgstr "{cobbler} ສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ສຳລັບບູດທີ່ບັນຈຸຊຸດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ, ເຄີເນລ (Kernel), ແລະ ເມນູທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ PXE."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:8
msgid "Building ISOs with {cobbler} is not supported on {ibmz}."
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler} ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ {ibmz}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In order to prepare an ISO image with {cobbler}, you need to prepare a "
"distribution and a profile, similar to using network boot over PXE.  For "
"information about creating a distribution, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable "
"Distributions].  For information about creating a profile, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕຽມດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການໃຊ້ບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ PXE. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The {cobbler} [command]``buildiso`` command takes parameters to define the "
"name and output location of the boot ISO."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``buildiso`` ຂອງ {cobbler} ຈະຮັບພາລາມິເຕີເພື່ອ ກຳນົດ ຊື່ ແລະ ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກຂອງ boot ISO."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Specifying the distribution with [option]``--distro`` is mandatory when "
"running [command]``buildiso`` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr "cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You must use distro and profile labels as listed by {cobbler}, and not "
"simply as shown in the UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To list the names of distributions and profiles stored by {cobbler}, run the "
"commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# cobbler distro list\n"
"# cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The boot ISO includes all profiles and systems by default.  You can limit "
"which profiles and systems are used with the [option]``--profiles`` and "
"[option]``--systems`` options.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler buildiso --systems=\"system1 system2 system3\" \\\n"
"  --profiles=\"<your-profile1-label> <your-profile2-label> "
"<your-profile3-label> --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you cannot write an ISO image to a public [path]``tmp`` directory, check "
"your systemd settings in [path]``/usr/lib/systemd/system/cobblerd.service``."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ ISO ລົງໃນໂຟນເດີສາທາລະນະ [path]``tmp`` ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ systemd ໃນ [path]``/usr/lib/systemd/system/cobblerd.service``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ຂອງ SUSE ດ້ວຍ KIWI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:20
msgid ""
"KIWI is an image creation system.  You can use KIWI to create a bootable ISO "
"image to be used by the target system for installation of a {suse} system.  "
"When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads "
"the {ay} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {sles} "
"according to the {ay} profile."
msgstr "KIWI ແມ່ນລະບົບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Image. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ KIWI ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ສຳລັບບູດເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ {suse}. ເມື່ອລະບົບຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເປີດເຄື່ອງ, ມັນຈະບູດຈາກ Image, ໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {ay} ຈາກ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} ຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To use the ISO image, boot the system and type `autoyast` at the prompt "
"(assuming you left the label for the {ay} boot as ``autoyast``).  Press "
"kbd:[Enter] to begin the {ay} installation."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ ISO, ໃຫ້ບູດລະບົບແລ້ວພິມ `autoyast` ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ສຳລັບການບູດ {ay} ເປັນ ``autoyast``). ກົດ kbd:[Enter] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay}."

#. we would love a bit more details - ebischoff
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For more information about KIWI, see "
"http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ KIWI, ເບິ່ງ http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Red Hat ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ຂອງ Red Hat ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."

#
#
#
#
#. [[build-iso-with-mkisofs]]
#. == Build a RedHat ISO Image With mkisofs
#. You can use [command]``mkisofs`` to create a bootable ISO image to be used by the target system for installation of a {redhat} system.
#. When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads the {kickstart} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {rhel} according to the {kickstart} profile.
#. .Procedure: Building a Bootable ISO With mkisofs
#. . Copy the contents of [path]``/isolinux`` from the first CD-ROM of the target distribution.
#. . Edit the [path]``isolinux.cfg`` file to default to 'ks'.
#.   Change the 'ks' section to read:
#. +
#. ----
#. label ks
#. kernel vmlinuz
#.   append text ks=`url` initrd=initrd.img lang= devfs=nomount \
#.     ramdisk_size=16438 `ksdevice`
#. ----
#. +
#. IP address-based {kickstart} URLs look like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. http://`my.manager.server`/kickstart/ks/mode/ip_range
#. ----
#. +
#. The {kickstart} distribution defined via the IP range should match the distribution from which you are building, to prevent errors occurring.
#. . OPTIONAL: If you want to use the [replaceable]``ksdevice``, it looks like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. ksdevice=eth0
#. ----
#. +
#. It is possible to change the distribution for a Kickstart profile within a family, such as {rhel} AS 4 to {rhel} ES 4, by specifying the new distribution label.
#. Note that you cannot move between versions (4 to 5) or between updates (U1 to U2).
#. . Customize [path]``isolinux.cfg`` further as required.
#.   For example, you can add multiple options, different boot messages, or shorter timeout periods.
#. . Create the ISO with this command:
#. +
#. ----
#. mkisofs -o file.iso -b isolinux.bin -c boot.cat -no-emul-boot \
#.   -boot-load-size 4 -boot-info-table -R -J -v -T isolinux/
#. ----
#. +
#. Note that [path]``isolinux/`` is the relative path to the directory containing the modified isolinux files copied from the distribution CD, while [path]``file.iso`` is the output ISO file, which is placed into the current directory.
#. . Burn the ISO to CD-ROM and insert the disk.
#.   Alternatively prepare an USB key and insert it.
#. . Boot the system and type [command]``ks`` at the prompt (if you left the label for the Kickstart boot as 'ks').
#. . Press kbd:[Enter] to start {kickstart}.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallable Distributions"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The autoinstallation process relies on an several files to initiate the "
"installation.  These files include the Linux kernel, an initial RAM disk, "
"and other files required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດອາໄສຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມມີ Linux kernel, initial RAM disk, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການບູດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can extract the needed files from a DVD image.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribution "
"Based on an ISO Image]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງເອົາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນອອກຈາກ DVD Image ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribution Based on an ISO Image]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can install the [package]``tftpboot-installation`` "
"package.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-rpm-package[Distribution "
"Based on a RPM Package]."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``tftpboot-installation``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-rpm-package[Distribution Based on a RPM Package]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You must also have a base channel synchronized on your {productname} Server "
"for the same operating system version as those files."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base channel) ທີ່ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນ (Synchronized) ແລ້ວໃນ {productname} Server ສຳລັບເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When you have the files ready, and the base channel synchronized, you need "
"to declare the distribution.  This operation associates the installation "
"files to the base channel.  The distribution can be referred to by one or "
"more installation profiles.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Declare "
"an Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕຽມໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ແລະ ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນສາມາດຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on an ISO Image"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ອີງຕາມໄຟລ໌ ISO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This method assumes you have installation media for the operating system you "
"want to install on the clients.  This is usually a DVD [path]``.iso`` image "
"that contains the Linux kernel, an [path]``initrd`` file, and other files "
"required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານມີສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌ DVD [path]``.iso`` ທີ່ມີ Linux kernel, ໄຟລ໌ [path]``initrd``, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການບູດລະບົບເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing Files from Installation Media"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Copy the installation media to your {productname} Server.  For {suse} "
"operating systems, you can download installation media from "
"https://www.suse.com/download/."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse}, ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ຈາກ https://www.suse.com/download/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:11
msgid "Loop-mount the ISO image, and copy its contents somewhere:"
msgstr "Loop-mount ISO image, ແລະ ສຳເນົາເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນໄປໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mount -o loop,ro <image_name>.iso /mnt\n"
"# mkdir -p /srv/www/distributions\n"
"# cp -a /mnt /srv/www/distributions/<image_name>\n"
"# umount /mnt\n"
msgstr ""
"# mount -o loop,ro <image_name>.iso /mnt\n"
"# mkdir -p /srv/www/distributions\n"
"# cp -a /mnt /srv/www/distributions/<image_name>\n"
"# umount /mnt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Take a note of the file path.  You will need it when you declare the "
"distribution to {productname}."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file path) ໄວ້. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ມັນເມື່ອທ່ານປະກາດ distribution ໃຫ້ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on a RPM Package"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ອີງຕາມແພັກເກດ RPM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This method works on {suse} systems.  It is simpler than importing contents "
"from an installation media, because it uses prepackaged files for your "
"installation system."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລະບົບ {suse}. ມັນງ່າຍກວ່າການນຳເຂົ້າເນື້ອໃນຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພາະວ່າມັນໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແພັກໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວສຳລັບລະບົບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Extracting Files from an Installation Package"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແຍກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກແພັກເກດການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, install the package whose name starts with "
"[package]``tftpboot-installation``.  You can determine its exact name with "
"the command [command]``zypper se tftpboot-installation``"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [package]``tftpboot-installation``. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດຊື່ທີ່ແນ່ນອນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper se tftpboot-installation``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Determine where the installation files went with the command [command]``ls "
"-d /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/*``.  Take a note of the file path.  You "
"will need it when you declare the distribution to {productname}."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃສດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``ls -d /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/*``. ຈົດບັນທຶກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄວ້. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ມັນເມື່ອທ່ານປະກາດ distribution ໃຫ້ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This procedure prepares the installation of the same operating system "
"version as the one that powers your {productname} Server.  If you want to "
"install a different operating system or version on the client, you need to "
"manually get the package [package]``tftpboot-installation-*`` from the "
"distribution it belongs to.  In the [menu]``Package Search`` input box "
"{productname}, search the packages whose names start with "
"[package]``tftpboot-installation``, then look at the package's details.  "
"They show the local path below [path]``/var/spacewalk/``."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນການກຽມການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເວີຊັນດຽວກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື ເວີຊັນອື່ນໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄປຫາແພັກເກດ [package]``tftpboot-installation-*`` ຈາກ distribution ນັ້ນໆດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ [menu]``Package Search`` ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [package]``tftpboot-installation``, ແລ້ວກວດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດແພັກເກດ ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງພາຍໃຕ້ [path]``/var/spacewalk/``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The next step after extracting the autoinstallation files is to declare an "
"autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປຫຼັງຈາກການແຍກໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດແລ້ວ ແມ່ນການປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Declaring an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Distributions]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:24
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create Distribution``, and complete these fields:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Create Distribution``, ແລະ ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຫ້ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Distribution Label`` field, enter a name to identify your "
"autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Distribution Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ເພື່ອລະບຸ distribution ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Tree Path`` field, enter the path to the installation "
"media saved on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Tree Path``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Select the matching [guimenu]``Base Channel``.  This must match the "
"installation media."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Base Channel`` ທີ່ກົງກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງກົງກັບສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Select the [guimenu]``Installer Generation``.  This must match the "
"installation media."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Installer Generation``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງກົງກັບສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:29
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Specify kernel options to use when booting this distribution.  "
"There are multiple ways to provide kernel options.  Only add options here "
"that are generic for the distribution."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ລະບຸ kernel options ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນເວລາບູດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນນີ້. ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລະບຸ kernel options. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະເພາະຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນຄ່າທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັນນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:30
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The installation files that you prepared might not contain the packages you "
"need to install.  If they are not included, add [option]``useonlinerepo=1`` "
"to the [guimenu]``Kernel Options`` field."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານກຽມໄວ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [option]``useonlinerepo=1`` ເຂົ້າໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Options``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The package repositories contain metadata that can be unsigned.  If the "
"metadata is unsigned, add [option]``insecure=1`` to the [guimenu]``Kernel "
"Options`` field, or use your own GPG key as explained in "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[Use Your Own GPG Key]."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບແພັກເກດ (Repositories) ອາດມີ metadata ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນຊື່ກຳກັບ. ຫາກ metadata ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນຊື່, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [option]``insecure=1`` ເຂົ້າໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Options``, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄີ GPG ຂອງທ່ານເອງຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[Use Your Own GPG Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:33
msgid ""
"These kernel options are needed for example when you use the \"online "
"installer\" ISO images instead of the full DVD, or when you use the "
"[package]``tpboot-installation`` package."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ kernel ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ຕົວຢ່າງໃນຕອນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ ISO ແບບ \"online installer\" ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ DVD ເຕັມ, ຫຼື ຕອນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``tpboot-installation``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] to manage your "
"autoinstallable distributions."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] ເພື່ອຈັດການດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:35
msgid ""
"You can autoinstall {productname} Proxies in the same way as {sle} clients.  "
"Make sure you use the {sle} installation media, and choose the "
"[guimenu]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.2-Pool for x86_64`` base "
"channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxies ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບ {sle} clients. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle}, ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ [guimenu]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.2-Pool for x86_64``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating System Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Generally, you register clients that are already running.  You might have "
"installed these machines manually just before registering them to "
"{productname}, or they might be pre-existing systems that were installed "
"before you added {productname} to your environment."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າກັບ {productname}, ຫຼື ພວກມັນອາດຈະເປັນລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຊິ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເພີ່ມ {productname} ເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use {productname} to help you install an operating "
"system and register it to {productname} in one go.  This method is partially "
"or totally automated, so you can save time answering installer questions, "
"and is especially useful if you have many clients you want to install and "
"register."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າ {productname} ພ້ອມກັນໃນບາດດຽວ. ວິທີນີ້ເປັນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດບາງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານປະຢັດເວລາໃນການຕອບຄຳຖາມຂອງຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຖ້າທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:4
msgid "There are several ways to install an operating system from {productname}:"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈາກ {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:5
msgid "in-place, on clients that are already registered;"
msgstr "ແບບ in-place, ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:6
msgid "over the network, using PXE boot;"
msgstr "ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE boot;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"preparing an installation CD-ROM or an USB key, and then going to the "
"machine to boot on that medium;"
msgstr "ການຕຽມ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB key ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເຄື່ອງເພື່ອບູດຜ່ານສື່ນັ້ນ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:8
msgid "as part of the {productname} {smr} solution."
msgstr "ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຊລູຊັນ {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The in-place reinstallation method assumes that a previous operating system "
"has already been installed on the client, and that the client has already "
"been registered to {productname}."
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ແບບ in-place ສົມມຸດວ່າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ, ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For information about the in-place installation method, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-reinstall.adoc[Reinstall Registered "
"Systems]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ in-place, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-reinstall.adoc[Reinstall Registered Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The network boot installation method works on unformatted machines.  "
"However, it can only be performed in certain network configurations:"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານການບູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ Format. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍບາງຢ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:12
msgid ""
"the {productname} Server, or one of its proxies, are on the same local "
"network as the machine you want to install, or you have a DHCP relay that "
"allows you to cross all routers in between;"
msgstr "{productname} Server, ຫຼື Proxy ຂອງມັນ, ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (LAN) ດຽວກັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ທ່ານມີ DHCP relay ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜ່ານ router ຕ່າງໆລະຫວ່າງກາງໄດ້;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:13
msgid "you are able to set up a new DHCP server or to configure an existing one;"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ DHCP server ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້;"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"the client to install is able to boot with PXE, and you can configure it to "
"do so."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສາມາດບູດດ້ວຍ PXE ໄດ້, ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດແນວນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For information about the network boot method, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[Install via the Network]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The removable medium method allows you to bypass these network constraints.  "
"However, it assumes the machine is able to read CD-ROMs or USB keys, and "
"boot from them.  It also requires physical access to the client machine."
msgstr "ວິທີການໃຊ້ສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຂ້າມຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າເຄື່ອງນັ້ນສາມາດອ່ານ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB key ໄດ້, ແລະ ບູດຈາກພວກມັນໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງຕ້ອງການການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For information about the removable media method, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[Install via a CD-ROM or a USB "
"key]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[Install via a CD-ROM or a USB key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For information about the {productname} {smr} approach, see "
"xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[Retail Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແນວທາງ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງ xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[Retail Guide]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation of {ubuntu} and {debian} clients is not supported.  These "
"operating systems must be installed manually."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {ubuntu} ແລະ {debian} ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The autoinstallation features of {productname} are based on a software named "
"{cobbler}.  For more information about {cobbler}, see "
"https://cobbler.readthedocs.io."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນອີງຕາມຊອບແວທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {cobbler}, ເບິ່ງ https://cobbler.readthedocs.io."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{suse} only supports {cobbler} functions that are available in the "
"{productname} {webui}, or through the {productname} API.  The sole "
"command-line command supported by Cobbler is [command]``buildiso``.  Only "
"supported features are documented here."
msgstr "{suse} ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຟັງຊັນຂອງ {cobbler} ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ຫຼື ຜ່ານ {productname} API ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄຳສັ່ງ command-line ດຽວທີ່ Cobbler ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ [command]``buildiso``. ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ມີການບັນທຶກໄວ້ຢູ່ນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Your Own GPG Key"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄີ GPG ຂອງທ່ານເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the repositories you are using for autoinstallation have unsigned "
"metadata, you usually have to use the [option]``insecure=1`` kernel "
"parameter as an option of the autoinstallable distribution, and use a "
"[path]``spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks`` code snippet in the {ay} "
"installation file."
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບແພັກເກດ (repositories) ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດມີ metadata ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນຊື່, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີ kernel [option]``insecure=1`` ເປັນຕົວເລືອກຂອງ autoinstallable distribution, ແລະ ໃຊ້ code snippet [path]``spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:3
msgid "A safer alternative is to provide your own GPG key."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກທີ່ປອດໄພກວ່າແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄີ GPG ຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:4
msgid "This technique applies to {suse} clients only."
msgstr "ເຕັກນິກນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ {suse} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Include your own GPG key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລວມເອົາ GPG key ຂອງທ່ານເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:6
msgid "Create a GPG key."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີ GPG."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:7
msgid "Use it to sign the package's metadata."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເຊັນຊື່ metadata ຂອງແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:8
msgid "Add it to the initial RAM disk of your installation media."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ initial RAM disk ຂອງສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For information on how to create the key and sign the metadata with it, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[Signing Repository Metadata]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການສ້າງຄີ ແລະ ເຊັນຊື່ metadata ດ້ວຍຄີນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[Signing Repository Metadata]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For information on how to add the key to installation media used for network "
"boot, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc#gpg-key-pxeboot[Own GPG "
"Key for PXE Boot]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເພີ່ມຄີເຂົ້າໃນສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc#gpg-key-pxeboot[GPG Key ຂອງຕົນເອງສຳລັບ PXE Boot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information on how to add the key to installation media used for a boot "
"from CD-ROM, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc#gpg-key-cdrom[Own GPG Key "
"in a CD-ROM]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເພີ່ມຄີເຂົ້າໃນສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບູດຈາກ CD-ROM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc#gpg-key-cdrom[GPG Key ຂອງຕົນເອງໃນ CD-ROM]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When you signed the metadata with your new GPG key, any already onboarded "
"client will not know about the new key.  Ideally, you should sign the "
"metadata before you register any client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊັນຊື່ metadata ດ້ວຍຄີ GPG ໃໝ່, ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄປແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຄີໃໝ່ນີ້. ຕາມຫຼັກການແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນເຊັນຊື່ metadata ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໃດໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For already onboarded clients that use those repositories, the workaround is "
"to disable GPG key checking on them."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄປແລ້ວ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແມ່ນການປິດການກວດສອບຄີ GPG ໃນເຄື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Own GPG Key for PXE Boot"
msgstr "GPG Key ຂອງຕົນເອງສຳລັບ PXE Boot"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The initial RAM disk ([path]``initrd``) used by PXE boot process normally "
"contains {suse}'s GPG key only.  You must add our own key to this file, so "
"it can be used to check the packages."
msgstr "Initial RAM disk ([path]``initrd``) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຂະບວນການ PXE boot ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ GPG key ຂອງ {suse} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄີຂອງພວກເຮົາເອງເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Add a GPG key to the initial RAM disk"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເພີ່ມ GPG key ເຂົ້າໃນ initial RAM disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Create a directory with a path identical to the one that is used during the "
"boot process to find the GPG key:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງຄືກັນກັບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ຂະບວນການບູດເພື່ອຊອກຫາ GPG key:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p tftproot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys\n"
msgstr "mkdir -p tftproot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:28
msgid "Copy your GPG key into this directory with the suffix [path]``.asc``:"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ GPG key ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ [path]``.asc``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp /srv/www/htdocs/pub/mgr-gpg-pub.key "
"tftproot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys/mgr-gpg-pub.asc\n"
msgstr "cp /srv/www/htdocs/pub/mgr-gpg-pub.key tftproot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys/mgr-gpg-pub.asc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Inside the top level directory, package the content and append it to the "
"[path]``initrd`` that is part of your installation media files:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີລະດັບສູງສຸດ, ໃຫ້ຈັດແພັກເກດເນື້ອໃນ ແລະ ຕື່ມມັນຕໍ່ທ້າຍ [path]``initrd`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd tftproot\n"
"find . | cpio -o -H newc | xz --check=crc32 -c >> /path/to/initrd\n"
msgstr ""
"cd tftproot\n"
"find . | cpio -o -H newc | xz --check=crc32 -c >> /path/to/initrd\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Own GPG key in a CD-ROM"
msgstr "GPG key ຂອງຕົນເອງໃນ CD-ROM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can modify an installation image with the [command]``mksusecd`` "
"utility.  This utility is contained in the Development Tools module."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ installation image ໄດ້ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mksusecd``. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນໂມດູນ Development Tools."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Add a GPG key to an Installation ISO image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເພີ່ມ GPG key ເຂົ້າໃນ Installation ISO image"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p initrdroot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys\n"
msgstr "mkdir -p initrdroot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp /srv/www/htdocs/pub/mgr-gpg-pub.key "
"initrdroot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys/mgr-gpg-pub.asc\n"
msgstr "cp /srv/www/htdocs/pub/mgr-gpg-pub.key initrdroot/usr/lib/rpm/gnupg/keys/mgr-gpg-pub.asc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:30
msgid "Amend the existing ISO image with [command]``mksusecd``:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ ISO image ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວດ້ວຍ [command]``mksusecd``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "mksusecd --create <new-image>.iso --initrd initrdroot/ <old-image>.iso\n"
msgstr "mksusecd --create <new-image>.iso --initrd initrdroot/ <old-image>.iso\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:2
msgid ""
"An autoinstallation profile determines how the operating system will be "
"installed.  For example, you can specify additional kernel parameters to be "
"passed to the installer."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະກຳນົດວ່າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແນວໃດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸພາລາມິເຕີເຄີເນລເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອສົ່ງໄປຫາຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The most important part of the profile is the \"autoinstallation file.\" "
"When you perform an installation manually, you must provide information to "
"the installer, such as partitioning and networking information and user "
"details.  The autoinstallation file is a method of providing this "
"information in a scripted form.  This type of file is sometimes also "
"referred to as an \"answers file.\""
msgstr "ສ່ວນທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຂອງ profile ແມ່ນ \"autoinstallation file.\" ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນແກ່ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ ເຊັ່ນ ຂໍ້ມູນການແບ່ງ Partition, ຂໍ້ມູນເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຜູ້ໃຊ້. autoinstallation file ແມ່ນວິທີການໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ script. ໄຟລ໌ປະເພດນີ້ບາງຄັ້ງກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ \"answers file.\""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Within {productname}, you can use two different types of profiles, depending "
"on the operating system of the clients you want to install:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ສອງປະເພດ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:5
msgid "For {sle} or {opensuse} clients, use {ay}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {sle} ຫຼື {opensuse}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:6
msgid "For {rhel} clients, use {kickstart}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ {kickstart}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can use both {ay} and {kickstart} profiles if you want to install "
"clients with different operating systems."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ທັງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay} ແລະ {kickstart} ໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For information about how to declare profiles, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#declare-profile[Declare the "
"Profile]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປະກາດໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#declare-profile[Declare the Profile]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For information about {ay} profiles, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For information about {kickstart} profiles, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart "
"Profiles]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The autoinstallation file contained in the profile can include variables and "
"code snippets.  For information about variables and code snippets, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#templates-syntax[Templates "
"Syntax]."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສາມາດລວມເອົາຕົວປ່ຽນ (Variables) ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ (Code snippets). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#templates-syntax[Templates Syntax]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare the Profile"
msgstr "ປະກາດໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When you have prepared an autoinstallation file and distribution, you can "
"create profiles to manage autoinstallation on your {productname} Server.  "
"The profile will determine how to install this distribution you selected.  "
"One way to create a profile is to upload an {ay} or {kickstart} file.  "
"Alternatively, for {kickstart} only, you can use the {webui} wizard."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕຽມໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະກຳນົດວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນການອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart}. ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ (ສຳລັບ {kickstart} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ) ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ wizard ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallation Profile by Upload"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການອັບໂຫຼດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Profiles]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:16
msgid "Click btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a name for the profile.  Do not use "
"spaces."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree`` field, select the autoinstallable "
"distribution to use for this profile."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ autoinstallable distribution ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` field, select the type of "
"virtualization to use for this profile, or select ``None`` if you do not "
"want to use this profile to create a new virtual machine."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Virtualization Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງ virtualization ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້, ຫຼື ເລືອກ ``None`` ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ virtual machine ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Copy the contents of your autoinstallation file into the [guimenu]``File "
"Contents`` field, or upload the file directly using the [guimenu]``File to "
"Upload`` field."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານລົງໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File Contents``, ຫຼື ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File to Upload``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about the details to include here, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles] or "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart "
"Profiles]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຈະລວມຢູ່ນີ້, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles] ຫຼື xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to create the profile."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a {kickstart} Profile by Wizard"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ດ້ວຍ Wizard"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:25
msgid "Click btn:[Create Kickstart Profile]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Kickstart Profile]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Base Channel`` field, select the base channel to use for "
"this profile.  This field is populated from the distributions available.  If "
"the base channel you need is not available, check that you have created the "
"distribution correctly."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Base Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຂໍ້ມູນໃນຫ້ອງນີ້ຈະມາຈາກ distributions ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການບໍ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານສ້າງ distribution ຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` field, select the type of "
"virtualization to use for this profile, or select ``None`` for no "
"virtualization."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Virtualization Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງ virtualization, ຫຼື ເລືອກ ``None`` ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ virtualization."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:31
msgid "Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Distribution File Location`` type the path to the "
"installation media installed on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Distribution File Location`` ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:32
msgid "Provide a password for the root user on the client."
msgstr "ລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root user ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Finish]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Finish]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:34
msgid "Review the details of your new profile, and customize as required."
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When you are creating your autoinstallation profile, you can check "
"[guimenu]``Always use the newest Tree for this base channel``.  This setting "
"allows {productname} to automatically pick the latest distribution that is "
"associated with the specified base channel.  If you add new distributions "
"later, {productname} uses the most recently created or modified."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [guimenu]``Always use the newest Tree for this base channel``. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {productname} ເລືອກ distribution ລ້າສຸດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກທ່ານເພີ່ມ distribution ໃໝ່ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໂຕທີ່ສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂລ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Changing the [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` usually requires changes to "
"the profile bootloader and partition options.  This can overwrite your "
"customization.  Verify new or changed settings before saving them, by "
"navigating to the [guimenu]``Partitioning`` tab."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນ [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` ມັກຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນ bootloader ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກພາທິຊັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຂຽນທັບການປັບແຕ່ງຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ກ່ອນບັນທຶກ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Partitioning``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:37
msgid "The kernel options from the distribution and the profile are combined."
msgstr "Kernel options ຈາກດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You can change the details and settings of your autoinstallation profiles by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and clicking the "
"name of the profile you want to edit.  Alternatively, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System List], select the client you want to provision, and "
"navigate to the menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation] subtab."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] ແລະ ກົດທີ່ຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດຕຽມ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "{ay} Profiles"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:40
msgid ""
"An {ay} profile consists of a [guimenu]``Label`` that identifies the "
"profile, an [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree`` that points to an autoinstallable "
"distribution, various options, and, most importantly, an {ay} installation "
"file."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay} ປະກອບມີ [guimenu]``Label`` ທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌, [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree`` ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຍັງ distribution, ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ, ແລະ ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຄື ໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:41
msgid ""
"The {ay} installation file is an XML file that give directions to the {ay} "
"installer.  {ay} calls it a \"control file.\" For the full syntax of {ay} "
"installation files, see "
"https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#cha-configuration-installation-options."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay} ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ XML ທີ່ໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳແກ່ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay}. {ay} ເອີ້ນມັນວ່າ \"control file.\" ສຳລັບໄວຍາກອນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay}, ເບິ່ງ https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#cha-configuration-installation-options."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:42
msgid ""
"{suse} provides templates of {ay} installation files that you can use as a "
"starting point for your own custom files.  You will find the templates at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles in the [path]``{ay}`` "
"directory.  Each of these profiles requires you to set some variables before "
"you use it.  Check the [path]``README`` file included with the script to "
"determine which variables you need.  For more information about using "
"variables in {ay} scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."
msgstr "{suse} ໄດ້ກຳນົດ templates ຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay} ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງເອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາ templates ໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``{ay}``. ແຕ່ລະ profile ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຕົວປ່ຽນກ່ອນທີ່ ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ມັນ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ [path]``README`` ທີ່ລວມມາກັບ script ເພື່ອ ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕົວປ່ຽນໃດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ ຕົວປ່ຽນໃນ scripts {ay}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:43
msgid ""
"These are the most important sections in the {ay} installation file for "
"installing with {productname}:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay} ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:44
msgid "``<add-on>`` allows to add child channels to the installation"
msgstr "``<add-on>`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ເຂົ້າໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See "
"https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Software-Selections-additional "
"with an ``<add-on>`` example\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Software-Selections-additional ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຢ່າງ ``<add-on>``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:46
msgid ""
"``<general>$SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks')</general>` "
"disables signature checks"
msgstr "``<general>$SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks')</general>` ປິດການກວດສອບລາຍເຊັນ (signature checks)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:47
msgid "``<software>`` allows to specify product for the {unifiedinstaller}"
msgstr "``<software>`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດລະບຸຜະລິດຕະພັນສຳລັບ {unifiedinstaller}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-Software with "
"a \"<software>\" example\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-Software ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຢ່າງ \"<software>\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:49
msgid ""
"``<init-scripts "
"config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')</init-scripts>`` "
"allows the client to register to {productname} as a Salt client."
msgstr "``<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')</init-scripts>`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ໃນຖານະ Salt client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For more information about {ay}, see "
"https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {ay}, ເບິ່ງ https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:51
msgid ""
"A more recent, Salt-based alternative to {ay}, is Yomi.  For information "
"about Yomi, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[Install with "
"Yomi]."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໃໝ່ທີ່ອີງຕາມ Salt ແທນ {ay} ແມ່ນ Yomi. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ ກ່ຽວກັບ Yomi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ Yomi]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kickstart Profiles"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ Kickstart"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:53
msgid ""
"{kickstart} profiles offer a large number of configuration options.  To "
"create these profiles, you can upload them, or use a dedicated wizard."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ມີຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດພວກມັນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ wizard ສະເພາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:54
msgid ""
"{kickstart} profiles allow you to use file preservation lists.  If you have "
"many custom configuration files located on a client you want to reinstall "
"with {kickstart}, you can save them as a list, and associate that list with "
"the {kickstart} profile."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ລາຍການຮັກສາໄຟລ໌ (File preservation lists). ຖ້າທ່ານມີໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບກຳນົດເອງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ {kickstart}, ທ່ານສາມາດບັນທຶກພວກມັນເປັນລາຍການ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍການນັ້ນກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a File Preservation List"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງລາຍການຮັກສາໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"File Preservation] and click btn:[Create File Preservation List]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > File Preservation] ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Create File Preservation List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Enter a suitable label, and list absolute paths to all files and directories "
"you want to save."
msgstr "ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມ (Absolute paths) ໄປຫາທຸກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:58
msgid "Click btn:[Create List]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:59
msgid "Include the file preservation list in your {kickstart} profile."
msgstr "ລວມເອົາລາຍການຮັກສາໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and select the profile "
"you want to edit, go to the menu:System Details[File Preservation] subtab, "
"and select the file preservation list to include."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:System Details[File Preservation], ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍການຮັກສາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:61
msgid ""
"File preservation lists are limited to a total size of 1{nbsp}MB.  Special "
"devices like [path]``/dev/hda1`` and [path]``/dev/sda1`` cannot be "
"preserved.  Only use file and directory names, you cannot use regular "
"expression wildcards."
msgstr "ລາຍການຮັກສາໄຟລ໌ຖືກຈຳກັດຂະໜາດລວມບໍ່ເກີນ 1{nbsp}MB. ອຸປະກອນພິເສດເຊັ່ນ [path]``/dev/hda1`` ແລະ [path]``/dev/sda1`` ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັກສາໄວ້ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຫ້າມໃຊ້ regular expression wildcards."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:62
msgid "For more information about Kickstart, see the Red Hat documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Kickstart, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Red Hat."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Templates Syntax"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນແມ່ແບບ (Templates Syntax)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Parts of your installation file are replaced during the installation.  "
"Variables are replaced with single values, and code snippets are replaced "
"with whole sections of text.  Escaped symbols or sections are not replaced."
msgstr "ບາງສ່ວນຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຕົວປ່ຽນ (Variables) ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄ່າດ່ຽວ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ (Code snippets) ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ. ສັນຍະລັກ ຫຼື ພາກສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກ Escaped ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແທນທີ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:65
msgid ""
"A template engine called Cheetah allows {cobbler} to do these replacements.  "
"This mechanism allows you to reinstall large numbers of systems, without "
"having to manually create profiles for each of them."
msgstr "Template engine ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ Cheetah ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {cobbler} ສາມາດແທນທີ່ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ກົນໄກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແຍກແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:66
msgid ""
"You can create autoinstallation variables and code snippets within the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Within a profile, the [guimenu]``Autoinstallation "
"File`` tab allows you to see the result of the substitutions."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ ຊິ້ນສ່ວນໂຄ້ດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ພາຍໃນ {productname} {webui}. ພາຍໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ແຖບ [guimenu]``Autoinstallation File`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນຜົນຂອງການແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:67
msgid ""
"For information about variables, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For information about code snippets, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#code-snippets[Code Snippets]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#code-snippets[Code Snippets]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:69
msgid ""
"For information about escaping symbols or text blocks, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#escaping[Escaping]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການ Escaping ສັນຍະລັກ ຫຼື ບລັອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#escaping[Escaping]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation variables can be used to substitute values into {kickstart} "
"and {ay} profiles.  To define a variable, from the profile, navigate to the "
"[guimenu]``Variables`` subtab, and create a [replaceable]``name=value`` pair "
"in the text box."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ຄ່າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ແລະ {ay}. ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນ, ຈາກໜ້າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Variables``, ແລ້ວສ້າງຄູ່ [replaceable]``name=value`` ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:72
msgid ""
"For example, you could create a variable that holds the IP address of the "
"client, and another that holds the address of its gateway.  Those variables "
"can then be defined for all the clients installed from the same profile.  To "
"do that, add these lines to the [guimenu]``Variables`` text box:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເກັບ IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ອີກໂຕໜຶ່ງທີ່ເກັບ address ຂອງ gateway. ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ. ວິທີການຄື ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Variables``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ipaddr=192.168.0.28\n"
"gateway=192.168.0.1\n"
msgstr ""
"ipaddr=192.168.0.28\n"
"gateway=192.168.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:74
msgid ""
"To use the variable, prepend a [option]``$`` sign in the profile to "
"substitute the value.  For example, the [option]``network`` part of a "
"{kickstart} file may look like the following:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [option]``$`` ທາງໜ້າຊື່ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ຄ່າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສ່ວນ [option]``network`` ຂອງໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ອາດຈະເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"network --bootproto=static --device=eth0 --onboot=on --ip=$ipaddr \\\n"
"  --gateway=$gateway\n"
msgstr ""
"network --bootproto=static --device=eth0 --onboot=on --ip=$ipaddr \\\n"
"  --gateway=$gateway\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:76
msgid ""
"The [option]``$ipaddr`` is resolved to ``192.168.0.28``, and the "
"[option]``$gateway`` to ``192.168.0.1``."
msgstr "[option]``$ipaddr`` ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ ``192.168.0.28``, ແລະ [option]``$gateway`` ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ ``192.168.0.1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In installation files, variables use a hierarchy.  System variables take "
"precedence over profile variables, which in turn take precedence over "
"distribution variables."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ. ຕົວປ່ຽນລະດັບລະບົບ (System variables) ຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າຕົວປ່ຽນລະດັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ແລະ ຕົວປ່ຽນລະດັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າຕົວປ່ຽນລະດັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code Snippets"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ (Code Snippets)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:79
msgid ""
"{productname} comes with a large number of predefined code snippets.  "
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] to "
"see the list of existing snippets."
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ (Code snippets) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Use a snippet by inserting the [option]``$SNIPPET()`` macro in your "
"autoinstallation file.  For example, in {kickstart}:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊິ້ນສ່ວນໂຄ້ດໂດຍການໃສ່ macro [option]``$SNIPPET()`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງໃນ {kickstart}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "$SNIPPET('spacewalk/rhel_register_script')\n"
msgstr "$SNIPPET('spacewalk/rhel_register_script')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:82
msgid "Or, in {ay}:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ໃນ {ay}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  $SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_register_script')\n"
"</init-scripts>\n"
msgstr ""
"<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  $SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_register_script')\n"
"</init-scripts>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:84
msgid ""
"The macro is parsed by {cobbler} and substituted with the contents of the "
"snippet.  You can also store your own code snippets to use in "
"autoinstallation files later on.  Click btn:[Create Snippet] to create a new "
"code snippet."
msgstr "Macro ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍ {cobbler} ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນນັ້ນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນຂອງທ່ານເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້. ກົດ btn:[Create Snippet] ເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:85
msgid ""
"This example sets up a {kickstart} snippet for a common hard drive partition "
"configuration:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນຂອງ {kickstart} ສຳລັບການແບ່ງພາທິຊັນຮາດດິດທົ່ວໄປ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clearpart --all\n"
"part /boot --fstype ext3 --size=150 --asprimary\n"
"part / --fstype ext3 --size=40000 --asprimary\n"
"part swap --recommended\n"
msgstr ""
"clearpart --all\n"
"part /boot --fstype ext3 --size=150 --asprimary\n"
"part / --fstype ext3 --size=40000 --asprimary\n"
"part swap --recommended\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "part pv.00 --size=1 --grow\n"
msgstr "part pv.00 --size=1 --grow\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"volgroup vg00 pv.00\n"
"logvol /var --name=var vgname=vg00 --fstype ext3 --size=5000\n"
msgstr ""
"volgroup vg00 pv.00\n"
"logvol /var --name=var vgname=vg00 --fstype ext3 --size=5000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:89
msgid "Use the snippet with, for example:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນດັ່ງນີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "$SNIPPET('my_partition')\n"
msgstr "$SNIPPET('my_partition')\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "Escaping"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂ້າມ (Escaping)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:92
msgid ""
"If the autoinstallation file contains shell script variables like "
"``$(example)``, the content needs to be escaped with a backslash: "
"``\\$(example)``.  Escaping the ``$`` symbol prevents the templating engine "
"from evaluating the symbol as an internal variable."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດມີຕົວປ່ຽນ shell script ເຊັ່ນ ``$(example)``, ເນື້ອໃນນັ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກ escaped ດ້ວຍ backslash: ``\\$(example)``. ການ escaping ສັນຍະລັກ ``$`` ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ template engine ຕີຄວາມໝາຍສັນຍະລັກນັ້ນເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນ."

#.  FIXME 2023-09-12, ke: "#raw" or "#end raw"?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:93
msgid ""
"Text blocks such as code fragments or scripts can be escaped by wrapping "
"them with the ``\\#raw`` and ``\\#end raw`` directives.  For example:"
msgstr "ບລັອກຂໍ້ຄວາມເຊັ່ນ ສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ສະຄຣິບ ສາມາດຖືກ escaped ໄດ້ໂດຍການຫຸ້ມດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``\\#raw`` ແລະ ``\\#end raw``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#.  FIXME 2023-09-12, ke: "#raw" or "#end raw"?
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#raw\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"for i in {0..2}; do\n"
" echo \"$i - Hello World!\"\n"
"done\n"
"#end raw\n"
msgstr ""
"#raw\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"for i in {0..2}; do\n"
" echo \"$i - Hello World!\"\n"
"done\n"
"#end raw\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Any line with a ``#`` symbol followed by a whitespace is treated as a "
"comment and is therefore not evaluated.  For example:"
msgstr "ແຖວໃດທີ່ມີສັນຍະລັກ ``#`` ຕາມດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຄຳເຫັນ (comment) ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# start some section (this is a comment)\n"
"echo \"Hello, world\"\n"
"# end some section (this is a comment)\n"
msgstr ""
"# start some section (this is a comment)\n"
"echo \"Hello, world\"\n"
"# end some section (this is a comment)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install via the Network (PXE Boot)"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (PXE Boot)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:2
msgid "During a network boot installation:"
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານການບູດເຄືອຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:3
msgid "The client boots in PXE mode."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍບູດໃນໂໝດ PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A DHCP server provides the client with an IP address and mask, the address "
"of an installation server, and the name of a bootloader file on that server."
msgstr "DHCP server ຈະໃຫ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ mask ແກ່ client, ທີ່ຢູ່ ຂອງເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ bootloader ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີບເວີນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The client downloads the bootloader file via the TFTP protocol from the "
"installation server and executes it."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ bootloader ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ TFTP ຈາກເຊີເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The client is presented with a choice of possible profiles to install from a "
"menu, or starts automatically installing one of the profiles."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈະສະແດງເມນູໃຫ້ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕິດຕັ້ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The client downloads via the TFTP protocol a kernel and an initial RAM disk "
"for the distribution matching that profile."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍດາວໂຫຼດ kernel ແລະ initial RAM disk ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ TFTP ສຳລັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ກົງກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The installation kernel starts an installation program, either {kickstart} "
"or {ay}.  From now on it uses resources provided on the server via the HTTP "
"protocol."
msgstr "Kernel ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ {kickstart} ຫຼື {ay}. ຈາກນັ້ນເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນເຊີເວີຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ HTTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The distribution is installed automatically according to the {kickstart} or "
"{ay} profile."
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ຫຼື {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The profile calls a code snippet that registers the client to the "
"{productname} Server, either as a traditional or Salt client."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮຽກໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຄລາຍເອນກັບ {productname} Server, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ຫຼື ຄລາຍເອນ Salt."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler_menu.png"
msgstr "cobbler_menu.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The installation server can either be the {productname} Server or one of its "
"proxies.  To install from a proxy, you must synchronize the TFTP tree "
"between the server and the proxy before you begin."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ {productname} Server ຫຼື proxy ຂອງມັນ. ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກ proxy, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (synchronize) TFTP tree ລະຫວ່າງ server ແລະ proxy ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The DHCP server may also provide other configuration information to the "
"client, like a host name, the address of a router and the address of a "
"domain name server.  Some of this information might be needed for the "
"autoinstallation, for example if you specify the installation server by its "
"domain name."
msgstr "DHCP server ອາດຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການກຳນົດຄ່າອື່ນໆແກ່ client ນຳ, ເຊັ່ນ host name, ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ router ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ domain name server. ຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນ ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດ ເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ domain name ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the PXE boot menu, the first choice is [guimenu]``Local boot``.  If you "
"select this, the boot process continues from the local disk drives.  This "
"option is selected automatically if no profile was selected after a certain "
"time.  This is a security measure to prevent from starting an "
"autoinstallation if no human operator is there to select one of the "
"profiles."
msgstr "ໃນເມນູ PXE boot, ທາງເລືອກທຳອິດແມ່ນ [guimenu]``Local boot``. ຖ້າທ່ານ ເລືອກອັນນີ້, ຂະບວນການບູດຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ຈາກດິດໃນເຄື່ອງ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ ຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກ profile ໃດໆ ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກບໍ່ມີຜູ້ປະຕິບັດການຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນເພື່ອເລືອກ profile."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the installation can start automatically from one of the "
"profiles without manual intervention.  This is called \"unattended "
"provisioning.\""
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີຄົນມາຈັດການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"unattended provisioning.\""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The \"bare metal\" functionality is a kind of unattended provisioning based "
"on PXE boot.  In this scenario, the bootloader file only registers the "
"client at the {productname} Server and does not start the installation.  You "
"can then trigger an in-place reinstallation later."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ \"bare metal\" ແມ່ນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງ unattended provisioning ທີ່ອີງຕາມ PXE boot. ໃນສະຖານະການນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ bootloader ພຽງແຕ່ລົງທະບຽນ client ທີ່ {productname} Server ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດ ສັ່ງໃຫ້ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່ແບບ in-place ໃນພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing with PXE Boot"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ PXE Boot"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Prepare the DHCP server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#prepare-the-dhcp-server[Prepare "
"the DHCP Server]."
msgstr "ກະກຽມ DHCP server, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#prepare-the-dhcp-server[ກະກຽມ DHCP Server]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Prepare an autoinstallable distribution, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable "
"Distributions]."
msgstr "ຕຽມດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Prepare an autoinstallation profile, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "ຕຽມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:21
msgid "Reboot the client, and chose a profile to install."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ (Reboot), ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Some other steps are optional. To use a proxy as the installation server, "
"see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#synchronize-the-tftp-tree-with-proxies[Synchronize "
"the TFTP Tree with Proxies]. For unattended provisioning, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[Unattended Provisioning]."
msgstr "ບາງຂັ້ນຕອນອື່ນໆແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ proxy ເປັນເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#synchronize-the-tftp-tree-with-proxies[ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ TFTP Tree ກັບ Proxies]. ສຳລັບ unattended provisioning, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[Unattended Provisioning]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the DHCP Server"
msgstr "ກະກຽມ DHCP Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The PXE boot process uses DHCP to find the TFTP server.  The {productname} "
"Server or its proxies can act as such a TFTP server."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການ PXE boot ໃຊ້ DHCP ເພື່ອຊອກຫາ TFTP server. {productname} Server ຫຼື proxy ຂອງມັນ ສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ TFTP server ດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You must have administrative access to the network’s DHCP server.  Edit the "
"DHCP configuration file so that it points to the installation server as the "
"TFTP boot server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດໃນການບໍລິຫານ DHCP server ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ແກ້ໄຂ ໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າ DHCP ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຊີ້ໄປຫາເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ໃນຖານະ TFTP boot server."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Configuring the ISC DHCP Server"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າ ISC DHCP Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:27
msgid "On the DHCP server, as root, open the [path]``/etc/dhcpd.conf`` file."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ DHCP server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/dhcpd.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:28
msgid "Modify the declaration for your client:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການປະກາດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  host myclient { (...)\n"
"                  next-server 192.168.2.1;\n"
"                  filename \"pxelinux.0\"; }\n"
msgstr ""
"  host myclient { (...)\n"
"                  next-server 192.168.2.1;\n"
"                  filename \"pxelinux.0\"; }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:30
msgid "Save the file and restart the [systemitem]``dhcpd`` service."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຣີສະຕາດບໍລິການ [systemitem]``dhcpd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:31
msgid ""
"This example directs the PXE client ``myclient`` to the installation server "
"at ``192.168.2.1`` and instructs it to retrieve the [path]``pxelinux.0`` "
"bootloader file."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຈະນຳພາ PXE client ``myclient`` ໄປຫາເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ທີ່ ``192.168.2.1`` ແລະ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ມັນໄປເອົາໄຟລ໌ bootloader [path]``pxelinux.0``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if your DHCP server is registered at {productname}, you can "
"configure it using the DHCPd formula instead:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ຖ້າ DHCP server ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຢູ່ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດ ກຳນົດຄ່າມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ DHCPd formula ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Configuring the ISC DHCP Server Using the DHCPd Formula"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າ ISC DHCP Server ໂດຍໃຊ້ DHCPd Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select the client you want to change, "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab to enable the DHCPd formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ເລືອກ client ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ DHCPd formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Go to the formula's [guimenu]``Dhcpd`` tab, and in the [guimenu]``Next "
"Server`` field, enter the hostname or IP address of the installation server."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Dhcpd`` ຂອງ formula, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Next Server``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ hostname ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີບເວີການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename EFI`` field, type [path]``grub/shim.efi`` to "
"enable EFI PXE support."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filename EFI``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [path]``grub/shim.efi`` ເພື່ອ ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ EFI PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filename`` field, type [path]``pxelinux.0`` to enable "
"legacy BIOS support."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filename``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [path]``pxelinux.0`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ ການຮອງຮັບ BIOS ແບບເກົ່າ (legacy BIOS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:39
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If you do not use Secure Boot, type [path]``grub/grubx86.efi`` instead of "
"[path]``grub/shim.efi`` in the [guimenu]``Filename EFI`` field."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ Secure Boot, ໃຫ້ພິມ [path]``grub/grubx86.efi`` ແທນ [path]``grub/shim.efi`` ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filename EFI``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:41
msgid "For different architectures, see table <<grub-efi-arch>>."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງ <<grub-efi-arch>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:42
msgid "Using {cobbler} managed DHCP is unsupported with {productname}."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ DHCP ທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {cobbler} ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:43
msgid ""
"This sets up a global PXE server for all the hosts, you can also have "
"per-host settings.  For more information about the DHCPd formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[DHCPd Formula]."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ PXE server ແບບທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບທຸກ hosts, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ host ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ DHCPd formula, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[DHCPd Formula]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize the TFTP Tree with Proxies"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (Synchronize) TFTP Tree ກັບ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:45
msgid ""
"You can synchronize the TFTP tree on the {productname} Server with the "
"{productname} Proxy.  For synchronization, HTTPS port 443 must be open."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ TFTP tree ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server ກັບ {productname} Proxy ໄດ້. ສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌, ພອດ HTTPS 443 ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:46
msgid "Every added proxy slows down the tree synchronization."
msgstr "ທຸກໆ proxy ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ tree ຊ້າລົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing TFTP between Server and Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ TFTP ລະຫວ່າງ Server ແລະ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:48
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"[systemitem]``susemanager-tftpsync`` package:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``susemanager-tftpsync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install susemanager-tftpsync\n"
msgstr "zypper install susemanager-tftpsync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:50
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"[systemitem]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv`` package:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Proxy, ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``susemanager-tftpsync-recv``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"
msgstr "zypper install susemanager-tftpsync-recv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:52
msgid ""
"On the proxy, as root, run the [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` script.  "
"The script interactively asks you for details on the host names and IP "
"addresses of the {productname} Server and Proxy, as well for the location of "
"the [path]``tftpboot`` directory on the Proxy. For more information, use the "
"[command]``configure-tftpsync.sh --help`` command."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ proxy, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຣັນ script [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``. script ຈະຖາມລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບ host names ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy, ລວມທັງສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``tftpboot`` ຢູ່ເທິງ Proxy. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh --help``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:53
msgid "On the server, as root, run the [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` script."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຣັນ script [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-tftpsync.sh proxy1.example.com proxy2.example.com\n"
msgstr "configure-tftpsync.sh proxy1.example.com proxy2.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Run the [command]``cobbler sync`` command on the server to push the files to "
"the proxy.  This fails if you have not configured the proxies correctly."
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler sync`` ຢູ່ເທິງ server ເພື່ອສົ່ງ (push) ໄຟລ໌ໄປຍັງ proxy. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ proxies ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If you want to change the list of proxies later on, you can use the "
"[command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` script to edit them."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນລາຍການຂອງ proxies ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ script [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If you reinstall an already configured proxy and want to push all the files "
"again, you must remove the cache file at "
"[path]``/var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json`` before you call [command]``cobbler "
"sync``."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ proxy ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດ ອີກຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລຶບໄຟລ໌ cache ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ [command]``cobbler sync``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:58
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "GRUB EFI binary names for different architectures"
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ GRUB EFI ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Architecture | GRUB EFI binary name\n"
"| aarch64      | grubaa64.efi\n"
"| x86-64       | grubx86.efi\n"
"| ppc64le      | grub.ppc64le\n"
msgstr ""
"| ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ | ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ GRUB EFI\n"
"| aarch64      | grubaa64.efi\n"
"| x86-64       | grubx86.efi\n"
"| ppc64le      | grub.ppc64le\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reinstall Registered Systems"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The in-place reinstallation starts from the local client system.  There is "
"therefore no need for the client to be able to boot over network with PXE."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່ແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າ (In-place) ແມ່ນເລີ່ມຈາກລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃນເອງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To reinstall a registered client in-place, you must define an "
"autoinstallable distribution and an autoinstallation profile.  For "
"information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable "
"Distributions] and "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່ແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Distribution) ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions] ແລະ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you have defined the autoinstallation profile and distribution, you can "
"perform the reinstallation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstall an Already Registered Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client to reinstall, and go to the menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > "
"Schedule] subtab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Systems List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Select the autoinstallation profile that you prepared, select a proxy if "
"needed, and click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ທ່ານກຽມໄວ້, ເລືອກພຣັອກຊີຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If your client is a traditional client, and you have not configured osad, "
"you need to wait until the job is fetched."
msgstr "ຖ້າ client ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນ traditional client, ແລະ ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ osad, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າໜ້າວຽກຈະຖືກດຶງໄປປະມວນຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can monitor progress of the installation by navigating to "
"menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Session Status], or on the client "
"directly.  The client reboots, and in the boot menu selects a new choice "
"called [guimenu]``reinstall-system``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Session Status], ຫຼື ເບິ່ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ. ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຣີບູດ, ແລະ ໃນເມນູບູດຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [guimenu]``reinstall-system``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "autoinstall_reinstall.png"
msgstr "autoinstall_reinstall.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:11
msgid "The installation then proceeds over HTTP protocol."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະດຳເນີນການຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄອນ HTTP."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unattended Provisioning"
msgstr "ການຈັດສັນລະບົບແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Unattended Provisioning)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The \"bare metal\" functionality allows you to register any new machine as "
"soon as it connects to the local network, using a generic PXE boot image.  "
"You then go to {productname} {webui} and assign a profile to this machine.  "
"The next time the client boots, the operating system is installed according "
"to that profile.  For information about the bare metal provisioning, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc#bare-metal[Bare Metal "
"Provisioning]."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ \"bare metal\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ທັນທີທີ່ມັນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ generic PXE boot image. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ກຳນົດ profile ໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງນີ້. ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ client ບູດ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຕາມ profile ນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ bare metal provisioning, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc#bare-metal[Bare Metal Provisioning]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If you do not want to use the bare metal functionality, you can still "
"declare manually the system at {productname}.  The {productname} API allows "
"you to create system records for systems as if they were collected by the "
"bare metal functionality.  For information about declaring systems with the "
"API, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc#create-system-record[Create "
"a System Record Manually]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ bare metal, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປະກາດ ລະບົບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຢູ່ທີ່ {productname}. {productname} API ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ ສ້າງບັນທຶກລະບົບ (system records) ຄືກັບວ່າພວກມັນຖືກເກັບກຳໂດຍ ຟັງຊັນ bare metal. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປະກາດລະບົບດ້ວຍ API, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc#create-system-record[ສ້າງບັນທຶກລະບົບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bare Metal Provisioning"
msgstr "Bare Metal Provisioning"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When you have the bare metal provisioning option enabled, any client "
"connected to the {productname} network is automatically added to the "
"organization as soon as it is powered on.  When this operation is complete, "
"the client is shut down, and it appears in the [guimenu]``Systems`` list, "
"ready to be installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ bare metal provisioning, client ໃດໆທີ່ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ {productname} ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ທັນທີທີ່ເຄື່ອງຖືກເປີດ. ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳເລັດ, client ຈະຖືກປິດເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ມັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ [guimenu]``Systems``, ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enable the Bare Metal Functionality"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ Bare Metal"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Bare-metal systems]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bare-metal systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:8
msgid "Click btn:[Enable adding to this organization]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Enable adding to this organization]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:9
msgid ""
"New clients that are powered on are added to the organization that belongs "
"to the administrator who enabled the bare metal feature.  They are of "
"\"bootstrap\" type, and still need to be provisioned to become regular "
"clients."
msgstr "ຄລາຍເອນໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກເປີດເຄື່ອງແມ່ນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນທີ່ເປັນຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ bare metal.  ພວກມັນເປັນປະເພດ \"bootstrap\", ແລະ ຍັງຄົງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດສັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຄລາຍເອນປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To change the organization new clients are added to, disable the bare metal "
"feature, log in as the administrator of the new organization, and then "
"re-enable the feature.  You can migrate already registered systems to other "
"organizations, using the [guilabel]``Migrate`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນອົງກອນທີ່ client ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ, ໃຫ້ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດ bare metal, ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ບໍລິຫານຂອງອົງກອນໃໝ່, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເປີດໃຊ້ ຄຸນສົມບັດຄືນໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວໄປຍັງ ອົງກອນອື່ນໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບ [guilabel]``Migrate``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can use the system set manager (SSM) with clients that are registered "
"that way.  However, not all SSM features are available for those clients, "
"because they do not yet have an operating system installed.  This also "
"applies to mixed sets that include systems registered that way.  All "
"features become available to the set when all the clients in the set have "
"been provisioned.  For more information on SSM, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ system set manager (SSM) ກັບ clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ ດ້ວຍວິທີນັ້ນໄດ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ SSM ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ clients ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າພວກມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຕິດຕັ້ງເທື່ອ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງ ລວມເຖິງກຸ່ມປະສົມ (mixed sets) ທີ່ລວມມີລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍວິທີນັ້ນນຳ. ທຸກ ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອ clients ທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດຕັ້ງລະບົບແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SSM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Provision \"Bootstrap\" Type clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈັດຕັ້ງລະບົບ (Provision) clients ປະເພດ \"Bootstrap\""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, select the "
"client to provision, and go to the menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດຕັ້ງລະບົບ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Select the {ay} profile to use, and click btn:[Create PXE installation "
"configuration].  This option creates a system entry at {cobbler}."
msgstr "ເລືອກ profile {ay} ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create PXE installation configuration]. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະສ້າງລາຍການລະບົບຢູ່ທີ່ {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:15
msgid "Power on the client."
msgstr "ເປີດເຄື່ອງ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The server uses TFTP to provision the new client, so the appropriate port "
"and networks must be configured correctly for provisioning to be successful."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີໃຊ້ TFTP ເພື່ອຈັດສັນຄລາຍເອນໃໝ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພອດ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເໝາະສົມຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຈັດສັນປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a System Record Manually"
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນທຶກລະບົບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can use an API call to declare an association between a client "
"identified by its MAC address and an autoinstallation profile.  Next time "
"the system reboots, it starts the installation based on the specified "
"profile."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນ API ເພື່ອປະກາດການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ (ລະບຸດ້ວຍທີ່ຢູ່ MAC) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເມື່ອລະບົບບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, ມັນຈະເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstallation From a Manually Declared Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່ຈາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປະກາດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use the "
"[systemitem]``system.createSystemRecord`` API call.  In this example, "
"replace [literal]``name`` with the name of your client, "
"[literal]``<profile>`` with the profile label, [literal]``<iface>`` with the "
"name of the interface on the client such as [literal]``eth0``, and "
"[literal]``<hw_addr>`` with its hardware address such as "
"[literal]``00:25:22:71:e7:c6``:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນ API [systemitem]``system.createSystemRecord``. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [literal]``name`` ເປັນຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, [literal]``<profile>`` ເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌, [literal]``<iface>`` ເປັນຊື່ interface ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``eth0``, ແລະ [literal]``<hw_addr>`` ເປັນ hardware address ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``00:25:22:71:e7:c6``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<name>\", \"<profile>\", \"\", \"\", \\\n"
"  [ {\"name\": \"<iface>\", \"mac\": \"<hw_addr>\"} ]]' \\\n"
"  system.createSystemRecord\n"
msgstr ""
"$ spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<name>\", \"<profile>\", \"\", \"\", \\\n"
"  [ {\"name\": \"<iface>\", \"mac\": \"<hw_addr>\"} ]]' \\\n"
"  system.createSystemRecord\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Power on the client.  It boots from the network, and the correct profile is "
"selected for installation."
msgstr "ເປີດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ມັນຈະບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈະຖືກເລືອກມາໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This command creates a system record at {cobbler}.  You may also specify "
"additional parameters, like kernel options, the IP address of the client, "
"and its domain name.  For more information, see the API documentation for "
"[systemitem]``createSystemRecord call``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ system record ທີ່ {cobbler}. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸພາລາມິເຕີເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ kernel options, IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຊື່ໂດເມນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ເອກະສານ API ສຳລັບ [systemitem]``createSystemRecord call``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic registration of clients created by Terraform"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ clients ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Terraform"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"New clients created by Terraform can be automatically registered to "
"{productname}.  Registration can be achieved in two ways:"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Terraform ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ການລົງທະບຽນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ສອງວິທີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:3
msgid "[literal]``cloud-init`` based registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍອີງຕາມ [literal]``cloud-init``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:4
msgid "remote execution provisioner based registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ remote execution provisioner"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``cloud-init`` based client registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ client ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [literal]``cloud-init``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Registering by leveraging [literal]``cloud-init`` is the preferred way of "
"automatic registering of the newly created virtual machines.  This solution "
"avoids configuring an SSH connection to the host.  It can also be used "
"regardless of the tool used for client creation."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``cloud-init`` ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ virtual machines ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂຊລູຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາໂຮສ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່ານຳໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືໃດໃນການສ້າງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"User can pass the set of user data when deploying the image with Terraform, "
"to automatically register the machine to {productname}.  [path]``user_data`` "
"is run only once at bootstrap, and only the first time the machine is "
"started."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຊຸດຂໍ້ມູນ user data ໃນຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງ image ດ້ວຍ Terraform ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງກັບ {productname} ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. [path]``user_data`` ຈະເຮັດວຽກພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນຕອນ bootstrap ແລະ ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ເຄື່ອງຖືກເປີດຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before using [literal]``cloud-init`` to register clients, the user must "
"configure:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [literal]``cloud-init`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Bootstrap script.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Activation keys.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (Activation keys). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The following command will download the bootstrap script and register the "
"new machine when it is created.  It should be added to the "
"[literal]``cloud-init`` configuration:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``cloud-init``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -s http://hub-server.tf.local/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-default.sh | bash "
"-s\n"
msgstr "curl -s http://hub-server.tf.local/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-default.sh | bash -s\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Anytime [path]``user_data`` is updated to change the provisioning, Terraform "
"will destroy and then recreate the machines with a new IP, etc."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ [path]``user_data`` ຖືກອັບເດດເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຈັດຕັ້ງລະບົບ (provisioning), Terraform ຈະລຶບ (destroy) ແລະ ສ້າງເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ (recreate) ດ້ວຍ IP ໃໝ່, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about [literal]``cloud-init`` on AWS, see "
"https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/template/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [literal]``cloud-init`` ໃນ AWS, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/template/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For a [literal]``cloud-init`` example, see "
"https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/cloudinit/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config#example-usage."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``cloud-init``, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/cloudinit/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config#example-usage"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner based registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍອີງຕາມ [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The second solution for automatic registering of the newly created virtual "
"machines uses Terraform's [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner."
msgstr "ໂຊລູຊັນທີສອງສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ virtual machines ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນການໃຊ້ [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner ຂອງ Terraform."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner interacts with the newly created "
"machines.  It opens an SSH connection and can run commands on that machine."
msgstr "[literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner ຈະໂຕ້ຕອບກັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່. ມັນຈະເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ແລະ ສາມາດຣັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນເຄື່ອງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"When using [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner to register clients, the "
"user must ensure that the machine running Terraform will have access to the "
"new virtual machine after its creation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າເຄື່ອງທີ່ຣັນ Terraform ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ virtual machine ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The remaining requirements are the same as when using "
"<<cloud-init-based-client-registration>>:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຫຼືອແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຕອນໃຊ້ <<cloud-init-based-client-registration>>:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The following command will download the bootstrap script and register the "
"new machine when it is created.  It should be defined as the remote command "
"to run:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫລດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ມັນຄວນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຄຳສັ່ງໄລຍະໄກ (remote command) ທີ່ຈະລັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information about [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner, see "
"https://www.terraform.io/docs/provisioners/remote-exec.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [literal]``remote-exec`` provisioner, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.terraform.io/docs/provisioners/remote-exec.html."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Repository"
msgstr "ຄັງຊອບແວ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A bootstrap repository contains required packages for registering Salt or "
"traditional clients during bootstrapping, as well as packages for installing "
"Salt on clients.  When products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are "
"automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຄັງຊອບແວ bootstrap (bootstrap repository) ປະກອບດ້ວຍແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ ການລົງທະບຽນ Salt ຫຼື traditional clients ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດ bootstrapping, ລວມທັງແພັກເກດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt ໃນ clients. ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (synchronized), ຄັງຊອບແວ bootstrap ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Create a Bootstrap Repository"
msgstr "ກະກຽມເພື່ອສ້າງຄັງຊອບແວ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you select a product for synchronization, the bootstrap repository is "
"automatically created as soon as all mandatory channels are fully mirrored."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ຄັງ bootstrap ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີທີ່ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຖືກເຮັດສຳເນົາ (mirrored) ສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options for Automatic Mode"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບໂໝດອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can change how the automated bootstrap repository creation works.  This "
"section details the various settings."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງວິທີການສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້. ພາກນີ້ຈະລົງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flush Mode::"
msgstr "Flush Mode::"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flush Mode"
msgstr "Flush Mode"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, existing repositories are updated only with the latest "
"packages.  You can configure it to always start with an empty repository "
"instead.  To enable this behavior, add or edit this value in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະຖືກອັບເດດສະເພາະແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າແທນໄດ້. ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຮູບແບບນີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຄ່ານີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_flush = 1\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_flush = 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Mode::"
msgstr "Automatic Mode::"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Mode"
msgstr "Automatic Mode (ໂໝດອັດຕະໂນມັດ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:13
msgid ""
"By default, automated regeneration of the bootstrap repositories is "
"enabled.  To disable it, add or edit this value in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບຸດສະແຕຣັບໃໝ່ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຄ່ານີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.auto_generate_bootstrap_repo = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.auto_generate_bootstrap_repo = 0\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Bootstrap Data File"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The tool uses a data file with information about which packages are required "
"for each distribution.  The data file is stored at "
"[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py``.  {suse} updates this "
"file regularly.  If you want to makes changes to this file, do not edit it "
"directly.  Instead, create a copy in the same directory and edit your copy:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແພັກເກດໃດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ distribution. ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py``. {suse} ຈະອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເປັນປະຈຳ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ນີ້, ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂມັນໂດຍກົງ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ສຳເນົາໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດຽວກັນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂສຳເນົາຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /usr/share/susemanager/\n"
"cp mgr_bootstrap_data.py my_data.py\n"
msgstr ""
"cd /usr/share/susemanager/\n"
"cp mgr_bootstrap_data.py my_data.py\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When you have made your changes, configure {productname} to use the new "
"file.  Add or edit this value in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່. ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຄ່ານີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_datamodule = my_data\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_datamodule = my_data\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the next update, the new data from {suse} overwrites the original data "
"file, not the new one.  You need to keep the new file up to date with "
"changes provided by {suse}."
msgstr "ໃນການອັບເດດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, ຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ຈາກ {suse} ຈະຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປຸງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ທັນສະໄໝຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ {suse} ໃຫ້ມາ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Generate a Bootstrap Repository"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບ (Bootstrap Repository) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:22
msgid ""
"By default, bootstrap repositories are regenerated daily.  You can manually "
"create the bootstrap repository from the command prompt."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຄັງ bootstrap ຈະຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ທຸກມື້. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating the Bootstrap Repository for {sle}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບສຳລັບ {sle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:24
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, list the "
"available distributions to create bootstrap repositories for:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap repository, using the appropriate repository name as "
"the product label:"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຄັງທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-version-x86_64\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-version-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use the number shown next to the distribiution name in the "
"list of available distributions."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໝາຍເລກທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ຂ້າງຊື່ຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍໃນລາຍຊື່ຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The client repository is located in "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/``."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນລູກຂ່າຍຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:30
msgid ""
"If you have mirrored more than one product (for example, SLES and SLES for "
"SAP), or if you use custom channels, you might need to specify the parent "
"channel to use when creating the bootstrap repository.  This is not required "
"in every situation.  For example, some SLES{nbsp}15 versions have common "
"code bases, so there is no need to specify a parent channel.  Use this "
"procedure only if your environment requires it."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເຮັດສຳເນົາ (mirror) ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຜະລິດຕະພັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: SLES ແລະ SLES for SAP), ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (parent channel) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳເປັນໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ບາງເວີຊັນຂອງ SLES{nbsp}15 ມີຖານໂຄ້ດຮ່ວມກັນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL Procedure: Specifying a Parent Channel for a Bootstrap Repository"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທາງເລືອກ: ການລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກສຳລັບຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:32
msgid "Check which parent channels you have available:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານມີຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດແດ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64\n"
"Multiple options for parent channel found. Please use option\n"
"--with-parent-channel <label> and choose one of:\n"
"- sle-product-sles15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sles_sap15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64\n"
"ພົບຕົວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຫຼາຍອັນ. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ\n"
"--with-parent-channel <label> ແລະ ເລືອກອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຈາກ:\n"
"- sle-product-sles15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sles_sap15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:34
msgid "Specify the appropriate parent channel:"
msgstr "ລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64 --with-parent-channel "
"sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64 --with-parent-channel sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repositories with Multiple Architectures"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບທີ່ມີຫຼາຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Multiple Architectures)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:37
msgid ""
"If you are creating bootstrap repositories that include multiple different "
"architectures, you need to be careful that all architectures are updated "
"correctly.  For example, the {x86_64} and {ibmz} architectures for {slea} "
"use the same bootstrap repository URL at "
"``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/sle/15/2/bootstrap/``."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບຸດສະແຕຣັບທີ່ລວມມີຫຼາຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະວັງໃຫ້ທຸກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຖືກອັບເດດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ແລະ {ibmz} ສຳລັບ {slea} ໃຊ້ URL ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບຸດສະແຕຣັບດຽວກັນຢູ່ທີ່ ``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/sle/15/2/bootstrap/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:38
msgid ""
"When the ``flush`` option is enabled, and you attempt to generate the "
"bootstrap repository for multiple architectures, only one architecture is "
"generated.  To avoid this, use the ``--no-flush`` option at the command "
"prompt when creating additional architectures.  For example:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``flush`` ແລະ ທ່ານພະຍາຍາມສ້າງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບຸດສະແຕຣັບສຳລັບຫຼາຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ຈະມີພຽງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``--no-flush`` ທີ່ command prompt ເມື່ອສ້າງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-SP2-x86_64\n"
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --no-flush -c SLE-15-SP2-s390x\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-SP2-x86_64\n"
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --no-flush -c SLE-15-SP2-s390x\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap and Custom Channels"
msgstr "ບູດສະແຕຣັບ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If you are using custom channels, you can use the "
"[option]``--with-custom-channels`` option with the "
"[command]``mgr-create-bootstrap-repo`` command.  In this case, you also need "
"to specify the parent channel to use."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--with-custom-channels`` ຮ່ວມກັບຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-create-bootstrap-repo``. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Automatic creation of a bootstrap repository might fail if you are using "
"custom channels.  In this case, you need to create the repository manually."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດອາດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຄັງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information about custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (Software Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Channels are a method of grouping software packages.  Software packages are "
"provided by repositories, and repositories are associated with channels.  "
"Subscribing a client to a software channel allows the client to install and "
"update any of the software associated with it."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ. ແພັກເກັດຊອບແວແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກຄັງເກັບ (repositories), ແລະ ຄັງເກັບແມ່ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ. ການໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscribe) ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວໃດໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are divided into base channels and child "
"channels.  Organizing channels in this way ensures that only compatible "
"packages are installed on each system.  A client must be subscribed to only "
"one base channel, assigned during registration based on the client operating "
"system and architecture.  For paid channels provided by a vendor, you must "
"have an associated subscription."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນ ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channels) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels). ການຈັດລະບຽບແບບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຈະມີພຽງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ. ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ພຽງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A base channel consists of packages built for a specific operating system "
"type, version, and architecture.  For example, the {sles}{nbsp}15 {x86_64} "
"base channel contains only software compatible with that operating system "
"and architecture."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານປະກອບດ້ວຍແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ {sles}{nbsp}15 {x86_64} ຈະມີພຽງຊອບແວທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A child channel is associated with a base channel and provides only packages "
"that are compatible with the base channel.  A system can be subscribed to "
"multiple child channels of its base channel.  When a system has been "
"assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that system to install "
"the related child channels.  For example, if a system has been assigned to "
"the {sles}{nbsp}15 `x86_64` base channel, they can only install or update "
"packages made available through the compatible base channel, or any of its "
"associated child channels."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍແມ່ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານນັ້ນ. ລະບົບໜຶ່ງສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານຂອງມັນ. ເມື່ອລະບົບຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າລະບົບຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ {sles}{nbsp}15 `x86_64`, ມັນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui} you can browse your available channels by "
"navigating to menu:Software[Channel List > All].  You can modify or create "
"new channels by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui} ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Channel List > All]. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on using channels, including custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ, ລວມທັງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by {phub}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ {phub}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{phub} is an extension to {sle} products that provides additional open "
"source software provided by the {opensuse} community."
msgstr "{phub} ແມ່ນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊອບແວໂອເພັນຊອດ (open source) ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກຊຸມຊົນ {opensuse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The packages in {phub} are provided by the {opensuse} community.  They are "
"not supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດໃນ {phub} ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ {opensuse}. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you are using {sle} operating systems on your clients, you can enable the "
"{phub} extension to access these additional packages.  This provides the "
"{phub} channels, which you can subscribe your clients to."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sle} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ {phub} ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແພັກເກັດເພີ່ມເຕີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງ {phub} ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{phub} provides a large number of packages, which can take a long time to "
"synchronize and consume a large amount of disk space.  Do not enable {phub} "
"unless you require the packages it provides."
msgstr "{phub} ມີແພັກເກັດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ເຊິ່ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລານານໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ຫ້າມເປີດໃຊ້ {phub} ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແພັກເກັດທີ່ມັນໃຫ້ບໍລິການແທ້ໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To avoid unintentionally installing or updating unsupported packages, we "
"recommend that you implement a content lifecycle management strategy that "
"initially denies all {phub} packages.  You can then explicitly enable the "
"specific packages you require.  For more information about content lifecycle "
"management, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານວາງກົນລະຍຸດການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (content lifecycle management) ທີ່ປະຕິເສດແພັກເກັດ {phub} ທັງໝົດໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງຄ່ອຍເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by AppStream"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ AppStream"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For {redhat} based clients, additional packages are available through "
"AppStream.  In most cases, the AppStream packages are required to ensure "
"that you have all the software you need."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {redhat}, ມີແພັກເກັດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ບໍລິການຜ່ານ AppStream. ໃນຫຼາຍໆກໍລະນີ, ແພັກເກັດ AppStream ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຊອບແວທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When you are managing AppStream packages in the {productname} {webui}, you "
"might notice that you see contradicting suggestions for package updates.  "
"This is due to the {productname} not being able to interpret the modular "
"metadata correctly.  You can use the content lifecycle management (CLM) "
"AppStream filter to transform AppStream repositories into non-modular "
"repositories for use with some upgrade operations.  For more information "
"about the CLM AppStream filters, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຈັດການແພັກເກັດ AppStream ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ທ່ານອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນຄຳແນະນຳການອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກ {productname} ບໍ່ສາມາດແປຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata) ແບບໂມດູລາໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຂອງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (CLM) ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄັງເກັບ AppStream ໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນໂມດູລາ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບບາງການດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຕອງ CLM AppStream, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by EPEL"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ EPEL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For {redhat} based clients, additional packages are available through EPEL "
"(extra packages for enterprise Linux).  EPEL is an optional package "
"repository that provides additional software."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {redhat}, ມີແພັກເກັດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ບໍລິການຜ່ານ EPEL (ແພັກເກັດເສີມສຳລັບ Enterprise Linux). EPEL ແມ່ນຄັງແພັກເກັດທາງເລືອກທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The packages in EPEL are provided by the Fedora community.  They are not "
"supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດໃນ EPEL ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ Fedora. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are using {redhat} operating systems on your clients, you can enable "
"the EPEL extension to access these additional packages.  This provides the "
"EPEL channels, which you can subscribe your clients to."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {redhat} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ EPEL ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແພັກເກັດເພີ່ມເຕີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງ EPEL ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"EPEL provides a large number of packages, which can take a long time to "
"synchronize and consume a large amount of disk space.  Do not enable the "
"EPEL repositories unless you require the packages it provides."
msgstr "EPEL ມີແພັກເກັດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ເຊິ່ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລານານໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ຫ້າມເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງ EPEL ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແພັກເກັດທີ່ມັນໃຫ້ບໍລິການແທ້ໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"To avoid unintentionally installing or updating unsupported packages, we "
"recommended that you implement a content lifecycle management (CLM) strategy "
"that initially denies all EPEL packages.  You can then explicitly enable the "
"specific packages you require.  For more information about content lifecycle "
"management, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານວາງກົນລະຍຸດການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (CLM) ທີ່ປະຕິເສດແພັກເກັດ EPEL ທັງໝົດໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງຄ່ອຍເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "{unifiedinstaller} Updates Channels on {sle} Clients"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດ {unifiedinstaller} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {sle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"This channel is used by the {unifiedinstaller} to ensure it is up to date "
"before it installs the operating system.  All {sle} products should have "
"access to the installer updates channel during installation."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ {unifiedinstaller} ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມັນເປັນເວີຊັນລ້າສຸດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ທັງໝົດຄວນຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ installer updates ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For {sles} clients the installer updates channel is synchronized by default "
"when you add a product that contains them, and are enabled when you create "
"an autoinstallable distribution with these product channels."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {sles}, ຊ່ອງທາງ installer updates ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໂດຍປົກກະຕິເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີພວກມັນຢູ່, ແລະ ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For all other {sle} variants, including {sle} for SAP, you must add the "
"installer updates channel manually.  To do this, clone the appropriate "
"{sles} installer updates channel below the base channel of these {sle} "
"variants.  When creating an autoinstallable distribution for these {sle} "
"variants after the channel was cloned, it is used automatically."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລຸ້ນອື່ນໆຂອງ {sle}, ລວມທັງ {sle} for SAP, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ installer updates ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ວິທີເຮັດຄື ໃຫ້ໂຄລນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງ {sles} installer updates ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄວ້ລຸ່ມຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານຂອງລຸ້ນ {sle} ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Configuration Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຄູ່ມືການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Registering clients is the first step after installing {productname}, and "
"most of the time you spend with {productname} is spent on maintaining those "
"clients."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ແລະ ເວລາສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ແມ່ນໝົດໄປກັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} is compatible with a range of client technologies: you can "
"install traditional or Salt clients, running {sle} or another Linux "
"operating system, with a range of hardware options."
msgstr "{productname} ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບເຕັກໂນໂລຊີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ: ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional) ຫຼື Salt, ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} ຫຼື ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ Linux ອື່ນໆ, ພ້ອມກັບຕົວເລືອກຮາດແວທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For a complete list of supported clients and features, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This guide discusses how to register and configure different clients, both "
"manually and automatically."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຕ່າງໆ, ທັງແບບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Operations"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນງານຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In addition to registering, upgrading, or deleting clients other operations "
"can be performed."
msgstr "ນອກເໜືອຈາກການລົງທະບຽນ, ການອັບເກຣດ ຫຼື ການລຶບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ, ຍັງສາມາດດຳເນີນການອື່ນໆໄດ້ອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} clients can be managed individually, or organised in groups "
"using System Set Manager, System Groups or Configuration Management."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດຈັດການເປັນລາຍເຄື່ອງ, ຫຼື ຈັດເປັນກຸ່ມໂດຍໃຊ້ System Set Manager, System Groups ຫຼື Configuration Management."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can obtain Custom System Information, manage Configuration Snapshots or "
"power on, power off, and reboot clients using the SUSE Manager Web UI."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຈັດການ Configuration Snapshots ຫຼື ເປີດ, ປິດ ແລະ ເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ (reboot) ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ SUSE Manager Web UI."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:5
msgid "This section contains detailed description of each of these operation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະການດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register on the Command Line (Salt)"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (Salt)"

#.  Might need an 'unsupported' note? LKB 2019-05-01
#.  cf. https://bugzilla.suse.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1131398
#.  I'd say "no", according to the outcome of
#.  https://github.com/SUSE/spacewalk/issues/9333 KE 2019-12-17
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Instead of the {webui}, you can use the command line to register a Salt "
"client to a proxy.  This procedure requires that you have installed the Salt "
"package on the Salt client before registration.  For SLE 12 based clients, "
"you also must have activated the [systemitem]``Advanced Systems Management`` "
"module."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ {webui}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ກັບພຣັອກຊີ (proxy). ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ Salt ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ອີງຕາມ SLE 12, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [systemitem]``Advanced Systems Management`` ນຳອີກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Registering traditional clients on the command line is also possible, but it "
"requires more steps.  It is not covered here.  Use the bootstrap script "
"procedure to register traditional clients.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-proxy-script.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional) ຜ່ານໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງກໍສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນກວ່າ. ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເວົ້າເຖິງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ (bootstrap script) ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-proxy-script.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:5
msgid "Choose a client configuration file located at:"
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:36
msgid "or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:9
msgid "This is sometimes also called a minion file."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງໄຟລ໌ນີ້ກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ໄຟລ໌ minion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:10
msgid "Add the proxy FQDN as the `master` to the client configuration file:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ FQDN ຂອງພຣັອກຊີເປັນ `master` ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the [systemitem]``salt-minion`` service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມບໍລິການ [systemitem]``salt-minion`` ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:43
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:14
msgid ""
"On the server, accept the new client key; replace [systemitem]``<client>`` "
"with the name of your client:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີບເວີ, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບຄີ (key) ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່; ແທນທີ່ [systemitem]``<client>`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:26
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"
msgstr "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering with a Bootstrap Script (Salt and Traditional)"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ (Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can register Salt or traditional clients through the {productname} Proxy "
"with a bootstrap script.  This is done almost the same way as registering "
"clients directly with the {productname} Server.  The difference is that you "
"create the bootstrap script on the {productname} Proxy with a command line "
"tool.  The bootstrap script then deploys all necessary information to the "
"clients.  The bootstrap script requires some parameters such as activation "
"keys or GPG keys.  These parameters depend on your specific setup."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຫຼື ແບບດັ້ງເດີມຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ. ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງແມ່ນທ່ານສ້າງບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບເທິງ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງການບາງພາຣາມິເຕີ ເຊັ່ນ Activation Keys ຫຼື GPG Keys. ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Create a client activation key on the {productname} server using the "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ສ້າງ Activation Key ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເທິງ {productname} server ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:17
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the proxy, execute the [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command line tool as "
"{rootuser}."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` ໃນນາມ {rootuser}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If needed, use the additional command line switches to tune your bootstrap "
"script.  To install a traditional client instead of a Salt client, ensure "
"you use the [command]``--traditional`` switch."
msgstr "ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ. ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແທນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``--traditional``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To view available options type [command]``mgr-bootstrap --help`` from the "
"command line:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ໃຫ້ພິມ [command]``mgr-bootstrap --help`` ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=key-string\n"
msgstr "mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=key-string\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:10
msgid "OPTIONAL: Edit the resulting bootstrap script."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Execute the bootstrap script directly on the clients or from the proxy with "
"[command]``ssh``.  Replace [systemitem]``<bootstrap>`` with the name of the "
"bootstrap script and [systemitem]`` <client.example.com>`` with the host "
"name of your client:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ຈາກພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ [command]``ssh``. ປ່ຽນ [systemitem]``<bootstrap>`` ເປັນຊື່ຂອງບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ ແລະ [systemitem]`` <client.example.com>`` ເປັນຊື່ໂຮສ (host name) ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat <bootstrap> | ssh root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "cat <bootstrap> | ssh root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"

#.  For more info, see client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy with the {webui}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:2
msgid "You can register Salt clients to the {productname} Proxy using the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ກັບ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A bootstrap repository is needed for non-SLE clients in general and for SLE "
"clients before version 15.  A bootstrap repository offers packages for "
"installing Salt on clients and for registering Salt or traditional clients.  "
"For information about creating a bootstrap repository, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ SLE ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ SLE ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 15. ຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບຈະໃຫ້ແພັກເກັດສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ Salt ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:7
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, type the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) "
"of the client to be bootstrapped."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Host``, ໃຫ້ພິມ fully qualified domain name (FQDN) ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະເຮັດບຸດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, type the SSH port number to use to "
"connect and bootstrap the client."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Port``, ໃຫ້ພິມໝາຍເລກພອດ SSH ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເຮັດບຸດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:10
msgid "By default, the SSH port is [systemitem]``22``."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ພອດ SSH ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``22``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:11
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, type the username to log in to the client."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:12
msgid "By default, the username is [systemitem]``root``."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``root``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Authentication Method`` field, select the authentication "
"method to use for bootstrapping the client."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Authentication Method``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດບຸດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For password authentication, in the [guimenu]``Password`` field, type "
"password to log in to the client."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For SSH Private key authentication, enter the private key and the associated "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ SSH Private key, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The key is only stored for as long as the bootstrapping process takes to "
"complete."
msgstr "ຄີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ສະເພາະໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຂະບວນການ bootstrapping ດຳເນີນການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` field, select the activation key that is "
"associated with the software channel you want to use to bootstrap the "
"client."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Activation Key``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດບຸດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy`` field, select the proxy server you want to "
"register to."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພຣັອກຊີເຊີບເວີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:19
msgid ""
"By default, the [guimenu]``Disable SSH Strict Key Host Checking`` checkbox "
"is selected."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງໝາຍ [guimenu]``Disable SSH Strict Key Host Checking`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This allows the bootstrap process to automatically accept SSH host keys "
"without requiring you to manually authenticate."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ bootstrap ຍອມຮັບ SSH host keys ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ທ່ານຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:21
msgid "OPTIONAL: Check the [guimenu]``Manage System Completely via SSH`` checkbox."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Manage System Completely via SSH``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the client is configured to use SSH for its "
"connection to the server, and no other connection method is configured."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ SSH ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Bootstrap] to begin registration."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Bootstrap] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When the bootstrap process has completed, your client is listed at "
"menu:Systems[System List]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການ bootstrap ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ menu:Systems[System List]."

#
#. 2020-11-26, ke: we now have this info in client-proxy-script.adoc.
#. 	    I think we can delete this comment.
#. == Using a Bootstrap Script
#. FIXME
#. For using a bootstrap script see the general client documentation and the (3.2) proxy documentation.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີ"

#. The following sections cover registering Salt and traditional clients on the {productname} Proxy.
#. When a client is registered it connect to the proxy exclusively for Salt operations (Salt client) and normal HTTP package downloads.
#. There are three ways to register Salt clients.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Proxy servers can act as a broker and package cache for both Salt and "
"traditional clients.  Registering clients to a proxy is similar to "
"registering them directly to the {productname} Server, with a few key "
"differences."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີເຊີເວີ (Proxy servers) ສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນ ແລະ ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບແພັກເກັດຊົ່ວຄາວ (cache) ທັງສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server, ແຕ່ມີຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"These sections contain information on registering Salt clients to a proxy "
"using the {webui}, commands on the command line, or a bootstrap script.  "
"There is also information on registering traditional clients using a "
"bootstrap script.  There are also procedures how you can move clients from "
"one {productname} Proxy to another one or to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ກັບພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}, ຄຳສັ່ງຜ່ານໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ຫຼື ບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໂດຍໃຊ້ບູດສະແຕຣັບສະຄຣິບ. ແລະ ຍັງມີຂັ້ນຕອນວິທີການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Proxy ໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກແຫ່ງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ໄປຫາ {productname} Server."

#.  Here starts what you can see on the server about proxy connected clients
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Within the {webui}, proxy pages show information about both Salt and "
"traditional clients.  You can see a list of clients that are connected to a "
"proxy by clicking the name of the proxy in menu:Systems[System List > "
"Proxy], then select the [guimenu]``Proxy`` subtab of the "
"[guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {webui}, ໜ້າພຣັອກຊີຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບທັງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພຣັອກຊີໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງພຣັອກຊີໃນ menu:Systems[System List > Proxy], ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Proxy`` ໃນແຖບ [guimenu]``Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A list of chained proxies for a Salt client can be seen by clicking the name "
"of the client in menu:Systems[All], then select the [guimenu]``Connection`` "
"subtab of the [guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ (chained proxies) ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນ menu:Systems[All], ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Connection`` ໃນແຖບ [guimenu]``Details``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients between Proxies"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can move Salt and Salt SSH push clients between proxies without the need "
"to repeat the registration process."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ Salt SSH push ລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນຊ້ຳຄືນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You cannot move chained proxies.  Instead of moving a chained proxy, create "
"a new proxy, move the clients, and delete the old proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ (chained proxy) ໄດ້. ແທນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍໄປ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລົບພຣັອກຊີເກົ່າຖິ້ມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you want to move a traditional client between proxies, you must repeat "
"the registration process from the beginning."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Moving Salt or  Salt SSH Push Client between Proxies"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຫຼື Salt SSH Push ລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the [guimenu]``System Details`` "
"page for the client you want to move between proxies."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Connection`` tab.  Then follow the "
"[guimenu]``Change proxy`` link to see the drop-down menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Connection``. ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງ [guimenu]``Change proxy`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເມນູເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:13
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``New Proxy`` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the "
"client to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ [guimenu]``New Proxy``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພຣັອກຊີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Moving Multiple Salt or Salt SSH Push Clients between Proxies "
"with SSM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຫຼື Salt SSH Push ຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"check each client to move, this adds the clients to the system set manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager (SSM)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Misc[Proxy]`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Misc[Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:17
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``New Proxy`` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the "
"clients to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ [guimenu]``New Proxy``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພຣັອກຊີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The same functionality is also available with the "
"[systemitem]``system.changeProxy`` API call."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນດຽວກັນນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຜ່ານ API call [systemitem]``system.changeProxy``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background Information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The effect of this function differs between normal Salt clients and Salt SSH "
"push clients."
msgstr "ຜົນກະທົບຂອງຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH push."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Normal Salt Clients"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ປົກກະຕິ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The function schedules a Salt state action, which modifies "
"[literal]``master:`` setting in the [path]``susemanager.conf`` Salt client "
"configuration file to point to the new proxy.  Then the function restarts "
"the Salt client."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການ Salt state, ເຊິ່ງຈະແກ້ໄຂຄ່າ [literal]``master:`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt [path]``susemanager.conf`` ໃຫ້ຊີ້ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່. ຈາກນັ້ນຟັງຊັນຈະເລີ່ມລະບົບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Changing [literal]``master:`` by manually editing the "
"[path]``susemanager.conf`` file has the same effect and is supported, too."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງ [literal]``master:`` ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [path]``susemanager.conf`` ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກໍມີຜົນຄືກັນ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When the minion restarts and reconnects via the new proxy, the server "
"updates the proxy path in the database and schedules another action for "
"refreshing the channel URLs."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ minion ເລີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ເຊີເວີຈະອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງພຣັອກຊີໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາອີກໜຶ່ງການດຳເນີນການເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) URL ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Push Clients"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH Push"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The function updates the proxy path immediately in the database and new "
"action for refreshing the channel URLs is scheduled."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຈະອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງພຣັອກຊີໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທັນທີ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊ URL ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients from Proxies to the Server"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຈາກພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If you want to move a Salt client from a proxy to the server, select "
"[literal]``None`` from proxy list."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈາກພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [literal]``None`` ຈາກລາຍຊື່ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If you want to move a traditional client to the server you must repeat the "
"registration process from the beginning."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປຫາເຊີເວີ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Using the Content Lifecycle Manager"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have many {sles} clients to manage, you can automate in-place "
"upgrades using the content lifecycle manager."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍ {sles} ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດການອັບເກຣດແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າ (in-place) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ content lifecycle manager."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:3
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Upgrade"
msgstr "ການກຽມຕົວເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid "Before you can upgrade your clients, you need to make these preparations:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຽມການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການ content lifecycle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:8
msgid "Create an activation key"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid "Create an autoinstallable distribution"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid "Create an autoinstallation profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການ Content Lifecycle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:10
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project for your distribution."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການ content lifecycle ສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid "For more information, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:12
msgid "Ensure you a choose a short but descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຊື່ໂຄງການທີ່ສັ້ນແຕ່ສື່ຄວາມໝາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid "Include all source channel modules that you require for your distribution."
msgstr "ລວມເອົາທຸກໂມດູນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "Add filters as required, and set up at least one environment."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filters) ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "Create an activation key for your distribution."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Ensure your activation key includes all filtered project channels."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂອງທ່ານລວມເອົາທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໂຄງການທີ່ຜ່ານການຕອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Create an autoinstallable distribution for every base channel you want to "
"migrate."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ ສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Give your distribution a label that references the name of the content "
"lifecycle project."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃຫ້ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊື່ຂອງໂຄງການ content lifecycle."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the ``Installer Generation`` field, select the SLES version you are "
"using."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Installer Generation``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນ SLES ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Create an autoinstallation profile for every target distribution and service "
"pack you want to upgrade to."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບທຸກຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ service pack ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດໄປຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid "You must use a different profile for Salt and traditional clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can use variables in the profile to distinguish between the different "
"lifecycle environments."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables) ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອແຍກລະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For example autoinstallation profiles, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Use these variables in your autointallation profiles for automating in-place "
"upgrades:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເກຣດແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Variables for Use in Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕົວປ່ຽນສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"registration_key=1-15sp1-demo-test\n"
"org=1\n"
"channel_prefix=15sp1-demo-test\n"
"distro_label=15sp1-demo-test\n"
msgstr ""
"registration_key=1-15sp1-demo-test\n"
"org=1\n"
"channel_prefix=15sp1-demo-test\n"
"distro_label=15sp1-demo-test\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Entry for Use in Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລາຍການ (Entry) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <listentry>\n"
"     <ask_on_error config:type=\"boolean\">true</ask_on_error>\n"
"     "
"<media_url>https://$redhat_management_server/ks/dist/child/$channel_prefix-sle-module-web-scripting15-sp1-pool-x86_64/$distro_label</media_url>\n"
"     <name>$channel_prefix SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP1 Pool for x86_64 "
"</name>\n"
"     <product>Web Scripting Module 15 SP1 x86_64 Pool</product>\n"
"</listentry>\n"
msgstr ""
" <listentry>\n"
"     <ask_on_error config:type=\"boolean\">true</ask_on_error>\n"
"     <media_url>https://$redhat_management_server/ks/dist/child/$channel_prefix-sle-module-web-scripting15-sp1-pool-x86_64/$distro_label</media_url>\n"
"     <name>$channel_prefix SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP1 Pool for x86_64 </name>\n"
"     <product>Web Scripting Module 15 SP1 x86_64 Pool</product>\n"
"</listentry>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid ""
"When you have prepared the server for the upgrade, you can provision the "
"clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຽມເຊີບເວີສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຈັດສັນ (provision) ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Provisioning the Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈັດສັນ (Provisioning) ລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], and "
"select the clients you want to provision to add them to the system set "
"manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດສັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] and click the "
"[guimenu]``Provisioning`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] ແລະ ຄລິກແທັບ [guimenu]``Provisioning``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "Select the autoinstallation profile to use."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For clients that are able to use PXE, the migration is automated as soon as "
"you have provisioned them.  For all other clients, you can use {cobbler} to "
"perform the upgrade."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ PXE ໄດ້, ການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານຈັດສັນພວກມັນ. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເກຣດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using {cobbler} to Upgrade Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "At the command prompt, as root, check the available {cobbler} profiles:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ມີໃຫ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr "cobbler profile list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "Build the ISO file with your chosen profile and distribution:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເລືອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example "
"--distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"
msgstr "cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example --distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid ""
"For more information about using CD-ROMs to provision clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ CD-ROMs ເພື່ອຈັດສັນລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client - Major Version Upgrade"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຫຼັກ (Major Version Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your clients must have the latest available service pack (SP) for the "
"installed operating system, with all the latest updates applied.  Before you "
"start, ensure that the system is up to date and all updates have been "
"installed successfully."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງມີ Service Pack (SP) ຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້, ພ້ອມທັງໄດ້ລົງການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດທັງໝົດແລ້ວ. ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະບົບເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການອັບເດດທັງໝົດໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຢ່າງສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:3
msgid "The upgrade is controlled by {yast} and {ay}, it does not use Zypper."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ {yast} ແລະ {ay}, ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ Zypper."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Migrate"
msgstr "ກຽມການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you can migrate your client from SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15{nbsp}, "
"you need to:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຈາກ SLE{nbsp}12 ໄປເປັນ SLE{nbsp}15{nbsp} ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:6
msgid "Prepare installation media"
msgstr "ກຽມສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:7
msgid "Create an auto-installable distribution"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍແບບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:9
msgid "Upload an {ay} profile"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing Installation Media (for example, SLE 15 SP2)"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: SLE 15 SP2)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, create a local directory for the "
"SLE{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP2 installation media:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂຟນເດີທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SLE{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p /srv/images/sle15sp2\n"
msgstr "mkdir -p /srv/images/sle15sp2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Download an ISO image with the installation sources, and mount the ISO image "
"on your server:"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດ ISO image ທີ່ມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ທຳການ mount ISO image ນັ້ນເທິງເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mount -o loop DVD1.iso /mnt/\n"
msgstr "mount -o loop DVD1.iso /mnt/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:15
msgid "Copy everything from the mounted ISO to your local file system:"
msgstr "ກ່າຍ (copy) ທຸກຢ່າງຈາກ ISO ທີ່ mount ແລ້ວ ໄປຍັງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -r /mnt/* /srv/images/sle15sp2\n"
msgstr "cp -r /mnt/* /srv/images/sle15sp2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:17
msgid "When the copy is complete, unmount the ISO image:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການກ່າຍສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ທຳການ unmount ISO image:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /mnt\n"
msgstr "umount /mnt\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This image is the {unifiedinstaller} and can be used for multiple "
"autoinstallable distributions."
msgstr "Image ນີ້ແມ່ນ {unifiedinstaller} ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍແບບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Distributions] and click btn:[Create Distribution]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Distribution]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Create Autoinstallable Distribution`` section, use these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Create Autoinstallable Distribution``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Distribution Label`` section, type a unique name for the "
"distribution."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Distribution Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳໃຜສຳລັບຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Use only letters, numbers, hyphens, periods, and underscores, and ensure the "
"name is longer than four characters.  For example, ``sles15sp2-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ຂີດຕໍ່ (-), ຈ້ຳ (.), ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (_), ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ຍາວກວ່າສີ່ຕົວອັກສອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``sles15sp2-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Tree Path`` field, type an absolute path to the "
"installation source."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Tree Path``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (absolute path) ໄປຫາແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:26
msgid "For example, [path]``/srv/images/sle15sp2``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/srv/images/sle15sp2``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Base Channel`` field, select "
"[systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Base Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Installer Generation`` field, select [systemitem]``SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise 15``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Installer Generation``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise 15``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel Options`` field, type any options to be passed to "
"the kernel when booting for the installation."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Options``, ໃຫ້ພິມຕົວເລືອກໃດໆທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປຫາ kernel ໃນເວລາບູດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The [option]``install=`` parameter and the [option]``self_update=0 "
"pt.options=self_update`` parameter are added by default."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``install=`` ແລະ [option]``self_update=0 pt.options=self_update`` ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Post Kernel Options`` section, type any options to be "
"passed to the kernel when booting the installed system for the first time."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Post Kernel Options``, ໃຫ້ພິມຕົວເລືອກໃດໆທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປຫາ kernel ໃນເວລາບູດລະບົບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution] to save."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To switch from the old SLE{nbsp}12{nbsp} base channel to the new SLE{nbsp}15 "
"channel, you need an activation key."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ SLE{nbsp}12{nbsp} ເກົ່າ ໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງ SLE{nbsp}15 ໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation "
"Keys] and click [guimenu]``Create Key``."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys] ແລະ ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Create Key``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:36
msgid "Enter a description for your key."
msgstr "ໃສ່ລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:37
msgid "Enter a key or leave it blank to generate an automatic key."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄີ ຫຼື ປະວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບສ້າງຄີອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:38
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to limit the usage, enter your value in the "
"[guimenu]``Usage`` text field."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Usage``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Select the [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64`` base "
"channel."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:40
msgid "OPTIONAL: Select any [guimenu]``Add-On System Types``."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Add-On System Types`` ໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/article-modules.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/article-modules.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:42
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:43
msgid "Click the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` tab and select the required channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກແທັບ [guimenu]``Child Channels`` ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:44
msgid "Click btn:[Update Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation profiles contain all the installation and configuration "
"data needed to install a system.  They can also contain scripts to be "
"executed after the installation is complete.  For example scripts that you "
"can use as a starting point, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ. ພວກມັນຍັງສາມາດມີສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະລັນຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:47
msgid "For valid {ay} upgrade settings, see"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເກຣດ {ay} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:48
msgid "link:https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade[]."
msgstr "link:https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Profiles] and upload your autoinstallation profile script."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] ແລະ ອັບໂຫລດສະຄຣິບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:51
msgid "For example scripts that you can use as a starting point, see"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:52
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:53
msgid "In the ``Kernel Options`` field, type ``autoupgrade=1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Kernel Options``, ໃຫ້ພິມ ``autoupgrade=1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can also include the ``Y2DEBUG=1`` option.  The debug "
"setting is not required but can help with investigating any future problems "
"you might encounter."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານສາມາດລວມຕົວເລືອກ ``Y2DEBUG=1`` ເຂົ້າໄປນຳໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ debug ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ ແຕ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການກວດສອບບັນຫາຕ່າງໆທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Clients running in Azure cloud must add ``textmode=1 console=ttyS0`` to "
"``Kernel Options``."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລັນໃນ Azure cloud ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ``textmode=1 console=ttyS0`` ໃສ່ໃນ ``Kernel Options``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:56
msgid "Paste the autoinstallation profile or use the file upload field."
msgstr "ວາງເນື້ອຫາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:57
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:58
msgid ""
"When the uploaded profile requires variables to be set, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], select the profile to edit, and "
"navigate to the [guimenu]``Variables`` tab."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດຕ້ອງການການກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables), ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Variables``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:59
msgid "Specify the required variables, using this format:"
msgstr "ລະບຸຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "<key>=<value>\n"
msgstr "<key>=<value>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Before you begin, check that all the channels referenced in the "
"autoinstallation profile are available and fully synchronized."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ອ້າງອີງໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດນັ້ນມີຢູ່ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:63
msgid ""
"You can monitor the mirroring progress in "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການເຮັດມິເລີໄດ້ໃນ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems`` and "
"select the client to be upgraded."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems`` ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Provisioning`` tab, and select the "
"autoinstallation profile you uploaded."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Provisioning``, ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ອັບໂຫຼດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish].  The system downloads the "
"required files, change the bootloader entries, reboot, and start the "
"upgrade."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]. ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ປ່ຽນລາຍການໃນ bootloader, ບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່, ແລະ ເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Next time the client synchronizes with the {productname} Server, it receives "
"a re-installation job.  The re-installation job fetches the new kernel and "
"initrd packages.  It also writes a new [path]``/boot/grub/menu.lst`` (GRUB "
"Legacy) or [path]``/boot/grub2/grub.cfg`` (GRUB 2), containing pointers to "
"the new kernel and initrd packages."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ກັບ {productname} Server, ມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບໜ້າວຽກການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ (re-installation job). ໜ້າວຽກນີ້ຈະໄປດຶງແພັກເກັດ kernel ແລະ initrd ໃໝ່. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ມັນຍັງຈະຂຽນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/boot/grub/menu.lst`` (GRUB Legacy) ຫຼື [path]``/boot/grub2/grub.cfg`` (GRUB 2) ໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງມີບ່ອນຊີ້ໄປຫາແພັກເກັດ kernel ແລະ initrd ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:69
msgid ""
"When the client next boots, it uses grub to boot the new kernel with its "
"initrd.  PXE booting is not used during this process."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍບູດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ grub ເພື່ອບູດ kernel ໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບ initrd ຂອງມັນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ການບູດຜ່ານ PXE ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Approximately three minutes after the job was fetched, the client goes down "
"for reboot."
msgstr "ປະມານສາມນາທີຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໜ້າວຽກ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະປິດເຄື່ອງເພື່ອບູດໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:71
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, use the ``spacewalk/minion_script`` snippet to register "
"the client again after migration has completed."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ snippet ``spacewalk/minion_script`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອີກຄັ້ງຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Product migration allows you to upgrade SLE-based client systems from an "
"Service Pack (SP) level to a later one.  For example, you can migrate "
"{sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP1 to {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP2."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Product migration is for upgrading within the same major version.  You "
"cannot use product migration to migrate from {sles}{nbsp}12 to "
"{sles}{nbsp}15.  For more information about major upgrades, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນແມ່ນສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດພາຍໃນເວີຊັນຫຼັກດຽວກັນ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນເພື່ອຍ້າຍຈາກ {sles}{nbsp}12 ໄປເປັນ {sles}{nbsp}15 ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຫຼັກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can also migrate openSUSE Leap to a later minor version or to the "
"corresponding {sles} SP level, for example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຍ້າຍ openSUSE Leap ໄປຫາເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ໄປຫາລະດັບ {sles} SP ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:5
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.1 to 15.2, or"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.1 ໄປຫາ 15.2, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:6
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.1 to {sles} 15 SP1, or"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.1 ໄປຫາ {sles} 15 SP1, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:7
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.5 to {sles} 15 SP5"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.5 ໄປຫາ {sles} 15 SP5"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In {sles}{nbsp}12 and later, {suse} supports service pack skipping if {scc} "
"provides it.  For example, you can upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to SP2, "
"without installing SP1."
msgstr "ໃນ {sles}{nbsp}12 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, {suse} ຮອງຮັບການຂ້າມ service pack ຫາກ {scc} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການນັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເກຣດຈາກ {sles}{nbsp}15 ໄປຫາ SP2 ໄດ້ເລີຍ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ SP1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For supported {sles} upgrade paths, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html#sec-upgrade-paths-supported."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງການອັບເກຣດ {sles} ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html#sec-upgrade-paths-supported."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"During migration, {productname} automatically accepts any required licenses "
"(EULAs) before installation."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, {productname} ຈະຍອມຮັບໃບອະນຸຍາດ (EULAs) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single System Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບເຄື່ອງດຽວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:12
msgid "Before starting the product migration:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Ensure there are no pending updates or patches.  Check the [guimenu]``System "
"Status`` on the client system's menu:Details[Overview] page, and install all "
"offered updates or patches.  If your client system is not up to date, "
"product migration may fail."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດ ຫຼື ແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ [guimenu]``System Status`` ໃນໜ້າເມນູ: Details[Overview] ຂອງລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກການອັບເດດ ຫຼື ແພັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ຖ້າລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ, ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນອາດຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Make sure all the channels of the target product are fully synchronized.  To "
"check the synchronization status in the {webui}, navigate to the "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] page."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a working system backup available, in case of an emergency.  "
"Product migration does not have a rollback feature.  When the migration "
"procedure has begun, rolling back is not possible."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ໃນກໍລະນີສຸກເສີນ. ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນບໍ່ມີຟີເຈີການຍ້ອນກັບ (rollback). ເມື່ອຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Single System Migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບເຄື່ອງດຽວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:17
msgid "From the menu:Systems[Overview] page, select a client."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Systems[Overview], ໃຫ້ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"From the system details page of the client, navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Product Migration] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Software[Product Migration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:19
msgid "Select the target migration path and click btn:[Select Channels]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງການຍ້າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Select Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Product Migration - Channels`` page select the correct "
"base channel, including ``Mandatory Child Channels`` and any additional "
"``Optional Child Channels``."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Product Migration - Channels`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ລວມທັງ ``Mandatory Child Channels`` ແລະ ``Optional Child Channels`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Check [guimenu]``Allow Vendor Change`` to allow packages that have "
"changed vendors to be installed.  If this occurs, a notification is shown "
"with details before the migration is started."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Allow Vendor Change`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor). ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"To migrate openSUSE Leap to {sles}, you must check the [guimenu]``Allow "
"Vendor Change`` option."
msgstr "ໃນການຍ້າຍ openSUSE Leap ໄປເປັນ {sles}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Allow Vendor Change``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule Migration] when your channels have been configured "
"properly."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Schedule Migration] ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Mass Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (Product Mass Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If you want to migrate a large number of clients to the next SP version, you "
"can use {productname} API calls."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໄປຫາເວີຊັນ SP ຖັດໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API calls ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacecmd`` commandline tool provides a "
"[systemitem]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` sub command, which can be "
"used to schedule a migration for a large number of clients to the next minor "
"version."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື command line [command]``spacecmd`` ມີຄຳສັ່ງຍ່ອຍ [systemitem]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາຍ້າຍລະບົບສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໄປຫາເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຖັດໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a Product Mass Migration"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The product mass migration operation is dangerous and the process should be "
"tested thoroughly.  At least, do a dry-run first."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ ແລະ ຂະບວນການຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ, ຄວນເຮັດ dry-run ກ່ອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:29
msgid "Be careful not to upgrade systems unintentionally."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະວັງ ຢ່າອັບເກຣດລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Product Mass Migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:31
msgid ""
"List available migration targets, and take note of the system IDs you want "
"to migrate:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ເປົ້າໝາຍການຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກ system IDs ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For each system ID, call [systemitem]``listMigrationTarget`` and check that "
"the desired target product is available."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ ID ຂອງລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [systemitem]``listMigrationTarget`` ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າຜະລິດຕະພັນເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການນັ້ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:34
msgid ""
"If the system ID has an available target, call "
"[systemitem]``system.scheduleProductMigration``."
msgstr "ຖ້າ ID ຂອງລະບົບມີເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [systemitem]``system.scheduleProductMigration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:35
msgid "If the desired target is not available, skip the system."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມລະບົບນັ້ນໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:36
msgid "Adapt this template for your environment:"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງແມ່ແບບ (template) ນີ້ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids = [1, 2, 3]\n"
msgstr ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids = [1, 2, 3]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, "
"[], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Cannot migrate to requested target -- skipping system\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"
msgstr ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, [], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Cannot migrate to requested target -- skipping system\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLES 15 SP2 to SLES 15 SP3"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: SLES 15 SP2 ໄປເປັນ SLES 15 SP3"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For this example, a group will be created temporarily to facilitate the mass "
"migration."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຈະມີການສ້າງກຸ່ມຂຶ້ນຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Mass Product Migration Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຸ່ມສຳລັບການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click btn:[Create Group]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Create Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:43
msgid "Name the group [literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ກຸ່ມວ່າ [literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Only systems subscribed to the same base channel should be added to the "
"created group.  In the example, only systems subscribed to "
"[literal]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64`` should be added to the "
"group."
msgstr "ຄວນເພີ່ມສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານດຽວກັນເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຄວນເພີ່ມສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ສະໝັກໃຊ້ [literal]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64`` ເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:45
msgid ""
"For more information about adding clients to groups, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc#_add_clients_to_groups[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc#_add_clients_to_groups[]."

#. Note or warning about taking normal precautions (backups, make sure fully patched, etc)
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Systems to the Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລະບົບເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:47
msgid "Get the targets for all the systems in the group by running:"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບທຸກລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມໂດຍການລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:48
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:49
msgid "The command output a string of \"IDs.\""
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະສະແດງຜົນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ \"IDs.\""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:50
msgid "Only select a target, which is reported for *all* systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະເພາະເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີລາຍງານສຳລັບ *ທຸກໆ* ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The string is the identifier for the [literal]``MIGRATIONTARGET`` of the "
"other command."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວກຳນົດ (identifier) ສຳລັບ [literal]``MIGRATIONTARGET`` ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງອື່ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacecmd`` sub-commands "
"[literal]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` and "
"[command]``system_listmigrationtargets`` are looping over all systems that "
"are part of the group."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຍ່ອຍ [command]``spacecmd`` ທີ່ເປັນ [literal]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` ແລະ [command]``system_listmigrationtargets`` ຈະເຮັດວຽກວົນຊ້ຳກັບທຸກລະບົບທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:53
msgid "If there are 100 systems in the group, you will see 100 actions scheduled."
msgstr "ຫາກມີ 100 ລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ 100 ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກວາງແຜນໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:54
msgid "All systems in the group must support the same migration target."
msgstr "ທຸກລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບເປົ້າໝາຍການຍ້າຍລະບົບອັນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the Mass Migration Command"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຍ້າຍລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:56
msgid ""
"The syntax for the [command]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` command is "
"as follows:"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` ແມ່ນມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> "
"\\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> \\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For this example to upgrade all systems in the group "
"[literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3`` from SLES 12 SP2 to SLES 15 SP, enter on "
"the command line:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດທຸກລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມ [literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3`` ຈາກ SLES 12 SP2 ໄປເປັນ SLES 15 SP, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ command line:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Syntax Explained"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄວຍາກອນທີ່ບັງຄັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To see syntax usage and options for "
"[command]``system_scheduleproductmigration``, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວິທີໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບ [command]``system_scheduleproductmigration``, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"
msgstr "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "<SYSTEM>"
msgstr "<SYSTEM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:64
msgid ""
"For this example we will use the group we created to select all of the "
"systems from that group:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ກຸ່ມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເລືອກທຸກລະບົບຈາກກຸ່ມນັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"
msgstr "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This is the label for the target base channel.  In this case, the system is "
"being upgraded to SLES 15 SP3, and the label is "
"[literal]``sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64``."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ລະບົບກຳລັງຖືກອັບເກຣດເປັນ SLES 15 SP3, ແລະ ປ້າຍຊື່ແມ່ນ [literal]``sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:68
msgid "To see a list of all base channels currently mirrored, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດ mirror ຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd softwarechannel_listbasechannels.\n"
msgstr "spacecmd softwarechannel_listbasechannels.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Keep in mind you cannot upgrade to a channel unless it is an available "
"target for your current base channel."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເກຣດໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າມັນເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"
msgstr "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:72
msgid ""
"To identify this value for systems in the group "
"[literal]``group:mpm-target-sles15sp3``, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່ານີ້ສຳລັບລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມ [literal]``group:mpm-target-sles15sp3``, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:74
msgid ""
"The [literal]``MIGRATION_TARGET`` parameter must be passed in the following "
"format; note necessary shell quotation to prevent sideeffects with brackets:"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``MIGRATION_TARGET`` ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໃນຮູບແບບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້; ໝາຍເຫດ: ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ (quotation marks) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຜົນກະທົບກັບວົງເລັບ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"[190,203,195,1242]\"\n"
msgstr "\"[190,203,195,1242]\"\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:77
msgid "[literal]``-s`` START_TIME"
msgstr "[literal]``-s`` START_TIME"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:78
msgid ""
"[literal]``-d`` pass this flag, if you want to do a dry run (it is "
"recommended to run a dry run before the actual migration)"
msgstr "[literal]``-d`` ໃຊ້ແຟລັກ (flag) ນີ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດ dry run (ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ dry run ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຕົວຈິງ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:79
msgid ""
"[literal]``-c`` CHILD_CHANNELS (comma-separated child channels labels with "
"no spaces)"
msgstr "[literal]``-c`` CHILD_CHANNELS (ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີເວັ້ນວ່າງ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In this case we included the [literal]``-d`` option, which can be removed "
"after a successful dry run."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ລວມຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``-d`` ເຂົ້າໄປນຳ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເຮັດ dry run ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:81
msgid ""
"If successful, the command output for each scheduled system will look like "
"this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຜົນຂອງຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບທີ່ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງໄວ້ຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Scheduling Product migration for system mpm-sles152-1\n"
"Scheduled action ID: 66\n"
msgstr ""
"Scheduling Product migration for system mpm-sles152-1\n"
"Scheduled action ID: 66\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:83
msgid ""
"You can also track the action, in this case the dry run, in the {webui} for "
"a given system in the group.  From the system details page of the client, "
"Navigate to menu:Events[History].  If there are any failures during the dry "
"run, the system should be investigated."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕາມການດຳເນີນການໄດ້, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນການ dry run, ໃນ {webui} ສຳລັບລະບົບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນກຸ່ມ. ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Events[History]. ຫາກມີຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃດໆໃນລະຫວ່າງການ dry run, ຄວນທຳການກວດສອບລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:84
msgid ""
"If all is well, the [literal]``-d`` option can be removed from the command "
"to run the real migration."
msgstr "ຫາກທຸກຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍດີ, ສາມາດລຶບຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``-d`` ອອກຈາກຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອລັນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:85
msgid ""
"After the migration is complete, you can reboot the system from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ (reboot) ຈາກ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Uyuni Clients"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "In this section, we use openSUSE Leap as an example."
msgstr "ໃນພາກນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the Client Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels."
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Fully synchronize all channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``.  In "
"case of already defined repository URLs, continue with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-uyuni.adoc#uyuni-202007-channeldupes[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຢ່າງສົມບູນດ້ວຍ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການກຳນົດ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-uyuni.adoc#uyuni-202007-channeldupes[]."

#.  These are custom channels.
#.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuse.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Channels] and click the [systemitem]``Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap "
"15.4 (x86_64)`` channel name."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ [systemitem]``Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "In the upper right corner, click btn:[Manage Channel]."
msgstr "ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Manage Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Click the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, and select [systemitem]``External - "
"Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."
msgstr "ຄລິກແທັບ [guimenu]``Repositories``, ແລະ ເລືອກ [systemitem]``External - Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Update Repositories]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Repositories]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Navigate to menu:Repositories[Sync] subtab, and click btn:[Sync Now]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Repositories[Sync], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Sync Now]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Do the same with [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` and "
"[systemitem]``External - openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."
msgstr "ເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບ [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` ແລະ [systemitem]``External - openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Unfold [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` to see all child channels "
"populated with packages."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To upgrade a client you replace the software repositories and update the "
"software, and finally reboot the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading the Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[] and click "
"the name of the client."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[] ແລະ ກົດທີ່ຊື່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Software Channels], and as the base channel select the "
"openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} channel that is listed in the "
"[systemitem]``Customs Channels`` list."
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:Software[Software Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ [systemitem]``Customs Channels`` ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` pane, select the {opensuse-version} child "
"channels."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ {opensuse-version}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], and [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` with "
"btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ແລະ [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` ດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], and select all the packages to be "
"updated on the client, and then apply the selection.  Click btn:[Upgrade "
"Packages], check the details, and click btn:[Confirm] to complete the "
"update."
msgstr "ກົດເມນູ: Software[Packages > Upgrade], ແລະ ເລືອກແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລ້ວກົດໃຊ້ການເລືອກ. ກົດ btn:[Upgrade Packages], ກວດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເດດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#.  . Re-register with the reactivation key using the [command]``rhnreg_ks`` command-line utility.
#.   The system is re-registered with the same id, history, and groups.
#.  and channels (unless the system's base channel changes).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid "Reboot the client."
msgstr "ບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you need to update many clients, you can create an action chain of this "
"command sequence on the {productname} Server.  You can use the action chain "
"to perform updates on multiple clients at the same time."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລະບົບຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນງານ (action chain) ຂອງລຳດັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ action chain ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#
#
#. . Assign the new channels to the clients instead of the old channels.
#. . Update all the packages.  This can either be done with the {webui} or better run [command]``zypper dup`` manually on the command line local on the systems or remotely as a Salt command.
#. I think the better way to document this is if giving it a try. Create an Uyuni server, sync Leap 15.1 (spacewalk-common-channels), create a Leap 15.1, onboard it, sync Leap 15.2 (spacewalk-common-channels), and then try to adjust the channels and trying to upgrade. I recommend you use VMs and take snapshots of the VMs so you can repeat steps as needed.
#. But for now you need to create and mirror at least the target channels with spacewalk-common-channels.
#. You adjust the channels for the client and best is to call "zypper dup". Either from the commandline on that system or using remote command.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients use the versioning system of their underlying operating system, and "
"require regular upgrades."
msgstr "Client ໃຊ້ລະບົບເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກເຂົາ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການອັບເກຣດເປັນປະຈຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For SCC registered clients using {suse} operating systems, you can perform "
"upgrades within the {productname} {webui}.  For supported {sle}{nbsp}15 "
"upgrade paths, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ SCC ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse}, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດພາຍໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງການອັບເກຣດ {sle}{nbsp}15 ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To upgrade clients running SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15, the upgrade is "
"automated, but you need to do some preparation steps before you begin.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ client ທີ່ລັນ SLE{nbsp}12 ໄປເປັນ SLE{nbsp}15, ການອັບເກຣດແມ່ນເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຽມຂັ້ນຕອນບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also automate client upgrades using the content lifecycle manager.  "
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການອັບເກຣດ client ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ content lifecycle manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about product migration such as service pack upgrades "
"openSUSE Leap minor version upgrades, or openSUSE Leap to {sle} migrations, "
"see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ ເຊັ່ນ ການອັບເກຣດ service pack, ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຂອງ openSUSE Leap, ຫຼື ການຍ້າຍຈາກ openSUSE Leap ໄປຫາ {sle}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about upgrading unregistered openSUSE Leap clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ openSUSE Leap ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {alibabaclo} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {alibabaclo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering traditional and Salt "
"clients running {alibabaclo} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {alibabaclo}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:3
msgid "{alibabaclo} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {alibabaclo} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Alibaba Cloud, not by {suse}"
msgstr "Package ແລະ metadata ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ Alibaba Cloud, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:5
