msgid "For supported products, see the support table and the release notes"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງການຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ (release notes)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The traditional stack is available on {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 but it is not "
"supported.  {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 clients are only supported as Salt clients."
msgstr "ຊຸດຊອບແວແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional stack) ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃນ {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເພາະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-alibaba.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Some {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 instances will need two tries to register "
"successfully."
msgstr "ບາງ instance ຂອງ {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 ຈະຕ້ອງລອງລົງທະບຽນສອງຄັ້ງຈຶ່ງຈະສຳເລັດ."

