#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:25
msgid "Some {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 instances will fail to register on the first try."
msgstr "ບາງ instance ຂອງ {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການລົງທະບຽນໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:26
msgid "This is due to a to a known bug in the {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2 image."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກບັກ (bug) ທີ່ຮູ້ກັນດີໃນ image ຂອງ {alibabaclo}{nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The `python-urlgrabber3` package is provided both as a Python pip package "
"and an RPM package, which can cause a conflict on the first attempt to "
"register."
msgstr "package `python-urlgrabber3` ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ທັງໃນຮູບແບບ Python pip ແລະ RPM, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຂັດແຍ້ງກັນໃນການພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If your instance is based on one of the affected image versions, the client "
"should register correctly on the second registration attempt."
msgstr "ຖ້າ instance ຂອງທ່ານອີງໃສ່ເວີຊັນ image ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, client ຄວນຈະລົງທະບຽນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການພະຍາຍາມຄັ້ງທີສອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {almalinux} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {almalinux}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering Salt clients running "
"{almalinux} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິດຕິບັດການ {almalinux}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:3
msgid "{almalinux} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {almalinux} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by AlmaLinux OS Foundation, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນໃຫ້ໂດຍ AlmaLinux OS Foundation, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Traditional clients are not available on {almalinux}.  {almalinux} clients "
"are only supported as Salt clients."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນ {almalinux}. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {almalinux} ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເພາະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When created at AWS, {almalinux} instances always have the same `machine-id` "
"id at `/etc/machine-id`.  Make sure you regenerate the `machine-id` after "
"the instance is created.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຢູ່ AWS, instance ຂອງ {almalinux} ຈະມີ `machine-id` ດຽວກັນສະເໝີຢູ່ທີ່ `/etc/machine-id`. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງ `machine-id` ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ instance ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Registering {almalinux} clients to {productname} is tested with the default "
"SELinux configuration of ``enforcing`` with a ``targeted`` policy.  You do "
"not need to disable SELinux to register {almalinux} clients to "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {almalinux} ກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SELinux ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແບບ ``enforcing`` ດ້ວຍນະໂຍບາຍ ``targeted``. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດການໃຊ້ງານ SELinux ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {almalinux} ກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you can register {almalinux} clients to your {productname} Server, "
"you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ client {almalinux} ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`, on "
"version 9 additionally {ppc64le} and {s390x}.  For full list of supported "
"products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນຄື: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`, ໃນເວີຊັນ 9 ຍັງຮອງຮັບ {ppc64le} ແລະ {s390x} ເພີ່ມຕື່ມ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

