#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:115
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:72
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:26
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage GPG Keys"
msgstr "ຈັດການ GPG Keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:116
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:73
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:33
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients use GPG keys to check the authenticity of software packages before "
"they are installed.  Only trusted software can be installed on clients."
msgstr "Client ໃຊ້ GPG keys ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ package ຊອບແວກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສະເພາະຊອບແວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:26
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:117
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Trusting a GPG key is important for security on clients.  It is the task of "
"the administrator to decide which keys are needed and can be trusted.  A "
"software channel cannot be assigned to a client when the GPG key is not "
"trusted."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຊື່ (trusting) ຄີ GPG ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ clients. ມັນແມ່ນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຈະຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຄີໃດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຊື່ໄດ້. software channel ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ client ໄດ້ ຫາກຄີ GPG ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:118
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:75
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For more information about GPG keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ GPG keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
