#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Errata"
msgstr "ຈັດການ Errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When you update {almalinux} clients, the packages include metadata about the "
"updates."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານອັບເດດ client {almalinux}, package ຈະລວມມີ metadata ກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {amazon} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {amazon}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering traditional and Salt "
"clients running {amazon} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {amazon}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:3
msgid "{amazon} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {amazon} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Amazon, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນໃຫ້ໂດຍ Amazon, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Traditional clients are not available on {amazon}{nbsp}2.  {amazon}{nbsp}2 "
"clients are only supported as Salt clients."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນ {amazon}{nbsp}2. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {amazon}{nbsp}2 ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເພາະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When created at AWS, {amazon} instances always have the same `machine-id` id "
"at `/etc/machine-id`.  Make sure you regenerate the `machine-id` after the "
"instance is created.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງໃນ AWS, instances ຂອງ {amazon} ຈະມີ `machine-id` ດຽວກັນສະເໝີຢູ່ທີ່ `/etc/machine-id`. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານສ້າງ `machine-id` ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ instance ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you register {amazon} clients to your {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {amazon}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`.  For full "
"list of supported products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`."

