msgid ""
"Make sure you also add and sync `amazonlinux2-extra-docker` channel if you "
"plan to use Docker at your {amazon} instances."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ `amazonlinux2-extra-docker` ນຳອີກ ຫາກທ່ານວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ Docker ໃນ {amazon} instances ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {amazon} "
"channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {amazon} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {centos} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {centos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering traditional and Salt "
"clients running {centos} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {centos}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#.  Do we need to provide special info for uyuni users?
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:3
msgid "{centos} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {centos} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by CentOS, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນໃຫ້ໂດຍ CentOS, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{centos} clients are based on {centos} and are unrelated to {sleses}, RES, "
"{redhat}, or {es}.  You are responsible for arranging access to {centos} "
"base media repositories and {centos} installation media, as well as "
"connecting {productname} Server to the {centos} content delivery network."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {centos} ແມ່ນອີງຕາມ {centos} ແລະ ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ {sleses}, RES, {redhat}, ຫຼື {es}. ທ່ານມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຈັດຫາການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບສື່ພື້ນຖານຂອງ {centos} ແລະ ສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງ {centos}, ລວມທັງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Server ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍການຈັດສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງ {centos}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before you can register {centos} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {centos}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. The products you need for this procedure are:
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For example, when working with `x86_64` architecture, you need this "
"products:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ `x86_64`, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຜະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "CentOS Products - WebUI"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ CentOS - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Product Name\n"
"| {centos} 7 | CentOS 7 x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ\n"
"| {centos} 7 | CentOS 7 x86_64\n"
"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "CentOS Channels - CLI"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ CentOS - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7-x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7-x86_64\n"
"\n"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel | Client Channel       | Updates/Appstream "
"Channel\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7      | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ | ຊ່ອງທາງ Client | ຊ່ອງທາງ Updates/Appstream\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7 | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:71
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:34
msgid ""
"If you are using modular channels, you must enable the Python 3.6 module "
"stream on the client.  If you do not provide Python 3.6, the installation of "
"the [package]``spacecmd`` package will fail."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ Python 3.6 module stream ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີ Python 3.6, ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacecmd`` ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You might notice some disparity in the number of packages available in the "
"AppStream channel between upstream and the {productname} channel.  You might "
"also see different numbers if you compare the same channel added at a "
"different point in time.  This is due to the way that {centos} manages their "
"repositories.  {centos} removes older version of packages when a new version "
"is released, while {productname} keeps all of them, regardless of age."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະເກັບຮັກສາທຸກເວີຊັນຂອງ package ໄວ້ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເກົ່າສຳໃດກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {centos} "
"channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {centos} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you update {centos} clients, the packages do not include metadata about "
"the updates.  You can use a third-party errata service to obtain this "
"information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອັບເດດ client {centos}, package ຈະບໍ່ມີ metadata ກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ errata ຈາກພາຍນອກເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The third-party errata service described here, CEFS, is provided and "
"maintained by the community.  It is not supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ errata ຈາກພາຍນອກທີ່ກ່າວເຖິງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ຄື CEFS, ແມ່ນໃຫ້ ແລະ ດູແລໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ. ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The authors of CEFS provide patches or errata on a best-effort basis, in the "
"hope they are useful but with no guarantees of correctness or currency.  "
"This could mean that the patch dates could be incorrect, and in at least one "
"case, the published data was shown to be more than a month old.  For more "
"information on these cases, see "
"https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656579382 and "
"https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656573607."
msgstr "ຜູ້ຂຽນ CEFS ສະໜອງ patch ຕາມຄວາມສາມາດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Any problems or delays with the patch data might result in unreliable patch "
"information being imported to your {productname} Server.  This would cause "
"reports, audits, CVE updates, or other patch-related information to also be "
"incorrect.  Please consider alternatives to using this service, such as "
"independently verifying patch data, or choosing a different operating "
"system, depending on your security-related requirements and certifications "
"criteria."
msgstr "ບັນຫາໃດໜຶ່ງກັບຂໍ້ມູນ patch ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname} Server ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing an Errata Service"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງບໍລິການ Errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, from the command prompt, as root, add the "
"``sle-module-development-tools`` module:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ {productname}, ຈາກ command prompt ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂມດູນ ``sle-module-development-tools``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:39
msgid "Install errata service dependencies:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ dependency ຂອງບໍລິການ errata:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"
msgstr "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:41
msgid "Add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = "
"centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"
msgstr "java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:43
msgid "Restart Tomcat:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ Tomcat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:45
msgid "Create a file for your errata script:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບ errata script ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"
msgstr "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Edit the new file to include this script, editing the repository details as "
"required."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃສ່ script ນີ້, ພ້ອມແກ້ໄຂລາຍລະອຽດ repository ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:48
msgid ""
"This script fetches the errata details from an external errata service, "
"unpacks it, and publishes the details:"
msgstr "script ນີ້ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ errata ຈາກບໍລິການພາຍນອກ, ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ລາຍລະອຽດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c "
"https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras "
"\\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras \\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:50
msgid "Set up a cron job to run the script daily:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ cron job ເພື່ອລັນ script ນີ້ເປັນປະຈຳທຸກມື້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"
msgstr "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:52
msgid "For more information on this tool, see https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ເບິ່ງ https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {debian} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {debian}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering Salt clients running "
"{debian} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {debian}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{debian} is supported for Salt clients only.  Traditional clients are not "
"supported."
msgstr "{debian} ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping can be used with {debian} clients for performing initial state "
"runs, and for profile updates."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ Bootstrapping ກັບ client {debian} ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ອັບເດດ profile."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:5
msgid "{debian} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {debian} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:6
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Debian, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນໃຫ້ໂດຍ Debian, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. // 2022-07-26, ke: old and probably outdated statement
#. [IMPORTANT]
#. ====
#. {suse} does not provide support for {debian} operating systems.
#. {productname} allows you to manage {debian} clients, but support is not provided.
#. Using {productname} to manage {debian} clients is experimental.
#. These instructions have been tested on {debian}{nbsp}11.
#. Do not rely on {debian} clients in a production environment.
#. ====
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{debian} is supported for {salt} clients only.  Traditional clients are not "
"supported."
msgstr "{debian} ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Register"
msgstr "ກຽມຕົວລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Some preparation is required before you can register {debian} clients to the "
"{productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຽມຕົວບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {debian}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Ensure DNS is correctly configured and provides an entry for the client.  "
"Alternatively, you can configure the ``/etc/hosts`` files on both the "
"{productname} Server and the client with the appropriate entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ DNS ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/hosts`` ໃນທັງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The client must have the date and time synchronized with the {productname} "
"Server before registration."
msgstr "client ຕ້ອງມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Before you can register {debian} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {debian}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian Products - WebUI"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ Debian - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version  | Product Name\n"
"| {debian} 11 | Debian 11\n"
"| {debian} 12 | Debian 12\n"
msgstr ""
"| OS Version  | Product Name\n"
"| {debian} 11 | Debian 11\n"
"| {debian} 12 | Debian 12\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian Channels - CLI"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Debian - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version  | Product Name\n"
"| {debian} 11 | debian-11-pool-amd64\n"
"| {debian} 12 | debian-12-pool-amd64\n"
msgstr ""
"| OS Version  | Product Name\n"
"| {debian} 11 | debian-11-pool-amd64\n"
"| {debian} 12 | debian-12-pool-amd64\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:23
msgid ""
"{debian} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {debian} ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:28
msgid "{debian} clients can require multiple GPG keys to be installed."
msgstr "client {debian} ອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ GPG keys ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:29
msgid ""
"When synchronizing third-party {debian} repositories, you will need to "
"import the appropriate GPG key on the server.  If the GPG key is missing, "
"synchronization will fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ຂອງພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For {debian} repositories, only the metadata is signed. Therefore importing "
"a GPG key for the software channel is not needed.  Packages will not be "
"re-signed by Uyuni."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ repository ຂອງ {debian}, ມີພຽງ metadata ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກເຊັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To see which GPG keys are already imported to {productname} Server, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າ GPG keys ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"
msgstr "sudo gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:33
msgid "To import a new GPG key, use the `--import` parameter:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ `--import`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --import <filename>.gpg\n"
msgstr "sudo gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --import <filename>.gpg\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Root Access"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Root"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:36
msgid "The root user on {debian} is disabled by default for SSH access."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, root user ເທິງ {debian} ຈະຖືກປິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:37
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:25
msgid ""
"To be able to onboard using a regular user, you need to edit the "
"[filename]``sudoers`` file."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຂຶ້ນລະບົບ (onboard) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [filename]``sudoers``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:38
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Granting Root User Access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Root User"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:39
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:28
msgid "On the client, edit the [filename]``sudoers`` file:"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [filename]``sudoers``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:40
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:36
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo visudo\n"
msgstr "sudo visudo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:41
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:37
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Grant [command]``sudo`` access to the user by adding this line at the end of "
"the [filename]``sudoers`` file.  Replace [systemitem]``<user>`` with the "
"name of the user that is bootstrapping the client in the {webui}:"
msgstr "ມອບສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [command]``sudo`` ໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ຢູ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ [filename]``sudoers``. ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [systemitem]``<user>`` ເປັນຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດການ bootstrap ລູກຂ່າຍໃນ {webui}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:42
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:38
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python, /usr/bin/python2, /usr/bin/python3, "
"/var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"
msgstr "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python, /usr/bin/python2, /usr/bin/python3, /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:43
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:39
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:32
msgid ""
"This procedure grants root access without requiring a password, which is "
"required for registering the client.  When the client is successfully "
"installed it runs with root privileges, so the access is no longer "
"required.  We recommend that you remove the line from the [path]``sudoers`` "
"file after the client has been successfully installed."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະມອບສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະດັບ root ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ. ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍສິດ root, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານລຶບແຖວດັ່ງກ່າວອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``sudoers`` ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {opensuse} Leap Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {opensuse} Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering {salt} clients running "
"{opensuse} operating systems.  {productname} supports {opensuse} Leap 15 "
"clients using {salt}.  Traditional clients are not supported."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {opensuse}. {productname} ຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {opensuse} Leap 15 ທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt}. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping is supported for starting {opensuse} clients and performing "
"initial state runs such as setting repositories and performing profile "
"updates."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ Bootstrapping ສຳລັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລູກຂ່າຍ {opensuse} ແລະ ການດຳເນີນງານໃນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you register {opensuse} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {opensuse} ເຂົ້າກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນພວກມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:8
