msgid ""
"{opensuse} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {opensuse} ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {oracle} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {oracle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering traditional and Salt "
"clients running {oracle} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {oracle}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:3
msgid "{oracle} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂອງ {oracle} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Oracle, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນໃຫ້ໂດຍ Oracle, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{oracle} base media repositories are freely available for download from "
"https://yum.oracle.com/"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບສື່ພື້ນຖານຂອງ {oracle} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດຟຣີຈາກ https://yum.oracle.com/"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Direct synchronizing Unbreakable Linux Network (ULN) repositories with "
"{productname} are not currently supported.  An Oracle Local Distribution for "
"ULN must be used.  For more information about setting up a local ULN mirror, "
"see the Oracle documentation provided at "
"https://docs.oracle.com/en/operating-systems/oracle-linux/software-management/sfw-mgmt-UseSoftwareDistributionMirrors.html#local-uln-mirror."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ULN ໂດຍກົງ. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Oracle Local Distribution ສຳລັບ ULN ແທນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Traditional clients are not available on {oracle}{nbsp}9 and 8.  "
"{oracle}{nbsp}9 and {oracle}{nbsp}8 clients are only supported as Salt "
"clients."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນ {oracle}{nbsp}9 ແລະ 8. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {oracle}{nbsp}9 ແລະ {oracle}{nbsp}8 ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເພາະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you register {oracle} clients to your {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {oracle}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

