#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For {oracle} 9 and {oracle} 8 clients, add both the Base and AppStream "
"channels.  You require packages from both channels.  If you do not add both "
"channels, you cannot create the bootstrap repository, due to missing "
"packages."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {oracle} 9 ແລະ {oracle} 8, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທັງຊ່ອງທາງ Base ແລະ AppStream. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແພັກເກດຈາກທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເພີ່ມທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ bootstrap ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {oracle} "
"channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {oracle} ຂອງທ່ານ."

