#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Select file to upload`` field, browse to the location "
"where you saved the entitlement key, and select the [path]``.pem`` key file."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Select file to upload``, ໃຫ້ບຣາວສ໌ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ທ່ານບັນທຶກ entitlement key ໄວ້, ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຄີ [path]``.pem``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:44
