msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``redhat-uep``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:47
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Select file to upload`` field, browse to the location "
"where you saved the {redhat} certificate, and select the certificate file."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Select file to upload``, ໃຫ້ບຣາວສ໌ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ທ່ານບັນທຶກ {redhat} certificate ໄວ້, ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໃບຮັບຮອງ."

#.  2022-04-21, ke:
#.  Section sequence according to https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-docs/pull/1535
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:50
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Before you register {redhat} clients to your {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {redhat}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:51
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Your {susemgr} subscription entitles you to the tools channels for {sleses} "
"(also known as {redhat} Expanded Support or RES).  You must use the client "
"tools channel to create the bootstrap repository.  This procedure applies to "
"both Salt and traditional clients."
msgstr "ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {susemgr} ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສິດໃນການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບ {sleses} (ຫຼືທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ {redhat} Expanded Support ຫຼື RES). ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືຄຼາຍເອັນເພື່ອສ້າງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ bootstrap. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງຄຼາຍເອັນ Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional)."

