#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Custom Repositories and Channels"
msgstr "ກຽມ Custom Repositories ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To mirror the software from the Red Hat CDN, you need to create custom "
"channels and repositories in {productname} that are linked to the CDN by a "
"URL.  You must have entitlements to these products in your Red Hat Portal "
"for this to work correctly.  You can use the subscription manager tool to "
"get the URLs of the repositories you want to mirror:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດການ Mirror ຊອບແວຈາກ Red Hat CDN, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ {productname} ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ CDN ຜ່ານ URL. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດທິການນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ Red Hat Portal ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື subscription manager ເພື່ອຂໍເອົາ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ Mirror:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "subscription-manager repos\n"
msgstr "subscription-manager repos\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:62
msgid ""
"You can use these repository URLs to create custom repositories.  This "
"allows you to mirror only the content you need to manage your clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ URL ຂອງ repository ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ custom repositories."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:63
msgid ""
"You can only create custom versions of {redhat} repositories if you have the "
"correct entitlements in your {redhat} Portal."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom versions ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີສິດ (entitlements) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ {redhat} Portal."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:64
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:46
msgid "The details you need for this procedure are:"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Red Hat Custom Repository Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Red Hat Custom Repository"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                 | Setting\n"
"| Repository URL         | The content URL provided by {redhat} CDN\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata?   | Uncheck all {redhat} Enterprise repositories\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate     | [systemitem]``redhat-uep``\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | [systemitem]``Entitlement-Cert-date``\n"
"| SSL Client Key         | ``Entitlement-Key-date``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ | ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"| Repository URL | URL ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {redhat} CDN\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata? | ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກສຳລັບທຸກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ {redhat} Enterprise\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate | [systemitem]``redhat-uep``\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | [systemitem]``Entitlement-Cert-date``\n"
"| SSL Client Key | ``Entitlement-Key-date``\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:68
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Red Hat Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat Custom"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Product          | Base Channel\n"
"| {redhat} 7 | RHEL7 Base x86_64 | rhel7-pool-x86_64\n"
"| {redhat} 8 | RHEL or SLES ES or CentOS 8 Base | rhel8-pool-x86_64\n"
"| {redhat} 9 | RHEL and Liberty 9 Base | el9-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຜະລິດຕະພັນຫຼັກ | ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base Channel)\n"
"| {redhat} 7 | RHEL7 Base x86_64 | rhel7-pool-x86_64\n"
"| {redhat} 8 | RHEL ຫຼື SLES ES ຫຼື CentOS 8 Base | rhel8-pool-x86_64\n"
"| {redhat} 9 | RHEL ແລະ Liberty 9 Base | el9-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:70
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:69
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For {redhat} 9 and {redhat} 8 clients, add both the Base and AppStream "
"channels.  You require packages from both channels.  If you do not add both "
"channels, you cannot create the bootstrap repository, due to missing "
"packages."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {redhat} 9 ແລະ {redhat} 8, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທັງຊ່ອງທາງ Base ແລະ AppStream. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແພັກເກດຈາກທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເພີ່ມທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ bootstrap ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:73
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:71
msgid ""
"{rhel} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {rhel} ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
