msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``subscription-manager: disable yum plugins``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:78
