"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type "
"[systemitem]``subscription-manager-disable-yum-plugins``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``subscription-manager-disable-yum-plugins``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type "
"[systemitem]``subscription-manager: disable yum plugins``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``subscription-manager: disable yum plugins``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:80
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``SLS Contents``, ໃຫ້ປະໄວ້ຫວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:81
