msgstr "ໃຫ້ຈົດບັນທຶກຄ່າໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Salt Filesystem Path`` ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:88
msgid "Click on the name of the Configuration Channel."
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງ Configuration Channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:89
