#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Custom Channels"
msgstr "ກຽມຊ່ອງທາງແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:63
msgid ""
"To mirror the software from RHUI, you need to create custom channels in "
"{productname} that are linked to autogenerated repositories."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດການ mirror ຊອບແວຈາກ RHUI, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ custom channels ໃນ {productname} ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ repositories ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
