msgid "| {redhat} 7 | RHEL7 Base x86_64 | rhel7-pool-x86_64"
msgstr "| {redhat} 7 | RHEL7 Base x86_64 | rhel7-pool-x86_64"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Trusting a GPG key is important for security on clients.  It is the task of "
"the administrator to decide which keys are needed and can be trusted.  "
"Because a software channel cannot be used when the GPG key is not trusted, "
"the decision of assigning a channel to a client depends on the decision of "
"trusting the key."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ແມ່ນສຳຄັນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພ. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າ key ໃດທີ່ຄວນເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rocky} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {rocky} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering Salt clients running "
"{rocky} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {rocky}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Traditional clients are not available on {rocky}.  {rocky} clients are only "
"supported as Salt clients."
msgstr "ຄຼາຍເອັນແບບດັ້ງເດີມບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {rocky}. ຄຼາຍເອັນ {rocky} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນຮູບແບບຄຼາຍເອັນ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:4
msgid "{rocky} repository URLs are available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {rocky} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Packages and metadata are provided by Rocky Enterprise Software Foundation, "
"not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata) ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ Rocky Enterprise Software Foundation, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Registering {rocky} clients to {productname} is tested with the default "
"SELinux configuration of ``enforcing`` with a ``targeted`` policy.  You do "
"not need to disable SELinux to register {rocky} clients to {productname}."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນ {rocky} ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SELinux ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື ``enforcing`` ຮ່ວມກັບນະໂຍບາຍ ``targeted``. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດການໃຊ້ງານ SELinux ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນ {rocky} ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you can register {rocky} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ {rocky} clients ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`, on "
"version 9 additionally {ppc64le} and {s390x}.  For full list of supported "
"products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`, ໃນເວີຊັນ 9 ຍັງຮອງຮັບ {ppc64le} ແລະ {s390x} ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

