#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Base Media"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສື່ພື້ນຖານ (Base Media)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The {sll} software channels only provide updates, not the packages "
"themselves.  To register {sll} clients, first register the {sll} Product "
"(outlined below) to create the base channel, then import the necessary Red "
"Hat or CentOS packages as custom child channels.  Initial packages must be "
"obtained directly from Red Hat or CentOS before applying updates from "
"{sll}.  Importantly, you do not need to maintain your Red Hat subscriptions, "
"but consult your legal department to check for any ongoing payment "
"obligations to Red Hat during migration.  To ensure you have all the "
"packages you need, use a full DVD image, not a minimal or {jeos} image."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ {sll} ໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ການອັບເດດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີຕົວແພັກເກັດໃຫ້. ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ {sll}, ກ່ອນອື່ນໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sll} (ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ) ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າແພັກເກັດ Red Hat ຫຼື CentOS ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຂໍຮັບແພັກເກັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍກົງຈາກ Red Hat ຫຼື CentOS ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຈາກ {sll}. ສິ່ງສຳຄັນແມ່ນ ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮັກສາການສະໝັກໃຊ້ Red Hat ຂອງທ່ານໄວ້, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ປຶກສາກັບຝ່າຍກົດໝາຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຄວາມແນ່ໃຈ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ DVD image ແບບເຕັມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ minimal ຫຼື {jeos}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can use {productname} custom channels to set up the {rhel} or {centos} "
"media.  All packages on the base media must be mirrored into a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} custom channels ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສື່ຂອງ {rhel} ຫຼື {centos} ໄດ້. packages ທັງໝົດໃນ base media ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກ mirror ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ child channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:32
msgid "You can freely choose the names for the channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊື່ສຳລັບ channels ໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Base Media to Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມສື່ພື້ນຖານເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:36
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, copy the base "
"media image to the [path]``/tmp/`` directory."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ base media image ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/tmp/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:37
msgid "Create a directory to contain the media content."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເພື່ອເກັບເນື້ອຫາຂອງສື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:38
msgid "Replace [command]``<os_name>`` with either ``sll7``, ``sll8``, or ``sll9``:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [command]``<os_name>`` ເປັນ ``sll7``, ``sll8``, ຫຼື ``sll9``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p /srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>\n"
msgstr "mkdir -p /srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:40
msgid "Mount the image:"
msgstr "Mount ໄຟລ໌ image:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "mount -o loop /tmp/<iso_filename> /srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>\n"
msgstr "mount -o loop /tmp/<iso_filename> /srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:42
msgid "Import the packages into the child channel you created earlier:"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າ packages ເຂົ້າໃນ child channel ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>/<repopath>/\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/htdocs/pub/<os_name>/<repopath>/\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add Base Media from a Content URL"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມສື່ພື້ນຖານຈາກ URL ຂອງເນື້ອຫາ (Content URL)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you have access to a content URL provided by {redhat} CDN "
"or {centos}, you can create a custom repository to mirror the packages."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ຫາກທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {redhat} CDN ຫຼື {centos}, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom repository ເພື່ອ mirror ຕົວ packages ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "ES Custom Repository Settings"
msgstr "ES Custom Repository Settings"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                 | Parameter\n"
"| Repository URL         | The content URL provided by {redhat} CDN or "
"{centos}\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata?   | Uncheck all {redhat} Enterprise repositories\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate     | [systemitem]``redhat-uep`` ({redhat} only)\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | [systemitem]``Entitlement-Cert-date`` ({redhat} "
"only)\n"
"| SSL Client Key         | ``Entitlement-Key-date`` ({redhat} only)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ | ພາຣາມີເຕີ\n"
"| Repository URL         | URL ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສະໜອງໂດຍ {redhat} CDN ຫຼື {centos}\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata?   | ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທຸກຄັງຊອບແວ {redhat} Enterprise\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate     | [systemitem]``redhat-uep`` (ສະເພາະ {redhat})\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | [systemitem]``Entitlement-Cert-date`` (ສະເພາະ {redhat})\n"
"| SSL Client Key         | ``Entitlement-Key-date`` (ສະເພາະ {redhat})\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The {sll} channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "{sll} channels ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ channel ຄັ້ງທຳອິດບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເຖິງຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:51
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງຄ໌ຄັ້ງທຳອິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໂຄນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄວ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງຄ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sll} Clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {sll} Clients"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll}"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍ (migrate) Enterprise Linux (EL) clients ໄປສູ່ {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If an Enterprise Linux (EL) client such as RHEL and all clones (like "
"{centos}, {almalinux}, {rocky}, and {oracle}) is already registered as a "
"minion on {productname} and users want to migrate it to {sll} they can use a "
"re-activation key to apply the activation key that drives the migration."
msgstr "ຫາກຄຼາຍເອັນ Enterprise Linux (EL) ເຊັ່ນ RHEL ແລະ ທຸກເວີຊັນ Clone (ເຊັ່ນ {centos}, {almalinux}, {rocky}, ແລະ {oracle}) ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ minion ໃນ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປ {sll}, ພວກເຂົາສາມາດໃຊ້ re-activation key ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ activation key ທີ່ເປັນຕົວຂັບເຄື່ອນການຍ້າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:55
msgid ""
"For more information about re-activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#reactivation[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ re-activation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#reactivation[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:56
msgid ""
"The re-activation key is per minion, and can be generated with the {webui} "
"or using the API.  For more information, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/api/suse-manager/api/system.html#apidoc-system-obtainReactivationKey-loggedInUser-sid."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະມິນນຽນ (minion), ແລະ ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {webui} ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ API.  ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/api/suse-manager/api/system.html#apidoc-system-obtainReactivationKey-loggedInUser-sid."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:57
msgid ""
"To re-activate a client, the user can run the bootstrap script on the client "
"and pass the re-activation key as an environment variable.  Example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດການ re-activate client, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຣັນ bootstrap script ໃນ client ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າ re-activation key ເປັນ environment variable. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"
msgstr "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Another method is to add some special flags to the {salt} client "
"configuration file located at "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` (or "
"[path]``/etc/salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf``) the following content "
"(join this content with the already existing one):"
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງຄືການເພີ່ມແຟລັກ (flags) ພິເສດບາງຢ່າງເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໄຄເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` (ຫຼື [path]``/etc/salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf``) ດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ໃຫ້ຮວມເນື້ອຫານີ້ເຂົ້າກັບເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"        management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"        management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:61
msgid ""
"After changing the [path]``susemanager.conf`` file, the "
"[systemitem]``salt-minion`` service needs to be restarted on the {salt} "
"server.  By default with:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ [path]``susemanager.conf`` ແລ້ວ, ເຊີວິດ [systemitem]``salt-minion`` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຣີສະຕາດ (restarted) ໃນເຊີເວີ {salt}. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:63
msgid "Or for legacy {salt} with:"
msgstr "ຫຼືສຳລັບ {salt} ແບບເກົ່າ (legacy) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [systemitem]``liberate`` formula"
msgstr "ຟໍມູລາ (formula) [systemitem]``liberate``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Migrating Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll} with the "
"[systemitem]``liberate`` formula.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍໄຄເອັນ Enterprise Linux (EL) ໄປຍັງ {sll} ດ້ວຍຟໍມູລາ [systemitem]``liberate``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sl-micro} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {sl-micro} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running "
"{nbsp}{sl-micro} operating system 6.0 {x86_64}, {arm64}, and {zsystems} "
"(s390x)."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {nbsp}{sl-micro} 6.0 ສຳລັບ {x86_64}, {arm64}, ແລະ {zsystems} (s390x)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {sl-micro} is an ultra-reliable, lightweight operating system purpose "
"built for edge computing.  It leverages the enterprise hardened security and "
"compliance components of SUSE Linux Enterprise and merges them with a "
"modern, immutable, developer-friendly OS platform."
msgstr "{sl-micro} ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືສູງ ແລະ ນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ເຊິ່ງສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອ edge computing ໂດຍສະເພາະ. ມັນນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນປະກອບດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ການປະຕິບັດຕາມມາດຕະຖານລະດັບອົງກອນຂອງ SUSE Linux Enterprise ແລະ ລວມເຂົ້າກັບແພລດຟອມ OS ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ, ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ (immutable), ແລະ ເປັນມິດກັບນັກພັດທະນາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {sl-micro} uses transactional updates.  Transactional updates are atomic "
"(all updates are applied only if all updates succeed) and support "
"rollbacks.  They do not affect a running system as no changes are activated "
"until after the system is rebooted.  This information is displayed in the "
"menu:Systems[Details > Overview] subtab."
msgstr "{sl-micro} ໃຊ້ການອັບເດດແບບທຸລະກຳ (transactional updates). ການອັບເດດແບບທຸລະກຳແມ່ນມີລັກສະນະ atomic (ການອັບເດດທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອການອັບເດດທັງໝົດສຳເລັດ) ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຍ້ອນກັບ (rollbacks). ພວກມັນບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດລັນຢູ່ ເນື່ອງຈາກຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ຈົນກວ່າລະບົບຈະຖືກຣີບູດ (reboot). ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Systems[Details > Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before you register {sl-micro} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ {sl-micro} ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນພວກມັນ."

