#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{sl-micro} clients require a reboot after registering.  Although a reboot is "
"automatically scheduled after registration is completed, it is respecting "
"the default reboot manager maintenance window.  This window may be several "
"hours after the client is registered.  It is advisable to manually reboot "
"the client after the registration script finishes, to speed up the "
"registration and to see the system appear in the system list."
msgstr "{sl-micro} clients ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ reboot ຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນ. ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີການຕັ້ງເວລາ reboot ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະປະຕິບັດຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ຂອງຕົວຈັດການ reboot. ຊ່ວງເວລານີ້ອາດຈະເປັນເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ client ຖືກລົງທະບຽນ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ reboot client ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ script ການລົງທະບຽນສິ້ນສຸດ ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"When using a bootstrap script with {sl-micro} systems, ensure that the "
"certificate section of the script has this content:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ bootstrap script ກັບລະບົບ {sl-micro}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສ່ວນຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ໃນ script ມີເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sl-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sl-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Reboot {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:22
msgid ""
"{sl-micro} is a transactional system.  Transactional updates in general "
"support several reboot methods.  It is recommended to use "
"[systemitem]``systemd`` for rebooting in systems managed by {productname}.  "
"Using other methods can lead to undesired behavior."
msgstr "{sl-micro} ແມ່ນລະບົບແບບທຣານແຊັກຊັນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວການອັບເດດແບບທຣານແຊັກຊັນຮອງຮັບວິທີການຣີບູດຫຼາຍແບບ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``systemd`` ສຳລັບການຣີບູດໃນລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}. ການໃຊ້ວິທີອື່ນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#
#.  2023-05-23, ke: The rest is commented and the user will not see the
#.                  following remarks/background info:
#. Otherwise, the only thing Suma will be able to do is to ask for a reboot and it will be managed in the peculiarities of each reboot method. Not having control of when the reboot should happen, also takes away from Suma the ability to perform the reboot on its own maintenance windows, which is not the ideal configuration.
#. The user must be able to change reboot method at any time and SUSE Manager will keep it. But in this case we should alert in the documentation that using any method different from systemd may cause undesired behavior.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {ubuntu} 18.04 Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ {ubuntu} 18.04"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports {ubuntu} 20.04 LTS and 22.04 LTS clients using Salt.  "
"For information about registering Salt clients running {ubuntu} 20.04 and "
"22.04, see xref:client-configuration:clients-ubuntu.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບຄຼາຍເອັນ {ubuntu} 20.04 LTS ແລະ 22.04 LTS ໂດຍໃຊ້ Salt. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ {ubuntu} 20.04 ແລະ 22.04, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-ubuntu.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:3
msgid "{ubuntu} 18.04 LTS has reached end-of-life."
msgstr "{ubuntu} 18.04 LTS ໄດ້ສິ້ນສຸດໄລຍະເວລາການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (end-of-life) ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:4
msgid "{ubuntu} 18.04 repository URLs are not available from {scc}"
msgstr "URL ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {ubuntu} 18.04 ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Ubuntu, not by {suse}"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເມຕາເດຕາ ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ Ubuntu, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:7
msgid "Canonical does not endorse or support {productname}"
msgstr "Canonical ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ການຮັບຮອງ ຫຼື ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{ubuntu} is supported for Salt clients only.  Traditional clients are not "
"supported."
msgstr "{ubuntu} ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຄຼາຍເອັນ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຼາຍເອັນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping is supported for starting {ubuntu} clients and performing "
"initial state runs such as setting repositories and performing profile "
"updates.  However, the root user on {ubuntu} is disabled by default, so to "
"use bootstrapping, you require an existing user with [command]``sudo`` "
"privileges for Python."
msgstr "ການບູດສແຕຣັບແມ່ນຮອງຮັບສຳລັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄຄເອັນ {ubuntu} ແລະ ການຣັນສະຖານະເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ໃນ {ubuntu} ແມ່ນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເພື່ອໃຊ້ການບູດສແຕຣັບ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວທີ່ມີສິດ [command]``sudo`` ສຳລັບ Python."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering {salt} clients running "
"{ubuntu} 18.04 LTS operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນຄຼາຍເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {ubuntu} 18.04 LTS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you register {ubuntu} clients to your {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ {ubuntu} clients ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

