#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Channels added using this method do not synchronize regularly by default.  "
"You can configure a synchronization schedule using the {productname} "
"{webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you added, and select the menu:Repositories[Sync] subtab.  Set a daily or "
"weekly synchronization schedule, and click btn:[Schedule]."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນເປັນປະຈຳໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງການຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}. ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຄລິກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານເພີ່ມ, ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Repositories[Sync]. ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງການຊິງຄ໌ແບບລາຍວັນ ຫຼື ລາຍອາທິດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:18
msgid ""
"{ubuntu} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "{ubuntu} channels ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:24
msgid "The root user on {ubuntu} is disabled by default for SSH access."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ໃນ {ubuntu} ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu-old.adoc:33
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:26
msgid ""
"This issue happens with self-installed versions of {ubuntu}.  If the default "
"user has been granted administrative privileges during installation time, a "
"password is required to perform privilege escalation using "
"[command]``sudo``.  With cloud instances this does not happen because "
"[command]``cloud-init`` automatically creates a file under "
"[path]``/etc/sudoers.d`` and grants privilege escalation through "
"[command]``sudo`` without the need for a password."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ {ubuntu} ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຮັບສິດໃນການດູແລລະບົບໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອຍົກລະດັບສິດໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``sudo``. ສຳລັບ cloud instances ບັນຫານີ້ຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ ເພາະ [command]``cloud-init`` ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃຕ້ [path]``/etc/sudoers.d`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ມອບສິດໃນການຍົກລະດັບສິດຜ່ານ [command]``sudo`` ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

