#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Traditional Clients for Configuration Management"
msgstr "ກຽມລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມສຳລັບການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Traditional clients require some extra preparation to use configuration "
"management.  If you installed your traditional client with {ay} or "
"{kickstart} you probably already have the appropriate packages.  For other "
"traditional clients, ensure you have installed the relevant tools child "
"channel for your client operating system.  For more information about "
"software channels, see xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມຕ້ອງການການກຽມຕົວເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມດ້ວຍ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart} ເຈົ້າອາດຈະມີແພັກເກດທີ່ເໝາະສົມຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງເຄື່ອງມື (tools child channel) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍເຈົ້າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:18
msgid "The packages you require are:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:19
msgid ""
"[path]``mgr-cfg``: base libraries and functions needed by all "
"[path]``mgr-cfg-*`` packages"
msgstr "[path]``mgr-cfg``: ໄລບຣາຣີພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບທຸກໆແພັກເກດ [path]``mgr-cfg-*``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"[path]``mgr-cfg-actions``: required to run configuration actions scheduled "
"using {productname}."
msgstr "[path]``mgr-cfg-actions``: ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລັນການດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"[path]``mgr-cfg-client``: provides a command line interface to the client "
"features of the configuration management system."
msgstr "[path]``mgr-cfg-client``: ສະໜອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ແບບບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ໃຫ້ກັບຟີເຈີລູກຂ່າຍຂອງລະບົບການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"[path]``mgr-cfg-management``: provides a command line interface to manage "
"{productname} configuration."
msgstr "[path]``mgr-cfg-management``: ສະໜອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ແບບບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You can install these packages during the bootstrap process by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Activation Keys], clicking the activation key you intend to use "
"during bootstrap, and checking the [guimenu]``Configuration File "
"Deployment`` option.  For more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ bootstrap ໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys], ຄລິກທີ່ activation key ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຈຈະໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ bootstrap, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກໂຕເລືອກ [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new central configuration channel:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບລວມສູນໃໝ່:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Central Configuration Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບລວມສູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels], and "
"click btn:[Create Config Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Config Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:36
msgid "Type a name for the channel."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:37
msgid "Type a label for the channel."
msgstr "ພິມ label ສຳລັບ channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"This field must contain only letters, numbers, hyphens (``-``) and "
"underscores (``_``)."
msgstr "ຟິວ (field) ນີ້ຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກາງ (``-``) ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (``_``) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Type a description for the channel that allows you to distinguish it from "
"other channels."
msgstr "ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບ channel ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຈຳແນກມັນອອກຈາກ channel ອື່ນໆໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:41
msgid "Click btn:[Create Config Channel] to create the new channel."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Config Channel] ເພື່ອສ້າງ channel ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"You can also use a configuration channel to manage Salt states on Salt "
"clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຈັດການ Salt states ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໄດ້ນຳ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Salt State Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels], and "
"click btn:[Create State Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create State Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:40
msgid "Type the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` for the [path]``init.sls`` file."
msgstr "ພິມ [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ [path]``init.sls``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Configuration Files, Directories, or Symbolic Links"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ຫຼື Symbolic Links"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:43
msgid ""
"When you have created a configuration channel you can add a configuration "
"file, directory, or symbolic link:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ channel ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ຫຼື symbolic link ໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Configuration File, Directory, or Symbolic Link"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ຫຼື Symbolic Link"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels], and "
"click the name of the configuration channel that you want to add a "
"configuration file to, and navigate to the menu:Add Files[Create File] "
"subtab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງ channel ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌, ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Add Files[Create File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``File Type`` field, choose whether you want to create a "
"text file, directory, or symbolic link."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``File Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text file), ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ຫຼື symbolic link."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:47
msgid ""
"In the [path]``Filename/Path`` field, type the absolute path to the location "
"where the file should be deployed."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [path]``Filename/Path``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (absolute path) ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are creating a symbolic link, type the target file and path in the "
"[guimenu]``Symbolic Link Target Filename/Path`` field."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງ symbolic link, ໃຫ້ພິມໄຟລ໌ປາຍທາງ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Symbolic Link Target Filename/Path``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Type the [guimenu]``User name`` and [guimenu]``Group name`` for the file in "
"the [guimenu]``Ownership`` field, and the [guimenu]``File Permissions "
"Mode``."
msgstr "ພິມ [guimenu]``User name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Group name`` ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Ownership``, ແລະ ລະບຸ [guimenu]``File Permissions Mode``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"If the client has SELinux enabled, you can configure [guimenu]``SELinux "
"contexts`` to enable the required file attributes (for example: user, role, "
"and file type)."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຄເອັນມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ SELinux, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [guimenu]``SELinux contexts`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: user, role, ແລະ file type)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:51
msgid ""
"If the configuration file includes a macro, enter the symbol that marks the "
"beginning and end of the macro."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມີມາໂຄຣ (macro), ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍທີ່ລະບຸຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງມາໂຄຣ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Enter the configuration file contents in the [guimenu]``File Contents`` text "
"box, using the script drop-down box to choose the appropriate scripting "
"language."
msgstr "ປ້ອນເນື້ອຫາຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``File Contents``, ໂດຍໃຊ້ກ່ອງ drop-down ເພື່ອເລືອກພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create Configuration File]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Configuration File]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscribe Clients to Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:55
msgid ""
"You can subscribe individual clients to configuration channels by navigating "
"to menu:Systems[System List], selecting the client you want to subscribe, "
"and navigating to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab.  To subscribe multiple "
"clients to a configuration channel, you can use the system set manager "
"(SSM)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List], ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Configuration``. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພ້ອມກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ system set manager (SSM)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Subscribing Multiple Clients to Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the clients you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກ clients ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] subtab to see the list of "
"available configuration channels."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Set Manager], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:59
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Click the number in the [guimenu]``Systems currently subscribed`` "
"column to see which clients are currently subscribed to the configuration "
"channel."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຄລິກໃສ່ຕົວເລກໃນຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Systems currently subscribed`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າໄຄເອັນເຄື່ອງໃດແດ່ທີ່ກຳລັງສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Check the configuration channels you want to subscribe to, and click "
"btn:[Continue]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະໝັກ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Continue]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:61
msgid "Rank the configuration channels using the up and down arrows."
msgstr "ຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Where settings conflicts occur between configuration channels, channels "
"closer to the top of the list take precedence."
msgstr "ຫາກເກີດການຂັດແຍ້ງກັນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ channels, channel ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທາງເທິງຂອງລາຍຊື່ຈະມີສິດເໜືອກວ່າ (take precedence)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:63
msgid "Determine how the channels are applied to the selected clients."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ channels ກັບ clients ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Subscribe With Lowest Priority] to add the new channels at a "
"lower priority than currently subscribed channels.  Click btn:[Subscribe "
"with Highest Priority] to add the new channels at a higher priority than "
"currently subscribed channels.  Click btn:[Replace Existing Subscriptions] "
"to remove existing channels and replace them with the new channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe With Lowest Priority] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ channel ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຕ່ຳກວ່າ channel ທີ່ສະໝັກຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe with Highest Priority] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ channel ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າ. ຄລິກ btn:[Replace Existing Subscriptions] ເພື່ອລຶບ channel ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ channel ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:65
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Subscriptions]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Subscriptions]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:66
msgid ""
"If new configuration channel priorities conflict with existing channels, the "
"duplicate channel is removed and replaced according to the new priority.  If "
"the client's configuration priorities are going to be reordered by an "
"action, the {webui} requires you to confirm the change before proceeding."
msgstr "ຫາກລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ channel ໃໝ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັບ channel ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, channel ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃໝ່. ຫາກລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ client ຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່, {webui} ຈະໃຫ້ທ່ານຢືນຢັນການປ່ຽນແປງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Configuration Files"
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"You can also use the system set manager (SSM) to compare the configuration "
"file deployed on clients with the configuration file stored on the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ system set manager (SSM) ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ clients ກັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Comparing Configuration Files"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:70
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the clients subscribed to the configuration files you want to "
"compare."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກ clients ທີ່ສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຽບທຽບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files] subtab to the list of available "
"configuration files."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Set Manager], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Configuration[Compare Files] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:72
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Click the number in the [guimenu]``Systems`` column to see which "
"clients are currently subscribed to the configuration file."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຄລິກໃສ່ຕົວເລກໃນຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Systems`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າໄຄເອັນເຄື່ອງໃດແດ່ທີ່ກຳລັງສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Check the configuration files to compare, and click btn:[Schedule File "
"Comparison]."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການປຽບທຽບ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule File Comparison]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jinja templating on {salt} clients"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເທັມເພລດ Jinja ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Jinja templating is possible on {salt} clients.  Jinja provides variables "
"from pillars or grains.  They can be used in configuration files or {salt} "
"states."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Jinja templating ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນໄຄເອັນ {salt}. Jinja ຈະສະໜອງຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables) ຈາກ pillars ຫຼື grains. ພວກມັນສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫຼື ສະຖານະຂອງ {salt} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:76
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/salt/user-guide/en/latest/topics/jinja.html with "
"this example:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/salt/user-guide/en/latest/topics/jinja.html ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if grains.os_family == 'RedHat' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% elif grains.os_family == 'Debian' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/bind/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
"dns_conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: {{ dns_cfg }}\n"
"    - source: salt://dns/files/named.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if grains.os_family == 'RedHat' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% elif grains.os_family == 'Debian' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/bind/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
"dns_conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: {{ dns_cfg }}\n"
"    - source: salt://dns/files/named.conf\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration file macros on traditional clients"
msgstr "ມາໂຄຣໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Being able to store one file and share identical configurations is useful, "
"but in some cases you might need many variations of the same configuration "
"file, or configuration files that differ only in system-specific details, "
"such as host name and MAC address.  In this case, you can use macros or "
"variables within the configuration files.  This allows you to upload and "
"distribute a single file, with hundreds or even thousands of variations.  In "
"addition to variables for custom system information, the following standard "
"macros are supported:"
msgstr "ການສາມາດເກັບໄຟລ໌ດຽວ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄືກັນນັ້ນເປັນປະໂຫຍດ, ແຕ່ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ, ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນພຽງແຕ່ລາຍລະອຽດສະເພາະຂອງລະບົບ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊື່ໂຮສ໌ (host name) ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ມາໂຄຣ ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນ ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າອັບໂຫຼດ ແລະ ແຈກຢາຍໄຟລ໌ດຽວ ທີ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ເປັນຮ້ອຍ ຫຼື ເປັນພັນແບບ. ນອກຈາກຕົວປ່ຽນສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງແລ້ວ, ຍັງມີມາໂຄຣມາດຕະຖານດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn.system.sid\n"
"rhn.system.profile_name\n"
"rhn.system.description\n"
"rhn.system.hostname\n"
"rhn.system.ip_address\n"
"rhn.system.custom_info(key_name)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.ip_address(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.netmask(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.broadcast(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.hardware_address(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.driver_module(eth_device)\n"
msgstr ""
"rhn.system.sid\n"
"rhn.system.profile_name\n"
"rhn.system.description\n"
"rhn.system.hostname\n"
"rhn.system.ip_address\n"
"rhn.system.custom_info(key_name)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.ip_address(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.netmask(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.broadcast(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.hardware_address(eth_device)\n"
"rhn.system.net_interface.driver_module(eth_device)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:81
msgid ""
"To use this feature, either upload or create a configuration file via the "
"[guimenu]``Configuration Channel Details`` page.  Then open its "
"[guimenu]``Configuration File Details`` page and include the supported "
"macros of your choice.  Ensure that the delimiters used to offset your "
"variables match those set in the [guimenu]``Macro Start Delimiter`` and "
"[guimenu]``Macro End Delimiter`` fields and do not conflict with other "
"characters in the file.  We recommend that the delimiters be two characters "
"in length and do not contain the percent (``%``) symbol."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້, ໃຫ້ອັບໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານໜ້າ [guimenu]``Configuration Channel Details``. ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດໜ້າ [guimenu]``Configuration File Details`` ຂອງມັນ ແລະ ໃສ່ມາໂຄຣທີ່ຮອງຮັບຕາມທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຕົວແຍກ (delimiters) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕົວປ່ຽນຂອງເຈົ້ານັ້ນກົງກັບທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Macro Start Delimiter`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Macro End Delimiter`` ແລະ ບໍ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັບຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆໃນໄຟລ໌. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕົວແຍກມີຄວາມຍາວສອງຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍເປີເຊັນ (``%``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:82
msgid ""
"For example, you may have a file applicable to all of your servers that "
"differs only in IP address and host name.  Rather than manage a separate "
"configuration file for each server, you can create a single file, such as "
"[path]``server.conf``, with the IP address and host name macros included."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າອາດຈະມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບເຊີເວີທັງໝົດຂອງເຈົ້າ ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງກັນພຽງແຕ່ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ໌. ແທນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈັດການໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ດຽວ ເຊັ່ນ [path]``server.conf`` ໂດຍໃສ່ມາໂຄຣສຳລັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ໌ໄວ້ນຳ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hostname={| rhn.system.hostname |}\n"
"ip_address={| rhn.system.net_interface.ip_address(eth0) |}\n"
msgstr ""
"hostname={| rhn.system.hostname |}\n"
"ip_address={| rhn.system.net_interface.ip_address(eth0) |}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:84
msgid ""
"When the file is delivered to individual systems, whether through a "
"scheduled action in the {productname} {webui} or at the command line with "
"the {productname} Configuration Client ([command]``mgrcfg-client``), the "
"variables will be replaced with the host name and IP address of the system "
"as recorded in {productname}'s system profile.  In this example, the "
"deployed version will look similar to this:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງແຕ່ລະລະບົບ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ຫຼື ຜ່ານບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍ {productname} Configuration Client ([command]``mgrcfg-client``), ຕົວປ່ຽນຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂຮສ໌ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງລະບົບຕາມທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ລະບົບຂອງ {productname}. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hostname=test.example.domain.com\n"
"ip_address=177.18.54.7\n"
msgstr ""
"hostname=test.example.domain.com\n"
"ip_address=177.18.54.7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:86
msgid ""
"To capture custom system information, insert the key label into the custom "
"information macro (``rhn.system.custom_info``).  For example, if you "
"developed a key labeled \"asset\" you can add it to the custom information "
"macro in a configuration file to have the value substituted on any system "
"containing it.  The macro would look like this:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີ (key label) ເຂົ້າໃນມາໂຄຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (``rhn.system.custom_info``). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າສ້າງຄີທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ \"asset\", ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນມາໂຄຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄ່າຂອງມັນຖືກແທນທີ່ໃນລະບົບໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີຄີນັ້ນຢູ່. ມາໂຄຣຈະມີລັກສະນະແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "asset={@ rhn.system.custom_info(asset) @}\n"
msgstr "asset={@ rhn.system.custom_info(asset) @}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When the file is deployed to a system containing a value for that key, the "
"macro gets translated, resulting in a string similar to this:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີຄ່າສຳລັບຄີນັ້ນ, ມາໂຄຣຈະຖືກແປງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "asset=Example#456\n"
msgstr "asset=Example#456\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:90
msgid ""
"To include a default value (for example, if one is required to prevent "
"errors), you can append it to the custom information macro, like this:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃສ່ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ), ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕໍ່ທ້າຍມັນເຂົ້າໃນມາໂຄຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "asset={@ rhn.system.custom_info(asset) = 'Asset #' @}\n"
msgstr "asset={@ rhn.system.custom_info(asset) = 'Asset #' @}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:92
msgid "This default is overridden by the value on any system containing it."
msgstr "ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານນີ້ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບນັ້ນໆ (ຖ້າມີ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:93
msgid ""
"The {productname} Configuration Manager ([command]``mgrcfg-manager``) is "
"available on {productname} client machines to assist with system "
"management.  It will not translate or alter files, as the tool is system "
"agnostic.  The [command]``mgrcfg-manager`` command does not depend on system "
"settings.  Binary files cannot be interpolated."
msgstr "{productname} Configuration Manager ([command]``mgrcfg-manager``) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດການລະບົບ. ມັນຈະບໍ່ແປ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ ເພາະເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບ (system agnostic). ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgrcfg-manager`` ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ. ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ (Binary files) ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການແທນທີ່ຄ່າ (interpolated) ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Management Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are a number of ways that the {productname} Server can communicate "
"with clients.  Which one you use depends on the type of client, and your "
"network architecture."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ {productname} Server ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ວິທີທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະໃຊ້ນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:3
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {productname} daemon ([command]``rhnsd``) runs on traditional client "
"systems and periodically connects with {productname} to check for new "
"updates and notifications.  It does not apply to Salt clients."
msgstr "ເດມອນ {productname} ([command]``rhnsd``) ລັນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} ເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອເບິ່ງການອັບເດດ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃໝ່ໆ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Push via SSH and Push via Salt SSH are used in environments where clients "
"cannot reach the {productname} Server directly.  In this environment, "
"clients are located in a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  No system "
"within the DMZ is authorized to open a connection to the internal network, "
"including the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Push via SSH ແລະ Push via Salt SSH ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນເຂດທີ່ຖືກປົກປ້ອງດ້ວຍໄຟວໍ (firewall) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ບໍ່ມີລະບົບໃດພາຍໃນ DMZ ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ, ລວມທັງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"OSAD is an alternative contact method between {productname} and traditional "
"clients.  OSAD allows traditional clients to execute scheduled actions "
"immediately.  It does not apply to Salt clients."
msgstr "OSAD ແມ່ນວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທາງເລືອກລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. OSAD ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມສາມາດດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໄດ້ທັນທີ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Traditional Clients to {salt} Clients"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To migrate a system from a traditional to a {salt} client, the user can "
"create a {salt} bootstrap script and re-register the client system with it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບຈາກລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສ້າງ {salt} bootstrap script ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:3
msgid "This could be done by:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:4
msgid "generating a reactivation key for the client,"
msgstr "ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:5
msgid "creating a bootstrap script with a specific activation key, and"
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap script ດ້ວຍ activation key ທີ່ລະບຸ, ແລະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:6
msgid ""
"running the bootstrap script to register the client, with the aforementioned "
"reactivation key."
msgstr "ລັນ bootstrap script ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ ດ້ວຍ reactivation key ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Reactivation Key"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Reactivation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:8
msgid ""
"A reactivation key can be used to re-register the client and regain all "
"{productname} settings.  For more information on how to create reactivation "
"key, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#reactivation_keys[]."
msgstr "Reactivation key ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ທັງໝົດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງ reactivation key, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#reactivation_keys[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Bootstrap Script"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A bootstrap script can be created with the {webui} or from the command "
"line.  For more information about creating bootstrap script, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], and for generating "
"a suitable activation key in advance, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Bootstrap script ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {webui} ຫຼື ຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ bootstrap script, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], ແລະ ສຳລັບການສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Use the activation key you generating in advance when creating the bootstrap "
"script."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ activation key ທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນເວລາສ້າງ bootstrap script."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When the bootstrap script is generated, it is stored on the server in the "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap`` directory.  Alternatively, you can "
"access the bootstrap script over HTTPS.  Replace [literal]``<example.com>`` "
"with the host name of the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ bootstrap script ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີໃນໄດເລັກທໍຣີ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap``. ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາ bootstrap script ຜ່ານ HTTPS ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແທນທີ່ [literal]``<example.com>`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂຮສ໌ຂອງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://<example.com>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh\n"
msgstr "https://<example.com>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Bootstrap script will try to install [package]``venv-salt-minion`` for "
"{salt} clients if it is available in the bootstrap repository, or "
"[package]``salt-minion`` if there is no {salt} bundle in the bootstrap "
"repository.  It is possible to avoid installing {salt} bundle and keep using "
"[package]``salt-minion`` if you need it."
msgstr "Bootstrap script ຈະພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຖ້າມັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຄັງເກັບ (repository) bootstrap, ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``salt-minion`` ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ {salt} bundle ໃນຄັງເກັບ bootstrap. ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {salt} bundle ແລະ ໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ຕໍ່ໄປຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ລັນ Bootstrap Script"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:17
msgid "As the final step, run the bootstrap script to migrate and register clients."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ລັນ bootstrap script ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, sign in as root.  At the command prompt, change "
"to the bootstrap directory:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ root. ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເລັກທໍຣີ bootstrap:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"
msgstr "cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Run the following command to execute the bootstrap script on the client.  "
"Replace [systemitem]``EXAMPLE.COM`` with the hostname of your client, and "
"[systemitem]``REACT_KEY`` with the reactivation key:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການ bootstrap script ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃຫ້ແທນທີ່ [systemitem]``EXAMPLE.COM`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂຮສ໌ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍເຈົ້າ, ແລະ [systemitem]``REACT_KEY`` ດ້ວຍ reactivation key:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat bootstrap-migrate-to-salt.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM "
"REACTIVATION-KEY=REACT_KEY /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "cat bootstrap-migrate-to-salt.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM REACTIVATION-KEY=REACT_KEY /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:23
msgid "Alternatively, on the client, run the command:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-migrate-to-salt.sh "
"| REACTIVATION-KEY=REACT_KEY /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-migrate-to-salt.sh | REACTIVATION-KEY=REACT_KEY /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:25
msgid "The script downloads the required dependencies."
msgstr "Script ຈະດາວໂຫຼດສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Make sure to accept the new {salt} key before looking for your new {salt} "
"minion. You can open the {productname} {webui} and navigate to "
"menu:Salt[Keys] to accept the client key"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຍອມຮັບຄີ {salt} ໃໝ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຊອກຫາ {salt} minion ໃໝ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Keys] ເພື່ອຍອມຮັບຄີຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:27
msgid ""
"When the script has finished running, you can check that your client is "
"registered correctly by opening the {productname} {webui} and navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Overview].  Ensure the new client is listed with the Salt "
"instead of the Management system type."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ script ລັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການເປີດ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview]. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ຖືກສະແດງເປັນປະເພດລະບົບ Salt ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ Management."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:58
msgid ""
"When new packages or updates are installed on the client using "
"{productname}, any end user license agreements (EULAs) are automatically "
"accepted.  To review a package EULA, open the package detail page in the "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname}, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຜູ້ໃຊ້ (EULAs) ໃດໆ ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການ ກວດສອບ EULA ຂອງແພັກເກດ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດແພັກເກດໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about using bootstrap scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ bootstrap scripts, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "OSAD"
msgstr "OSAD"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:2
msgid ""
"OSAD is an alternative contact method between {productname} and traditional "
"clients.  By default, {productname} uses [systemitem]``rhnsd``, which "
"contacts the server every four hours to execute scheduled actions.  OSAD "
"allows traditional clients to execute scheduled actions immediately."
msgstr "OSAD ແມ່ນວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທາງເລືອກລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ໂດຍຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ເຊິ່ງຈະຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທຸກໆ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງເພື່ອດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. OSAD ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມສາມາດດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use OSAD in addition to [systemitem]``rhnsd``.  If you disable "
"[systemitem]``rhnsd`` your client is shown as not checking in after "
"24 hours."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ OSAD ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກ [systemitem]``rhnsd``. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປິດໃຊ້ງານ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຖືກສະແດງວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ລາຍງານຕົວ (not checking in) ຫຼັງຈາກ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:4
msgid "OSAD has several distinct components:"
msgstr "OSAD ມີອົງປະກອບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` service runs on the server, and uses "
"database checks to determine if clients need to be pinged, or if actions "
"need to be executed."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ລັນຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ການກວດສອບຖານຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງຖືກ ping ຫຼື ຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການໃດໜຶ່ງຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``osad`` service runs on the client. It responds to pings "
"from [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` and runs [command]``mgr_check`` to "
"execute actions when directed to do so."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osad`` ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ມັນຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ pings ຈາກ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ແລະ ລັນ [command]``mgr_check`` ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``jabberd`` service is a daemon that uses the "
"[systemitem]``XMPP`` protocol for communication between the client and the "
"server."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ແມ່ນເດມອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ [systemitem]``XMPP`` ສຳລັບການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:8
msgid "The [systemitem]``jabberd`` service also handles authentication."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ຍັງຈັດການເລື່ອງການກວດສອບສິດ (authentication) ນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:9
msgid "The [command]``mgr_check`` tool runs on the client to execute actions."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr_check`` ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:10
msgid ""
"It is triggered by communication from the [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` "
"service."
msgstr "ມັນຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍການສື່ສານຈາກບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` periodically runs a query to check when "
"clients last showed network activity.  If it finds a client that has not "
"shown activity recently, it uses [systemitem]``jabberd`` to ping all "
"[systemitem]``osad`` instances running on all clients registered with your "
"{productname} server.  The [systemitem]``osad`` instances respond to the "
"ping using [systemitem]``jabberd``, which is running in the background on "
"the server.  When the [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` receives the response, "
"it marks the client as online.  If the [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` fails "
"to receive a response within a certain period of time, it marks the client "
"as offline."
msgstr "[systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງກວດສອບເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າລູກຂ່າຍມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍເມື່ອໃດ. ຖ້າມັນພົບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ເພື່ອ ping ໄປຫາ [systemitem]``osad`` ທັງໝົດທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} server ຂອງເຈົ້າ. [systemitem]``osad`` ຈະຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ ping ໂດຍໃຊ້ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ເຊິ່ງລັນຢູ່ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເຊີເວີ. ເມື່ອ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບ, ມັນຈະໝາຍວ່າລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນອອນລາຍ. ຖ້າ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບພາຍໃນໄລຍະເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ, ມັນຈະໝາຍວ່າລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນອອບລາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When you schedule actions on an OSAD-enabled system, the task is carried out "
"immediately.  The [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` periodically checks clients "
"for actions that need to be executed.  If an outstanding action is found, it "
"uses [systemitem]``jabberd`` to execute [command]``mgr_check`` on the "
"client, which then executes the action."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການໃນລະບົບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ OSAD, ວຽກນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຮັດທັນທີ. [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ຈະກວດສອບລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໄລຍະສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ. ຖ້າພົບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ເພື່ອລັນ [command]``mgr_check`` ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດການດຳເນີນການນັ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:13
msgid ""
"OSAD clients use the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the server to "
"communicate with the [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` service."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ OSAD ໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ຂອງເຊີເວີເພື່ອສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:14
msgid ""
"SSL is required for [systemitem]``osad`` communication.  If SSL certificates "
"are not available, the daemon on your client systems fails to connect.  Make "
"sure your firewall rules are set to allow the required ports.  For more "
"information, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:ports.adoc[]."
msgstr "SSL ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສື່ສານ [systemitem]``osad``. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL, ເດມອນໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າກົດໄຟວໍຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດພອດ (ports) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:ports.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OSAD"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ OSAD"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:16
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, start the "
"[systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` service:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start osa-dispatcher\n"
msgstr "systemctl start osa-dispatcher\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On each client, install the [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` package from the "
"[systemitem]``Tools`` child channel."
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` ຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ [systemitem]``Tools``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` package should be installed on clients only.  "
"If you install the [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` package on your {productname} "
"Server, it conflicts with the [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` package."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``mgr-osad`` ໃນ {productname} Server, ມັນຈະຂັດແຍ້ງກັບແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:20
msgid "On each client, as root, start the [systemitem]``osad`` service:"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມບໍລິການ [systemitem]``osad``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start osad\n"
msgstr "systemctl start osad\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Because [systemitem]``osad`` and [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` are run as "
"services, you can use standard commands to manage them, including "
"[command]``stop``, [command]``restart``, and [command]``status``."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ [systemitem]``osad`` ແລະ [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher`` ລັນເປັນບໍລິການ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອຈັດການພວກມັນໄດ້, ລວມທັງ [command]``stop``, [command]``restart``, ແລະ [command]``status``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Each OSAD component is configured using local configuration files.  We "
"recommend you keep the default configuration parameters for all OSAD "
"components."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຂອງ OSAD ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຮັກສາຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບທຸກອົງປະກອບຂອງ OSAD ໄວ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component                        | Location | Path to Configuration File\n"
"| [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``   | Server   | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"Section: [systemitem]``OSA configuration``\n"
"| [systemitem]``osad``             | Client   | "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/osad.conf``\n"
"| [systemitem]``osad`` log file    | Client   | [path]``/var/log/osad``\n"
"| [systemitem]``jabberd`` log file | Both     | "
"[path]``/var/log/messages``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ອົງປະກອບ                        | ບ່ອນຢູ່ | ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"| [systemitem]``osa-dispatcher``   | ເຊີເວີ   | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໝວດ: [systemitem]``OSA configuration``\n"
"| [systemitem]``osad``             | ລູກຂ່າຍ   | [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/osad.conf``\n"
"| ໄຟລ໌ລັອກ [systemitem]``osad``    | ລູກຂ່າຍ   | [path]``/var/log/osad``\n"
"| ໄຟລ໌ລັອກ [systemitem]``jabberd`` | ທັງສອງ   | [path]``/var/log/messages``\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OSAD"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ OSAD"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your OSAD clients cannot connect to the server, or if the "
"[systemitem]``jabberd`` service takes a lot of time responding to port 5552, "
"it could be because you have exceeded the open file count."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍ OSAD ຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີໄດ້, ຫຼື ຖ້າບໍລິການ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນໃນການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ພອດ 5552, ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຈຳນວນການເປີດໄຟລ໌ເກີນກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Every client needs one always-open TCP connection to the server, which "
"consumes a single file handler.  If the number of file handlers currently "
"open exceeds the maximum number of files that [systemitem]``jabberd`` is "
"allowed to use, [systemitem]``jabberd`` queues the requests, and refuses "
"connections."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທຸກເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ທີ່ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ໜຶ່ງອັນຫາເຊີເວີ, ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ file handler 1 ອັນ. ຖ້າຈຳນວນ file handler ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເກີນຈຳນວນສູງສຸດທີ່ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້, [systemitem]``jabberd`` ຈະຈັດຄິວຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ ແລະ ປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:28
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, you can increase the file limits for "
"[systemitem]``jabberd`` by editing the [path]``/etc/security/limits.conf`` "
"configuration file and adding these lines:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບ [systemitem]``jabberd`` ໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/security/limits.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"jabber soft nofile 5100\n"
"jabber hard nofile 6000\n"
msgstr ""
"jabber soft nofile 5100\n"
"jabber hard nofile 6000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Calculate the limits required for your environment by adding 100 to the "
"number of clients for the soft limit, and 1000 to the current number of "
"clients for the hard limit."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍການບວກ 100 ເຂົ້າໃນຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບ soft limit, ແລະ ບວກ 1000 ເຂົ້າໃນຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບ hard limit."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the example above, we have assumed 500 current clients, so the soft limit "
"is 5100, and the hard limit is 6000."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າມີລູກຂ່າຍ 500 ເຄື່ອງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ soft limit ແມ່ນ 5100, ແລະ hard limit ແມ່ນ 6000."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:32
msgid ""
"You also need to update the [systemitem]``max_fds`` parameter in the "
"[path]``/etc/jabberd/c2s.xml`` file with your chosen hard limit:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງອັບເດດພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``max_fds`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/jabberd/c2s.xml`` ດ້ວຍຄ່າ hard limit ທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-osad.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "<max_fds>6000</max_fds>\n"
msgstr "<max_fds>6000</max_fds>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Push via SSH"
msgstr "Push ຜ່ານ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Push via SSH is used in environments where traditional clients cannot reach "
"the {productname} Server directly.  In this environment, clients are located "
"in a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  No system within the DMZ is "
"authorized to open a connection to the internal network, including the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Push via SSH ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນເຂດທີ່ຖືກປົກປ້ອງດ້ວຍໄຟວໍທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ບໍ່ມີລະບົບໃດພາຍໃນ DMZ ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ, ລວມທັງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Push via SSH method creates an encrypted tunnel from the {productname} "
"Server on the internal network to the clients located on the DMZ.  After all "
"actions and events are executed, the tunnel is closed."
msgstr "ວິທີ Push via SSH ຈະສ້າງອຸໂມງທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encrypted tunnel) ຈາກ {productname} Server ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ DMZ. ຫຼັງຈາກການດຳເນີນການ ແລະ ເຫດການທັງໝົດຖືກປະຕິບັດແລ້ວ, ອຸໂມງຈະຖືກປິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The server uses SSH to contact the clients at regular intervals, checking in "
"and performing scheduled actions and events."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຈະໃຊ້ SSH ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເພື່ອທຳການ check-in ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມແຜນງານ (actions) ແລະ ເຫດການຕ່າງໆທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This contact method works for traditional clients only.  For Salt clients, "
"use Push via Salt SSH."
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Push via Salt SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Re-installing systems using the provisioning model is not currently "
"supported on clients managed with Push via SSH."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ provisioning ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍ Push via SSH ໃນເວລານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This image demonstrates the push via SSH process path.  All items left of "
"the [systemitem]``Taskomatic`` block represent processes running on the "
"{productname} client."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເສັ້ນທາງຂະບວນການ push ຜ່ານ SSH. ລາຍການທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງບລັອກ [systemitem]``Taskomatic`` ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {productname}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "sshpush-taigon.png"
msgstr "sshpush-taigon.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For tunneling connections via SSH, two available port numbers are required, "
"one for tunneling HTTP and the second for tunneling via HTTPS (HTTP is only "
"necessary during the registration process).  The port numbers used by "
"default are `1232` and `1233`.  To overwrite these, you can add two custom "
"port numbers greater than 1024 to [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ tunneling ຜ່ານ SSH, ຕ້ອງການເລກພອດ 2 ພອດ, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ tunnel HTTP ແລະ ອັນທີສອງສຳລັບ tunnel HTTPS (HTTP ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ເລກພອດມາດຕະຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ `1232` ແລະ `1233`. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມເລກພອດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ 2 ພອດທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 1024 ເຂົ້າໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh_push_port_http = high_port_1\n"
"ssh_push_port_https = high_port_2\n"
msgstr ""
"ssh_push_port_http = high_port_1\n"
"ssh_push_port_https = high_port_2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you would like your clients to be contacted using their hostnames instead "
"of an IP address, set this option:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕິດຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ໂຮສ໌ແທນທີ່ຢູ່ IP, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh_push_use_hostname = true\n"
msgstr "ssh_push_use_hostname = true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:13
msgid ""
"It is also possible to adjust the number of threads to use for opening "
"client connections in parallel.  By default two parallel threads are used.  "
"Set [systemitem]``taskomatic.ssh_push_workers`` in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ມັນຍັງເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະປັບຈຳນວນ threads ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍແບບຂະໜານ (parallel). ໂດຍຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນໃຊ້ 2 threads. ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [systemitem]``taskomatic.ssh_push_workers`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "taskomatic.ssh_push_workers = number\n"
msgstr "taskomatic.ssh_push_workers = number\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you might want to use sudo with SSH, to access the "
"system as an unprivileged user instead of as root."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ sudo ຮ່ວມກັບ SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາລະບົບ ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດ (unprivileged user) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ root."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Unprivileged SSH Access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH ແບບບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Ensure you have the latest [path]``spacewalk-taskomatic`` and "
"[path]``spacewalk-certs-tools`` packages installed on the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [path]``spacewalk-taskomatic`` ແລະ [path]``spacewalk-certs-tools`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:18
msgid "On each client system, create an appropriate unprivileged user."
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດທີ່ເໝາະສົມຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On each client system, open the [path]``/etc/sudoers`` file and comment out "
"these lines:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/sudoers`` ແລະ ປ່ຽນແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄອມເມັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#Defaults targetpw   # ask for the password of the target user i.e. root\n"
"#ALL    ALL=(ALL) ALL   # WARNING! Only use this together with 'Defaults "
"targetpw'!\n"
msgstr ""
"#Defaults targetpw   # ask for the password of the target user i.e. root\n"
"#ALL    ALL=(ALL) ALL   # WARNING! Only use this together with 'Defaults targetpw'!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On each client system, in the `User privilege specification` section, add "
"these lines:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃນສ່ວນ `User privilege specification`, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/sbin/mgr_check\n"
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/home/<user>/enable.sh\n"
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/home/<user>/bootstrap.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/sbin/mgr_check\n"
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/home/<user>/enable.sh\n"
"<user> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/home/<user>/bootstrap.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:23
msgid ""
"On each client system, in the [path]``/home/<user>/.bashrc`` file, add these "
"lines:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/home/<user>/.bashrc``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PATH=$PATH:/usr/sbin\n"
"export PATH\n"
msgstr ""
"PATH=$PATH:/usr/sbin\n"
"export PATH\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, in the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file, add or amend this line to include the unprivileged "
"username:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh_push_sudo_user = <user>\n"
msgstr "ssh_push_sudo_user = <user>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Because clients are in the DMZ and cannot reach the server, you need to use "
"the [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init`` tool to register them with the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ໃນ DMZ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາເຊີເວີໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:28
msgid ""
"To use the tool, you need the client hostname or IP address, and the path to "
"a valid bootstrap script on the {productname} Server.  For more information "
"about bootstrapping, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຊື່ໂຮສ໌ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ bootstrap script ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ {productname} Server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrapping, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The bootstrap script needs to have an activation key associated with it that "
"is configured for Push via SSH.  For more information on activation keys, "
"see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Bootstrap script ຕ້ອງມີ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ເຊິ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Push via SSH. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to ensure that you have specified which ports to "
"use for SSH tunneling.  If you have registered clients before changing the "
"port numbers, they need to be registered again."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລະບຸພອດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSH tunneling ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນເລກພອດ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Clients that are managed with Push via SSH cannot reach the server "
"directly.  When you use the [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init`` tool, the "
"[systemitem]``rhnsd`` daemon is disabled."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍ Push via SSH ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາເຊີເວີໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init``, ເດມອນ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Push via SSH"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Push via SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:33
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, execute this "
"command:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgr-ssh-push-init --client <client> --register \\\n"
"/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_script --tunnel\n"
msgstr ""
"# mgr-ssh-push-init --client <client> --register \\\n"
"/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_script --tunnel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:35
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can remove the [command]``--tunnel`` option, if you do not "
"want to use tunneling."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອົາໂຕເລືອກ [command]``--tunnel`` ອອກໄດ້ ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ tunneling."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:36
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: When you have defined [command]``ssh_push_sudo_user``, you can "
"allow use of the root password by adding the [command]``--notty`` option."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໄດ້ກຳນົດ [command]``ssh_push_sudo_user`` ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ root ໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມໂຕເລືອກ [command]``--notty``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:37
msgid "Verify that the SSH connection is active:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຍັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_susemanager -R <high_port>:<susemanager>:443 \\\n"
"<client> zypper ref\n"
msgstr ""
"# ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_susemanager -R <high_port>:<susemanager>:443 \\\n"
"<client> zypper ref\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: API Access to Push via SSH"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Push ຜ່ານ SSH ຜ່ານ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You can use the API to manage which contact method to use.  This example "
"Python code sets the contact method to ``ssh-push``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ API ເພື່ອຈັດການວ່າຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບໃດ. ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດ Python ນີ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ເປັນ ``ssh-push``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:41
msgid "Valid values are:"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:42
msgid "`default` (pull)"
msgstr "`default` (pull)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:43
msgid "`ssh-push`"
msgstr "`ssh-push`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:44
msgid "`ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "`ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client = xmlrpclib.Server(SUMA_HOST + \"/rpc/api\", verbose=0)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(SUMA_LOGIN, SUMA_PASSWORD)\n"
"client.system.setDetails(key, 1000012345, {'contact_method' : 'ssh-push'})\n"
msgstr ""
"client = xmlrpclib.Server(SUMA_HOST + \"/rpc/api\", verbose=0)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(SUMA_LOGIN, SUMA_PASSWORD)\n"
"client.system.setDetails(key, 1000012345, {'contact_method' : 'ssh-push'})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:46
msgid ""
"If you have a client that has already been registered, and you want to "
"migrate it to use Push via SSH, some extra steps are required.  You can use "
"the [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init`` tool to set up your client."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປໃຊ້ Push via SSH, ຈະມີຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-ssh-push-init`` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating Registered Systems to Push via SSH"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວໄປເປັນ Push via SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:48
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, set up the "
"client:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:49
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgr-ssh-push-init --client <client> \\\n"
"/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_script --tunnel\n"
msgstr ""
"# mgr-ssh-push-init --client <client> \\\n"
"/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_script --tunnel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Using the {productname} {webui}, change the client's contact method to "
"`ssh-push` or `ssh-push-tunnel`."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອປ່ຽນວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນ `ssh-push` ຫຼື `ssh-push-tunnel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:51
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you need to edit an existing activation key, you can do so with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ activation key ທີ່ມີຢູ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.activationkey.setDetails(key, '1-mykey', {'contact_method' : "
"'ssh-push'})\n"
msgstr "client.activationkey.setDetails(key, '1-mykey', {'contact_method' : 'ssh-push'})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:53
msgid ""
"You can also use Push via SSH for clients that connect using a proxy.  "
"Ensure your proxy is updated before you begin."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ Push via SSH ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ proxy ຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກອັບເດດແລ້ວກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Push via SSH to a Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Push via SSH ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:55
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Proxy, as root, set up the "
"client:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງໃນ {productname} Proxy, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:57
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, copy the SSH key to the "
"proxy:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຈຸດຮັບຄຳສັ່ງໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ SSH key ໄປຫາ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-pushssh.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-ssh-push-init --client <proxy>\n"
msgstr "mgr-ssh-push-init --client <proxy>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager Daemon (rhnsd)"
msgstr "SUSE Manager Daemon (rhnsd)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:3
msgid ""
"It is only used on {sle}{nbsp}11 and {rhnminrelease6}, as these systems do "
"not use systemd.  On later operating systems, a systemd timer "
"([systemitem]``rhnsd.timer``) is used and controlled by "
"[systemitem]``rhnsd.service``."
msgstr "ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ {sle}{nbsp}11 ແລະ {rhnminrelease6} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພາະລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ systemd. ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການລຸ້ນໃໝ່ກວ່າ, ຈະໃຊ້ systemd timer ([systemitem]``rhnsd.timer``) ແລະ ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [systemitem]``rhnsd.service``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:4
msgid "Start the daemon with [command]``/etc/init.d/rhnsd``."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເດມອນດ້ວຍ [command]``/etc/init.d/rhnsd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, it checks every four hours for new actions.  This means it can "
"take some time for clients to execute scheduled actions."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ, ມັນຈະກວດສອບການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່ທຸກໆ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໄລຍະໜຶ່ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To check for updates, [systemitem]``rhnsd`` runs the external "
"[systemitem]``mgr_check`` program located in [path]``/usr/sbin/``.  This is "
"a small application that establishes the network connection to "
"{productname}.  The {productname} daemon does not listen on any network "
"ports or talk to the network directly.  All network activity is performed by "
"the [systemitem]``mgr_check`` utility."
msgstr "ເພື່ອກວດສອບການອັບເດດ, [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ຈະລັນໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ [systemitem]``mgr_check`` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [path]``/usr/sbin/``. ນີ້ແມ່ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍໄປຫາ {productname}. ເດມອນ {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ຟັງ (listen) ໃນພອດເຄືອຂ່າຍໃດໆ ຫຼື ສື່ສານກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ. ກິດຈະກຳເຄືອຂ່າຍທັງໝົດແມ່ນດຳເນີນການໂດຍ [systemitem]``mgr_check``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This figure provides an overview of the default [systemitem]``rhnsd`` "
"process path.  All items left of the [systemitem]``Python XMLRPC server`` "
"block represent processes running on the {productname} client."
msgstr "ຮູບນີ້ສະແດງພາບລວມຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຂະບວນການມາດຕະຖານຂອງ [systemitem]``rhnsd``. ລາຍການທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງບລັອກ [systemitem]``Python XMLRPC server`` ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {productname}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "rhnsd-taigon.png"
msgstr "rhnsd-taigon.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure rhnsd"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ rhnsd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The `rhnsd` initialization script has a configuration file on the client "
"system at [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/rhnsd``."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ `rhnsd` ມີໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຄລາຍເອນທີ່ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/rhnsd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:11
msgid ""
"An important parameter for the daemon is its check-in frequency.  The "
"default interval time is four hours (240 minutes).  The minimum allowed time "
"interval is one hour (60 minutes).  If you set the interval below one hour, "
"it changes back to the default of 4 hours (240 minutes)."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສຳຄັນສຳລັບເດມອນແມ່ນຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການລາຍງານຕົວ (check-in frequency). ໄລຍະເວລາມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງ (240 ນາທີ). ໄລຍະເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດແມ່ນ 1 ຊົ່ວໂມງ (60 ນາທີ). ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານທີ່ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງ (240 ນາທີ) ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you modify the `rhnsd` configuration file, execute this command as root "
"to restart the daemon and pick up your changes:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `rhnsd`, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນນາມ root ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເດມອນໃໝ່ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/rhnsd restart\n"
msgstr "/etc/init.d/rhnsd restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:14
msgid "To see the status of `rhnsd`, use this command as root:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ `rhnsd`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນນາມ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/rhnsd status\n"
msgstr "/etc/init.d/rhnsd status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On {sle}{nbsp}12 and later, the default time interval is set in "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/timers.target.wants/rhnsd.timer``, in this "
"section:"
msgstr "ໃນ {sle}{nbsp}12 ແລະ ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ກວ່າ, ໄລຍະເວລາມາດຕະຖານຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/systemd/system/timers.target.wants/rhnsd.timer``, ໃນສ່ວນນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Timer]\n"
"OnCalendar=00/4:00\n"
"RandomizedDelaySec=30min\n"
msgstr ""
"[Timer]\n"
"OnCalendar=00/4:00\n"
"RandomizedDelaySec=30min\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can create an overriding drop-in file for [path]``rhnsd.timer`` using "
"[command]``systemctl``:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ override ສຳລັບ [path]``rhnsd.timer`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``systemctl``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl edit rhnsd.timer\n"
msgstr "systemctl edit rhnsd.timer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:20
msgid "For example, if you want configure a two hour time interval:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາເປັນ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Timer]\n"
"OnCalendar=00/2:00\n"
msgstr ""
"[Timer]\n"
"OnCalendar=00/2:00\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The file is saved as "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/rhnsd.timer.d/override.conf``."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/etc/systemd/system/rhnsd.timer.d/override.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-rhnsd.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information about systemd timers, see the "
"[command]``systemd.timer`` and [command]``systemctl`` manpages."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ systemd timers, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າຄູ່ມື (manpages) ຂອງ [command]``systemd.timer`` ແລະ [command]``systemctl``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contact Methods for Salt Clients"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In most cases, Salt clients are registered accurately with the default "
"bootstrap methods."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍວິທີ bootstrap ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If you need to use Salt clients in a disconnected setup, you can configure "
"Push via Salt SSH.  In this environment, clients are located in a "
"firewall-protected zone called DMZ.  For more information about Salt SSH "
"contact method, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ Push via Salt SSH ໄດ້. ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນເຂດປ້ອງກັນໄຟວໍທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕິດຕໍ່ Salt SSH, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you need to manually configure a Salt client to connect to the "
"{productname} Server, edit the Salt client configuration file with the "
"correct network details.  For more information about Salt minion "
"configuration file contact method, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ດ້ວຍລາຍລະອຽດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕິດຕໍ່ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt minion, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Onboarding Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດການນຳເຂົ້າລະບົບ (Onboarding)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-salt.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Salt has its own database to keep the keys for the minions. This needs to be "
"kept in sync with the {productname} database.  As soon as the key is "
"accepted in Salt, the onboarding process in {productname} starts.  The "
"onboarding process will look for existing systems in the {productname} "
"database by searching for the ``minion_id`` and the ``machine-id``.  If "
"nothing is found, the new system gets created.  In case an entry with the "
"``minion_id`` or the ``machine-id`` is found, that system will be migrated "
"to match the new system.  In case there is a match for both entries, and "
"they are not the same system, the onboarding will be aborted with an error.  "
"In this case the administrator needs to resolve the conflict by removing at "
"least one of the systems."
msgstr "Salt ມີຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົນເອງເພື່ອເກັບຄີສຳລັບ minions. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຊິງຄ໌ (sync) ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທັນທີທີ່ຄີຖືກຍອມຮັບໃນ Salt, ຂະບວນການ onboarding ໃນ {productname} ຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ຂະບວນການ onboarding ຈະຊອກຫາລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາຈາກ ``minion_id`` ແລະ ``machine-id``. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຫຍັງເລີຍ, ລະບົບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ພົບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີ ``minion_id`` ຫຼື ``machine-id`` ກົງກັນ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຮູບແບບໃຫ້ກົງກັບລະບົບໃໝ່. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ພົບຂໍ້ມູນກົງກັນທັງສອງແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ຂະບວນການ onboarding ຈະຢຸດລົງພ້ອມກັບແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂຄວາມຂັດແຍ້ງໂດຍການລຶບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍລະບົບໃດໜຶ່ງອອກ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Bundle"
msgstr "Salt Bundle"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Salt Bundle?"
msgstr "Salt Bundle ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle is a single binary package containing Salt Minion, Python 3, "
"required Python modules, and libraries."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ແມ່ນແພັກເກດໄບນາຣີດຽວທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍ Salt Minion, Python 3, ໂມດູນ Python ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle is shipped with Python 3 and all the requirements for Salt "
"to run. Thus Salt Bundle does not use the Python version install on the "
"client as system software.  The Salt Bundle can be installed on clients that "
"do not meet the requirements for a given Salt version."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ຖືກສົ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບ Python 3 ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ Salt ລັນໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, Salt Bundle ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ Python ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍເປັນຊອບແວລະບົບ. Salt Bundle ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມທີ່ Salt ເວີຊັນນັ້ນໆຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use the Salt Bundle on systems that run a Salt Minion "
"connected to a Salt Master other than the {productname} Salt Master."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ໃນລະບົບທີ່ລັນ Salt Minion ເຊິ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Salt Master ອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {productname} Salt Master ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration with Salt Bundle as a Minion"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Salt Bundle ໃນຖານະ Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The registration method with the Salt Bundle is the recommended registration "
"method.  This section explains the advantages and limitations of the current "
"implementation.  The Salt Bundle is provided as the "
"[package]``venv-salt-minion`` that consists of Salt, Python 3, and the "
"Python modules Salt depends on.  Bootstrapping with {webui} is using Salt "
"Bundle as well, so bootstrapping with {webui} is not Python dependant.  "
"Using the Salt Bundle, it is no longer needed that the client provides any "
"Python interpreter or modules."
msgstr "ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ Salt Bundle ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເຖິງຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການເຮັດວຽກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. Salt Bundle ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍ Salt, Python 3, ແລະ ໂມດູນ Python ທີ່ Salt ຕ້ອງໃຊ້. ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ຜ່ານ {webui} ກໍໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການ bootstrap ຜ່ານ {webui} ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ Python ຂອງລະບົບ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Python interpreter ຫຼື ໂມດູນໃດໆ ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If you bootstrap new clients, registration with the Salt Bundle is the "
"default method.  You can switch existing clients to the Salt Bundle method.  "
"If you switch, the [package]``salt-minion`` package and its dependencies "
"will stay installed."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບູດສແຕຣັບໄຄເອັນໃໝ່, ການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ Salt Bundle ແມ່ນວິທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໄຄເອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ມາໃຊ້ວິທີ Salt Bundle ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນ, ແພັກເກດ [package]``salt-minion`` ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (dependencies) ຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Salt Bundle with the Salt Minion"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ຮ່ວມກັບ Salt Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle can be used with the Salt Minion managed by the Salt Master "
"other than {productname} Server at the same time.  If the Salt Bundle is "
"installed on a client {productname} Server will manage the configuration "
"files of the Salt Bundle, the configuration files of "
"[literal]``salt-minion`` will not be managed in this case.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc#_salt_bundle_configuration[Salt "
"Bundle configuration]."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Salt Minion ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ Salt Master ອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຖ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, {productname} Server ຈະຈັດການໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ Salt Bundle, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຈັດການໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ [literal]``salt-minion``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc#_salt_bundle_configuration[ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt Bundle]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To bootstrap a client with the Salt Minion managed by the Salt Master other "
"than {productname} Server it is recommended to use "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap`` [option]``--force-bundle`` when generating the "
"bootstrap script, or to set [option]``FORCE_VENV_SALT_MINION`` to `1` in the "
"bootstrap script."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບູດສະແຕຣັບ (bootstrap) ຄລາຍເອນດ້ວຍ Salt Minion ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ Salt Master ອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ {productname} Server, ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` [option]``--force-bundle`` ເມື່ອສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງ [option]``FORCE_VENV_SALT_MINION`` ເປັນ `1` ໃນສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For bootstrapping with {webui} [literal]``mgr_force_venv_salt_minion`` set "
"to [literal]``true`` pillar can be specified globally.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການບູດສແຕຣັບດ້ວຍ {webui}, ສາມາດລະບຸ pillar [literal]``mgr_force_venv_salt_minion`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ [literal]``true`` ແບບທົ່ວໂລກ (globally) ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switching from Salt Minion to Salt Bundle"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຈາກ Salt Minion ໄປເປັນ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The Salt state [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` is available to "
"switch from [package]``salt-minion`` to [package]``venv-salt-minion``.  It "
"is recommended to switch to [package]``venv-salt-minion`` in two steps to "
"avoid trouble with shifting processes:"
msgstr "Salt state [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກ [package]``salt-minion`` ໄປເປັນ [package]``venv-salt-minion``. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປັນ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ໂດຍແບ່ງເປັນ 2 ຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາໃນການປ່ຽນຖ່າຍຂະບວນການ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Switching with [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` state "
"to [package]``venv-salt-minion``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນດ້ວຍ state [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` ໄປເປັນ [package]``venv-salt-minion``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Apply [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` with no pillar specified "
"first.  This will result in the switch to [package]``venv-salt-minion`` with "
"copying configuration files etc.  It will not clean up the original "
"[package]``salt-minion`` configurations and its packages."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ຕ້ອງລະບຸ pillar ໃນຕອນທຳອິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ພ້ອມກັບການສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ມັນຈະຍັງບໍ່ທຳຄວາມສະອາດ (clean up) ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຂອງ [package]``salt-minion`` ເດີມ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion\n"
msgstr "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Apply [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` with "
"[literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt`` set to [literal]``True`` to remove "
"[package]``salt-minion`` and with [literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files`` "
"set to [literal]``True`` to remove all the files related to "
"[package]``salt-minion``.  This second step ensures the first step was "
"processed, and then removes the old configuration files and the now obsolete "
"[package]``salt-minion`` package."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` ໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt`` ເປັນ [literal]``True`` ເພື່ອລຶບ [package]``salt-minion`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files`` ເປັນ [literal]``True`` ເພື່ອລຶບທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [package]``salt-minion``. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດໄດ້ຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງລຶບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເກົ່າ ແລະ ແພັກເກດ [package]``salt-minion`` ທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝອອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion "
"pillar='{\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files\": True, "
"\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt\": True}'\n"
msgstr "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion pillar='{\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files\": True, \"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt\": True}'\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In case of running the second step of switching with skipping the first "
"step, state apply process could fail as it requires stopping the "
"[systemitem]``salt-minion`` which is used to execute the command on the "
"client side."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລັນຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງໂດຍຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດ, ຂະບວນການນຳໃຊ້ state ອາດຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະມັນຕ້ອງການການຢຸດ [systemitem]``salt-minion`` ເຊິ່ງກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On the other hand, it is also possible to avoid installing the Salt Bundle "
"and keep using [package]``salt-minion`` instead.  In this case, specify one "
"of these options:"
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໜຶ່ງໃນໂຕເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:22
msgid "Execute [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` with [option]``--no-bundle`` option."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` ດ້ວຍໂຕເລືອກ [option]``--no-bundle``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Set [literal]``AVOID_VENV_SALT_MINION`` to [literal]``1`` in the generated "
"bootstrap script."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ [literal]``AVOID_VENV_SALT_MINION`` ເປັນ [literal]``1`` ໃນສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For bootstrap state set the [literal]``mgr_avoid_venv_salt_minion`` pillar "
"to [literal]``True``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ bootstrap state ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ pillar [literal]``mgr_avoid_venv_salt_minion`` ເປັນ [literal]``True``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH with the Salt Bundle"
msgstr "Salt SSH ຮ່ວມກັບ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:26
msgid "The Salt Bundle is also used when performing Salt SSH actions to clients."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເວລາປະຕິບັດການ Salt SSH ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"A shell script deploys the Salt Bundle onto the target system without "
"installing [package]``venv-salt-minion`` before any Salt command is "
"executed. Since the Salt Bundle contains the whole Salt code base, no "
"[literal]``salt-thin`` is deployed. Salt SSH (including bootstrapping using "
"the {webui}) uses the Python 3 interpreter within the bundle. The target "
"system does not need to have any other Python interpreter installed."
msgstr "Shell script ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ລົງໃນລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃດໆ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ Salt Bundle ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດພື້ນຖານຂອງ Salt ທັງໝົດ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``salt-thin``. Salt SSH (ລວມທັງການ bootstrap ຜ່ານ {webui}) ຈະໃຊ້ Python 3 interpreter ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ bundle. ລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Python interpreter ອື່ນໆ ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The Python 3 deployed with the Bundle is used to handle Salt SSH session on "
"the client, so Salt SSH (including bootstrapping with {webui}) is not "
"dependant on Python installed on the system."
msgstr "Python 3 ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມານຳ Bundle ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການເຊດຊັນ Salt SSH ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Salt SSH (ລວມທັງການ bootstrap ຜ່ານ {webui}) ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ Python ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Using `salt-thin` can be enabled as a fallback method, but it requires "
"Python 3 to be installed on the client.  This method is not recommended nor "
"supported and exists for development purposes only.  Set "
"[option]``web.ssh_use_salt_thin`` to `true` in the "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ `salt-thin` ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ເປັນວິທີສຳຮອງ (fallback) ໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີ Python 3 ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການພັດທະນາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``web.ssh_use_salt_thin`` ເປັນ `true` ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The bootstrap repository must be created before bootstrapping the client "
"with {webui}. Salt SSH is using the Salt Bundle taken from the bootstrap "
"repository based on the detected target operating system.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[]."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ (repository) bootstrap ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ bootstrap ລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}. Salt SSH ຈະໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ທີ່ມາຈາກຄັງເກັບ bootstrap ໂດຍອີງຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກວດພົບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"Salt commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ໃຊ້ [path]``/var/tmp`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃນໄຄລແອນດ້ວຍ Python ທີ່ຕິດມານຳ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ມັນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະ bootstrap ໄຄລແອນທີ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍ [option]``noexec`` ຜ່ານ {webui} ຍ້ອນວ່າຂະບວນການ bootstrap ໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Salt Bundle with Python packages using pip"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ Salt Bundle ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດ Python ໂດຍໃຊ້ pip"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle includes [literal]``pip`` to make it possible to extend the "
"functionality of the bundled Salt Minion with extra Python packages."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ມີ [literal]``pip`` ມາໃຫ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ Salt Minion ທີ່ຮວມມານຳດ້ວຍແພັກເກດ Python ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:34
msgid ""
"By default, [command]``salt <minion_id> pip.install <package-name>`` "
"installs the Python package specified by [literal]``<package_name>`` into "
"[path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local``."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [command]``salt <minion_id> pip.install <package-name>`` ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Python ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [literal]``<package_name>`` ລົງໃນ [path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If needed, the path [path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local`` can be "
"overridden by setting the [literal]``VENV_PIP_TARGET`` environment variable "
"for the [literal]``venv-salt-minion.service``.  It is recommended to use a "
"systemd drop-in configuration file for the service.  It could be done with "
"the configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-pip-destination.conf``:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ເສັ້ນທາງ [path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local`` ສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [literal]``VENV_PIP_TARGET`` ສຳລັບ [literal]``venv-salt-minion.service``. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ systemd drop-in ສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າການບໍລິການ. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-pip-destination.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=VENV_PIP_TARGET=/new/path/local/venv-salt-minion/pip\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=VENV_PIP_TARGET=/new/path/local/venv-salt-minion/pip\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The Python packages installed through [literal]``pip`` are not changing on "
"updating the Salt Bundle.  To ensure that such packages are available and "
"functional after an update, it is recommended to install them with a Salt "
"state that is applied after Salt Bundle updates."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ Python ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ [literal]``pip`` ຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອມີການອັບເດດ Salt Bundle. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຍັງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນດ້ວຍ Salt state ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ Salt Bundle."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Push via Salt SSH"
msgstr "Push ຜ່ານ Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Push via Salt SSH is used in environments where Salt clients cannot reach "
"the {productname} Server directly.  In this environment, clients are located "
"in a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  No system within the DMZ is "
"authorized to open a connection to the internal network, including the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Push via Salt SSH ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນເຂດປ້ອງກັນໄຟວໍທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ບໍ່ມີລະບົບໃດພາຍໃນ DMZ ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ, ລວມທັງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Push via Salt SSH method creates an encrypted tunnel from the "
"{productname} Server on the internal network to the clients located on the "
"DMZ.  After all actions and events are executed, the tunnel is closed."
msgstr "ວິທີ Push via Salt SSH ຈະສ້າງອຸໂມງທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຈາກ {productname} Server ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ DMZ. ຫຼັງຈາກການດຳເນີນການ ແລະ ເຫດການທັງໝົດຖືກປະຕິບັດແລ້ວ, ອຸໂມງຈະຖືກປິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The server uses the Salt SSH to contact the clients at regular intervals, "
"checking in and performing scheduled actions and events.  For more "
"information about Salt SSH, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH]."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຕາມໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເພື່ອກວດສອບການລາຍງານຕົວ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt SSH, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This contact method works for Salt clients only.  For traditional clients, "
"use Push via SSH."
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Push via SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This image demonstrates the Push via Salt SSH process path.  All items left "
"of the [systemitem]``Taskomatic`` block represent processes running on the "
"{productname} client."
msgstr "ຮູບນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເສັ້ນທາງຂະບວນການ Push via Salt SSH. ລາຍການທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງບລັອກ [systemitem]``Taskomatic`` ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {productname}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-contact-taigon.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-contact-taigon.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To use Push via Salt SSH, you must have the SSH daemon running on the "
"client, and reachable by the [systemitem]``salt-api`` daemon running on the "
"{productname} Server.  Additionally, Python must be available on the remote "
"system, and be a version supported by Salt."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Push via Salt SSH, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ SSH daemon ລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍ [systemitem]``salt-api`` daemon ທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕ້ອງມີ Python ໃນລະບົບປາຍທາງ (remote system) ແລະ ຕ້ອງເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ Salt ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{rhel}{nbsp}5, {centos}{nbsp}5, and earlier are not supported, as they use "
"unsupported versions of Python."
msgstr "{rhel}{nbsp}5, {centos}{nbsp}5, ແລະ ລຸ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ ເພາະພວກມັນໃຊ້ Python ເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Push via Salt SSH"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Push via Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] and "
"complete the appropriate fields."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:12
msgid "Select an activation key with the Push via SSH contact method configured."
msgstr "ເລືອກ activation key ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ Push via SSH ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:14
msgid "Check the [systemitem]``Manage system completely via SSH`` checkbox."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``Manage system completely via SSH``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Confirm that the system has been registered correctly by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນວ່າລະບົບໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When you are configuring Push via Salt SSH, you can modify parameters that "
"are used when a system is registered, including the host, activation key, "
"and password.  The password is used only for bootstrapping, it is not saved "
"anywhere.  All future SSH sessions are authorized via a key/certificate "
"pair.  These parameters are configured in menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ Push via Salt SSH, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໄດ້, ລວມທັງ host, activation key, ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບການ bootstrap ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຢູ່ໃສ. ເຊດຊັນ SSH ທັງໝົດໃນອະນາຄົດຈະຖືກກວດສອບສິດຜ່ານຄູ່ key/certificate. ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃນ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:19
msgid ""
"You can also configure persistent parameters that are are used system-wide, "
"including the sudo user.  For more information on configuring the sudo user, "
"see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-pushssh.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຄົງຢູ່ (persistent) ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ທົ່ວລະບົບໄດ້, ລວມທັງ sudo user. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ sudo user, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-pushssh.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Execution"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການ (Action Execution)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The Push via Salt SSH feature uses taskomatic to execute scheduled actions "
"using [command]``salt-ssh``.  The taskomatic job periodically checks for "
"scheduled actions and executes them.  Unlike Push via SSH on traditional "
"clients, the Push via Salt SSH feature executes a complete "
"[command]``salt-ssh`` call based on the scheduled action."
msgstr "ຟີເຈີ Push via Salt SSH ໃຊ້ taskomatic ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``salt-ssh``. ວຽກຂອງ taskomatic ຈະກວດສອບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ເປັນໄລຍະ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກນັ້ນ. ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ Push via SSH ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ຟີເຈີ Push via Salt SSH ຈະລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``salt-ssh`` ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບໂດຍອີງຕາມການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:22
msgid ""
"By default, twenty Salt SSH actions can be executed at a time.  You can "
"increase the number of actions that can be executed in parallel, by adding "
"these lines to your configuration file, and adjusting the value of "
"``parallel_threads`` upwards.  We recommend you keep the number of parallel "
"actions low, to avoid problems:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສາມາດດຳເນີນການ Salt SSH ໄດ້ 20 ຢ່າງພ້ອມກັນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຈຳນວນການດຳເນີນການແບບຂະໜານໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ປັບຄ່າ ``parallel_threads`` ໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຮັກສາຈຳນວນການດຳເນີນການແບບຂະໜານໃຫ້ຕໍ່າໄວ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = <number>\n"
"org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = <value of parallel_threads + 20>\n"
msgstr ""
"taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = <number>\n"
"org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = <value of parallel_threads + 20>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:24
msgid ""
"This adjusts the number of actions that can run in parallel on any one "
"client and the total number of worker threads used by taskomatic.  If "
"actions needs to be run on multiple clients, actions are always executed "
"sequentially on each client."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປັບຈຳນວນການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ສາມາດລັນແບບຂະໜານໃນລູກຂ່າຍໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຈຳນວນ worker threads ທັງໝົດທີ່ taskomatic ໃຊ້. ຫາກຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດການ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ, ການປະຕິບັດການຈະຖືກລັນຕາມລຳດັບໃນແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If the clients are connected through a proxy, you need to adjust the "
"``MaxSessions`` settings on the proxy.  In this case, set the number of "
"parallel connections to be three times the total number of clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າ clients ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປັບຄ່າ ``MaxSessions`` ໃນ proxy. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຂະໜານເປັນ 3 ເທົ່າຂອງຈຳນວນ clients ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດໃນອະນາຄົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:27
msgid ""
"There are some features that are not yet supported on Push via Salt SSH.  "
"These features do not work on Salt SSH clients:"
msgstr "ມີບາງຟີເຈີທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບໃນ Push via Salt SSH. ຟີເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:28
msgid "OpenSCAP auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ OpenSCAP (OpenSCAP auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:29
msgid "Beacons, resulting in:"
msgstr "Beacons, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Installing a package on a system using [command]``zypper`` does not invoke "
"the package refresh."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃນລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``zypper`` ຈະບໍ່ມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການ refresh ແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Virtual Host functions (for example, a host to guests) does not work if the "
"virtual host system is Salt SSH-based."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ Virtual Host (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຈາກ host ໄປຫາ guests) ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ຖ້າລະບົບ virtual host ນັ້ນເປັນແບບ Salt SSH."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:33
msgid ""
"About Salt SSH in general, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[] "
"and https://docs.saltstack.com/en/latest/topics/ssh/."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:34
msgid ""
"About SSH key rotation, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc#salt.ssh.key_rotation[]."
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບການໝູນວຽນ SSH key, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc#salt.ssh.key_rotation[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contact Methods for Traditional Clients"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Traditional clients can communicate with the {productname} Server using a "
"range of methods."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມສາມາດສື່ສານກັບ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {productname} daemon ([command]``rhnsd``) runs on traditional client "
"systems and periodically connects with {productname} to check for new "
"updates and notifications."
msgstr "ເດມອນ {productname} ([command]``rhnsd``) ລັນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} ເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອເບິ່ງການອັບເດດ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃໝ່ໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Push via SSH is used in environments where clients cannot reach the "
"{productname} Server directly.  In this environment, clients are located in "
"a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  No system within the DMZ is "
"authorized to open a connection to the internal network, including the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Push via SSH ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າຫາ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນເຂດປ້ອງກັນໄຟວໍທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ບໍ່ມີລະບົບໃດພາຍໃນ DMZ ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ, ລວມທັງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:5
msgid ""
"OSAD is an alternative contact method between {productname} and traditional "
"clients.  OSAD allows traditional clients to execute scheduled actions "
"immediately."
msgstr "OSAD ແມ່ນວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທາງເລືອກລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. OSAD ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມສາມາດດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:6
msgid ""
"With SUSE Manager {productnumber} release, traditional clients have been "
"deprecated.  The release following SUSE Manager {productnumber} will not "
"support traditional clients and traditional proxies, and it is planned for "
"the year 2023.  We encourage all new deployments to use Salt clients and "
"Salt proxies exclusively, and to migrate existing traditional clients and "
"proxies to Salt."
msgstr "ໃນ SUSE Manager ລຸ້ນ {productnumber}, ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ (deprecated) ແລ້ວ. ລຸ້ນທີ່ຖັດຈາກ SUSE Manager {productnumber} ຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ proxy ແບບດັ້ງເດີມອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງມີແຜນໄວ້ໃນປີ 2023. ພວກເຮົາສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ proxy Salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ proxy ແບບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ມາເປັນ Salt."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-traditional.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Be aware that when migrating from traditional clients to Salt minions you do "
"not have to delete the registered clients before.  You can just register "
"them as Salt minions and Salt will do the necessary steps with the "
"traditional client.  If you already deleted the traditional client and the "
"registration as Salt minion is not possible anymore, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຮູ້ໄວ້ວ່າ ເມື່ອຍ້າຍຈາກລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມມາເປັນ Salt minions, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລຶບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ກ່ອນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນ Salt minions ໄດ້ເລີຍ ແລະ Salt ຈະຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນກັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໃຫ້ເອງ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມອອກໄປແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນເປັນ Salt minion ໄດ້ອີກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom System Information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can include customized system information about your clients.  System "
"information is defined as key:value pairs, which can be assigned to "
"clients.  For example, you can define a key:value pair for a particular "
"processor, then assign that key to all clients that have that processor "
"installed.  Custom system information is categorized, and can be searched "
"using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້. ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບຖືກກຳນົດເປັນຄູ່ key:value, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄູ່ key:value ສຳລັບໂປຣເຊສເຊີໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຈາກນັ້ນກຳນົດຄີນັ້ນໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໂປຣເຊສເຊີນັ້ນຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່. ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to create a key that allows you to store custom "
"information."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງກຸນແຈ (key) ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom System Information Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Custom System Info], "
"and click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Custom System Info], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Key Label`` field, add a name for your key.  Do not use "
"spaces.  For example, ``intel-x86_64-quadcore``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Key Label``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ສຳລັບ key ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``intel-x86_64-quadcore``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, provide any additional information "
"required."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:8
msgid "Repeat for each key you require."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກຸນແຈທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, this information is available via Salt pillar.  You can "
"retrieve this information from a Salt client with a command such as:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ Salt pillar. ເຈົ້າສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt $minionid pillar.get custom_info:key1\n"
msgstr "salt $minionid pillar.get custom_info:key1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:11
msgid "This command will result in an output such as:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງຜົນອອກມາໃນຮູບແບບເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$minionid:\n"
"    val1\n"
msgstr ""
"$minionid:\n"
"    val1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When you have created some custom system information keys, you can apply "
"them to clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳພວກມັນໄປໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Custom Information Keys to Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to apply custom information to, and navigate to the "
"menu:Details[Custom Info] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Details[Custom Info]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:16
msgid "Click btn:[Create Value]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Value]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:17
msgid "Locate the value you want to apply, and click the key label."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ກຸນແຈ (key label)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Value`` field, provide any additional information."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Update Key] to apply the custom information to the client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Key] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration management), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Deletion"
msgstr "ການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#.  FIXME: where do we need to add warnings (suse clients only, all clients)
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you need to remove a client from your {productname} Server, you can use "
"the {webui} to delete it.  You can also remove a client from the command "
"line.  These procedures work for both traditional and Salt clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເອົາລູກຂ່າຍອອກຈາກ {productname} Server, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເອົາລູກຂ່າຍອອກຜ່ານບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້ນຳ. ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ Salt."

#.  can also be done manually.
#.  FIXME: Why Manual Cleanup is necessary sometimes.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Client with the {webui}"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"select the client to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:6
msgid "Click btn:[Delete System]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete System]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:7
msgid "Check the details and click btn:[Delete Profile] to confirm."
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Profile] ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, {productname} attempts to clean up additional "
"configuration.  If the client cannot be contacted, you are given the option "
"to cancel the deletion, or delete the client without cleaning up the "
"configuration files."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, {productname} ຈະພະຍາຍາມລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມອອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຈະມີທາງເລືອກໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການລຶບ, ຫຼື ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍອອກໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລຶບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can also delete multiple clients using the system set manager.  For more "
"information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລຶບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ system set manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ system set manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:10
msgid ""
"It is not possible to automatically clean up a traditional client after "
"deleting it.  You have to take care of this yourself.  Furthermore, cleaning "
"up a Salt client does only disable salt and stop the service if possible. It "
"does not uninstall the package."
msgstr "ມັນບໍ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ (clean up) ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກລຶບມັນອອກ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຈັດການເລື່ອງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເປັນພຽງການປິດໃຊ້ງານ salt ແລະ ຢຸດບໍລິການ (ຖ້າເຮັດໄດ້) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Normally you migrate a traditional client to a Salt client without deleting "
"the client.  Salt automatically detects that you have a traditional client "
"and does the necessary changes itself.  But if you already deleted the "
"traditional client and want to register it as a Salt client again, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc[]."
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄປເປັນ Salt ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລຶບລູກຂ່າຍອອກ. Salt ຈະກວດພົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດວ່າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ຈະເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ເອງ. ແຕ່ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມອອກໄປແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນເປັນ Salt ອີກຄັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Salt Client on the Command Line (with API Call)"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຜ່ານບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (ດ້ວຍ API Call)"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting a Client from the Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍອອກຈາກເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:14
msgid "Delete the client with the FQDN (Fully Qualified Domain Name):"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ FQDN (Fully Qualified Domain Name):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd system_delete FQDN\n"
msgstr "spacecmd system_delete FQDN\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:16
msgid "[command]``spacecmd system_delete`` also deletes the Salt key."
msgstr "[command]``spacecmd system_delete`` ຈະລຶບ Salt key ອອກນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:17
msgid "[command]``system_delete`` offers the following options:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``system_delete`` ມີໂຕເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: system_delete [options] <SYSTEMS>\n"
msgstr "usage: system_delete [options] <SYSTEMS>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    options:\n"
"          -c TYPE - Possible values:\n"
"             *  'FAIL_ON_CLEANUP_ERR' - fail in case of cleanup error,\n"
"             *  'NO_CLEANUP' - do not cleanup, just delete,\n"
"             *  'FORCE_DELETE' - try cleanup first but delete server "
"anyway\n"
"\t        in case of error\n"
msgstr ""
"    options:\n"
"          -c TYPE - ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້:\n"
"             *  'FAIL_ON_CLEANUP_ERR' - ໃຫ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ,\n"
"             *  'NO_CLEANUP' - ບໍ່ຕ້ອງລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບເລີຍ,\n"
"             *  'FORCE_DELETE' - ພະຍາຍາມລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລຶບເຊີເວີເລີຍ\n"
"\t        ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ\n"

#
#. // move to Trouble Shooting and link from here
#. Sometimes a new registration of a deleted (unregistered) client might not be possible.
#. To solve this issue, some Salt cache files should be deleted on the {productname} Server (Salt master) before trying to re-register again:
#. ----
#. rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version
#. rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz
#. ----
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Client from the Command Line"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Client"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:35
msgid ""
"This process is only for {productname} clients, do not run it on the "
"{productname} Server itself."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຫ້າມລັນໃນ {productname} Server ເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You must not execute the following procedure on clients running {rhel}, "
"{debian}, or clones.  Instead of [command]``zypper`` use equivalent packager "
"commands such as [command]``yum``, [command]``dnf``, or [command]``apt``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ {rhel}, {debian}, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຈັດການແພັກເກດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແທນ [command]``zypper`` ເຊັ່ນ [command]``yum``, [command]``dnf``, ຫຼື [command]``apt``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting SLES 12 and 15 Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໃນ SLES 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:25
msgid "Stop the salt-minion service:"
msgstr "ຢຸດເຊີວິດ salt-minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl stop salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl stop salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:27
msgid "Remove the repositories and configuration files:"
msgstr "ລຶບ repositories ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/sysconfig/rhn/\n"
"rm -r /etc/salt/\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/sysconfig/rhn/\n"
"rm -r /etc/salt/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:29
msgid "Remove Client Packages:"
msgstr "ລຶບແພັກເກດລູກຂ່າຍອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper rm salt salt-minion python*-salt sle-manager-tools-release\n"
msgstr "zypper rm salt salt-minion python*-salt sle-manager-tools-release\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Salt Bundle Client - Manual Registration Cleanup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: Salt Bundle Client - ການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:32
msgid "To unregister, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop venv-salt-minion\n"
"zypper rm -y venv-salt-minion\n"
"rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"
"rm -r /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"
msgstr ""
"systemctl stop venv-salt-minion\n"
"zypper rm -y venv-salt-minion\n"
"rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"
"rm -r /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For information about the Salt bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ Salt bundle, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:36
msgid ""
"You must not execute the following procedure literally on clients running "
"{rhel}, {debian}, or clones.  Instead of [command]``zypper`` use equivalent "
"packager commands such as [command]``yum``, [command]``dnf``, or "
"[command]``apt``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແບບຕົງຕົວໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລັນ {rhel}, {debian}, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຈັດການແພັກເກດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າ ເຊັ່ນ [command]``yum``, [command]``dnf``, ຫຼື [command]``apt`` ແທນ [command]``zypper``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Traditional SLES 12 and 15 Clients - Manual Cleanup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ SLES 12 ແລະ 15 - ການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:38
msgid "Stop the osad service (if it is in use):"
msgstr "ຢຸດບໍລິການ osad (ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ງານ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl stop osad\n"
msgstr "systemctl stop osad\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:40
msgid ""
"On a SLES 12 client remove the following packages if installed.  This should "
"be tried first (in case the [package]``osad`` package is not installed, do "
"not list it on the command line):"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ SLES 12 ໃຫ້ລຶບແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖ້າມີການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຄວນລອງວິທີນີ້ກ່ອນ (ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``osad``, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃສ່ຊື່ມັນໃນບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper rm spacewalksd spacewalk-check zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"spacewalk-client-tools osad python2-zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"python2-spacewalk-check python2-spacewalk-client-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper rm spacewalksd spacewalk-check zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"spacewalk-client-tools osad python2-zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"python2-spacewalk-check python2-spacewalk-client-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:42
msgid "On a SLES 15 client remove the following packages if installed:"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ SLES 15 ໃຫ້ລຶບແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖ້າມີການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper rm spacewalk-client-setup mgr-daemon spacewalk-check \\\n"
"zypp-plugin-spacewalk mgr-osad python3-zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"python3-spacewalk-check python3-spacewalk-client-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper rm spacewalk-client-setup mgr-daemon spacewalk-check \\\n"
"zypp-plugin-spacewalk mgr-osad python3-zypp-plugin-spacewalk \\\n"
"python3-spacewalk-check python3-spacewalk-client-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:44
msgid "You will see the following output:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນຜົນລັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Refreshing service 'spacewalk'. \n"
"Loading repository data...\n"
"Reading installed packages...\n"
"Resolving package dependencies...\n"
msgstr ""
"Refreshing service 'spacewalk'. \n"
"Loading repository data...\n"
"Reading installed packages...\n"
"Resolving package dependencies...\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following packages are going to be REMOVED:\n"
"  spacewalk-check spacewalk-client-setup spacewalksd zypp\n"
"plugin-python osad\n"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກຳລັງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ (REMOVED):\n"
"  spacewalk-check spacewalk-client-setup spacewalksd zypp\n"
"plugin-python osad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5 packages to remove.\n"
"After the operation, 301.0 KiB will be freed.\n"
"Continue? [y/n/?] (y):\n"
msgstr ""
"5 ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຖືກລຶບ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກການດຳເນີນການ, ພື້ນທີ່ 301.0 KiB ຈະຖືກຄືນມາ.\n"
"ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່? [y/n/?] (y):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:48
msgid ""
"The above RPM packages are client specific, and should be removed.  If this "
"fails, they should be manually removed.  The [command]``rpm -e`` command "
"should not be used unless the [command]``zypper rm`` command above failed."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ຂ້າງເທິງແມ່ນສະເພາະສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຄວນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຄວນລຶບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``rpm -e`` ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper rm`` ຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:49
msgid ""
"After this is complete, the /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid file should be "
"removed.  This file only exists on a client machine and is used to register "
"itself with {productname}:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳເລັດ, ຄວນລຶບໄຟລ໌ /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid ອອກ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ມີຢູ່ສະເພາະໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຕົວກັບ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid\n"
msgstr "rm /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:51
msgid "Any configured spacewalk channels should be deleted with:"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ spacewalk ໃດໆ ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຄວນຈະຖືກລຶບດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/spacewalk*\n"
msgstr "rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/spacewalk*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Finally verify that repositories are properly configured.  Refresh them on "
"the server and then list them:"
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ repositories ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃຫ້ຣີເຟຣຊພວກມັນໃນເຊີເວີ ແລ້ວສະແດງລາຍການອອກມາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ref -s\n"
"zypper lr\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ref -s\n"
"zypper lr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:55
msgid "If any repositories pointing to spacewalk still exist, remove them with:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຍັງມີ repository ໃດທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາ spacewalk, ໃຫ້ລຶບພວກມັນອອກດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper repos -d\n"
"zypper removerepo <ID of the repo in the output from previous command>\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper repos -d\n"
"zypper removerepo <ID ຂອງ repository ຈາກຜົນລັນຂອງຄຳສັ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າ>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys"
msgstr "ກຸນແຈ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In most cases, you do not need to adjust the GPG settings to be able to "
"install software on your clients."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPG ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດ ຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"RPM packages can be signed directly, while Debian based systems sign only "
"the metadata and use a chain of checksums to secure the packages.  Most RPM "
"based systems use signed metadata in addition to signed packages."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ສາມາດຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ (signed) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Debian ຈະເຊັນກຳກັບສະເພາະ metadata ແລະ ໃຊ້ລະບົບ checksum ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງແພັກເກດ. ລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ RPM ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະໃຊ້ metadata ທີ່ຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ."

#
#
#
#
#
#. From Ref Guide, needs editing. --LKB 2020-09-08
#. Lists keys and certificates available for inclusion in {kickstart} profiles and provides a means to create new ones.
#. This is especially important for customers of {productname} or the Proxy Server because systems kickstarted by them must have the server key imported into {productname} and associated with the relevant {kickstart} profiles.
#. Import a profile by creating a new key on this page and then make the profile association in the [guimenu]``GPG and SSL keys`` subtab of the [guimenu]``Autoinstallation Details`` page.
#. To create a key or certificate, click the [guimenu]``Create Stored Key/Cert`` link in the upper-right corner of the page.
#. Enter a description, select the type, upload the file, and click the btn:[Update Key] button.
#. A unique description is required.
#. [IMPORTANT]
#. ====
#. The GPG key you upload to {productname} must be in ASCII format.
#. Using a GPG key in binary format causes anaconda, and therefore the {kickstart} process, to fail.
#. ====
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:2
msgid "Clients use packages to install, uninstall, and upgrade software."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍໃຊ້ແພັກເກດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ອັບເກຣດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To manage packages on a client, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to manage, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages] "
"subtab.  The options available in this section vary depending on the type of "
"client you have selected, and its current channel subscriptions."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການແພັກເກດໃນ client, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ ເມນູ: Systems[Software > Packages]. ໂຕເລືອກທີ່ມີໃນສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມປະເພດຂອງ client ທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ ແລະ ການຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ (channel subscriptions) ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When packages are installed or upgraded, licenses or EULAs are automatically "
"accepted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ, ໃບອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື EULAs ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Most package management actions can be added to action chains.  For more "
"about action chains, see xref:reference:schedule/action-chains.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການຈັດການແພັກເກດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ action chains ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ action chains, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:schedule/action-chains.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Packages Using Profiles"
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ Profile"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can compare the packages installed on a client with a stored profile, or "
"with packages installed on another client.  When the comparison is made, you "
"can choose to modify the selected client to match."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ກັບ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້, ຫຼື ກັບແພັກເກດ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໄດ້. ເມື່ອທຳການປຽບທຽບແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກປັບປຸງ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກໃຫ້ຕົງກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To compare packages against a profile, you need to have stored a profile.  "
"Profiles are created from the packages on a currently installed client.  "
"When the profile has been created, you can use it to install more clients "
"with the same packages installed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດກັບ profile, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນ. Profile ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ເມື່ອ profile ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຄືກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Stored Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to base your profile off, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > "
"Packages > Profiles] subtab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເປັນຕົ້ນແບບ profile, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ ເມນູ: Systems[Software > Packages > Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Create System Profile]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create System Profile]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:12
msgid "Type a name and description for your profile and click btn:[Create Profile]."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບ profile ຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create Profile]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Comparing Client Packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to compare, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages > "
"Profiles] subtab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປຽບທຽບ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ ເມນູ: Systems[Software > Packages > Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To compare with a stored profile, select the profile and click "
"btn:[Compare]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ profile ນັ້ນ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Compare]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To compare with another client, select the client name and click "
"btn:[Compare] to see a list of differences between the two clients."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Compare] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍທັງສອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັດ (Patch Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use custom patches within your organization to manage clients.  This "
"allows you to issue patch alerts for packages in custom channels, schedule "
"patch installation, and manage patches across organizations."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແຈ້ງເຕືອນແພັດສຳລັບແພັກເກດໃນແຊນແນວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ກຳນົດເວລາການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດ, ແລະ ຈັດການແພັດໃນແຕ່ລະອົງກອນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Patches"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use a custom patch, you need to create the patch, add packages to it and "
"add it to one or more channels."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງແພັດ, ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໄປ ແລະ ເພີ່ມແພັດນັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches], "
"click btn:[Create Patch]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Manage Patches], ຄລິກ btn:[Create Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:7
msgid "In the ``Create Patch`` section, use these details:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``Create Patch``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:8
msgid "In the ``Synopsis`` field, type a short description of the patch."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Synopsis``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບແພັດຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:9
msgid "In the ``Advisory`` field, type a label for the patch."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Advisory``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ (label) ສຳລັບແພັດຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"We recommend you devise a naming convention for your organization to make "
"patch management easier."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຈັດການແພັດງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Advisory Release`` field, enter a release number for your patch."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Advisory Release``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ release ສຳລັບແພັດຊ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:12
msgid "For example, if this is the first version of this patch, use ``1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້ານີ້ເປັນເວີຊັນທຳອິດຂອງແພັດຊ໌ນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:13
msgid "In the ``Advisory Type`` field, select the type of patch to use."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Advisory Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:14
msgid "For example, ``Bug Fix Advisory`` for a patch that fixes errors."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``Bug Fix Advisory`` ສຳລັບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If you selected an advisory type of ``Security Advisory``, in the ``Advisory "
"Severity`` field, select the severity level to use."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກປະເພດເປັນ ``Security Advisory``, ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Advisory Severity``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:16
msgid "In the ``Product`` field, type the name of the product this patch refers to."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Product``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ແພັດຊ໌ນີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:17
msgid "OPTIONAL: In the ``Author`` field, type the name of the author of the patch."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Author``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ສ້າງແພັດຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Complete the ``Topic``, ``Description``, and ``Solution`` fields with "
"further information about the patch."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ ``Topic``, ``Description``, ແລະ ``Solution`` ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແພັດຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:19
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: In the ``Bugs`` section, specify the information of any related "
"bugs, using these details:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໃນສ່ວນ ``Bugs``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ bug ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:20
msgid "In the ``ID`` field, enter the bug number."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``ID``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:21
msgid "In the ``Summary`` field, type a short description of the bug."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Summary``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບ bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:22
msgid "In the ``Bugzilla URL`` field, type the address of the bug."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Bugzilla URL``, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ (URL) ຂອງ bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:23
msgid "In the ``Keywords`` field, type any keywords related to the bug."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Keywords``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳສຳຄັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:24
msgid "Use a comma between each keyword."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຈຸດ (comma) ຂັ້ນລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຄຳສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Complete the ``References`` and ``Notes`` fields with further information "
"about the bug."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ ``References`` ແລະ ``Notes`` ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:26
msgid "Select one or more channels to add the new patch to."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Create Patch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can also create patches by cloning an existing one.  Cloning preserves "
"package associations and simplifies issuing patches."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງແພັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໂຄລນ (cloning) ຈາກແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ການໂຄລນຈະຮັກສາການເຊື່ອມໂຍງແພັກເກດໄວ້ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອອກແພັດງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Cloning Patches"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໂຄລນແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:30
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Clone Patches]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Clone Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the ``View patches potentially applicable to:`` field, select the "
"software channel for the patch you want to clone."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``View patches potentially applicable to:``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ clone."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Select the patch or patches you want to clone, and click btn:[Clone "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໂຄລນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Clone Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:33
msgid "Select one or more channels to add the cloned patch to."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດທີ່ໂຄລນມາເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:34
msgid "Confirm the details to begin the clone."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການໂຄລນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:35
msgid "When you have created a patch, you can assign packages to it."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງແພັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning Packages to a Patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches], and "
"click the the advisory name of the patch to see the patch details."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Patches[Manage Patches], ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ advisory ຂອງແພັດຊ໌ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:38
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Packages[Add] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Packages[Add]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the ``Channel`` field, select the software channel that contains the "
"packages you want to assign to the patch, and click btn:[View Packages]."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້ແພັດຊ໌, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[View Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You can select ``All managed packages`` to see the available packages in all "
"channels."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ ``All managed packages`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີທັງໝົດໃນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:41
msgid "Check the packages you want to include, and click btn:[Add Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລວມເຂົ້າ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Confirm the details of the packages, and click btn:[Confirm] to assign them "
"to the patch."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແພັກເກດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພວກມັນໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Packages[List/Remove] tab to check that the packages "
"have been assigned correctly."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Packages[List/Remove] ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When packages are assigned to a patch, the patch cache is updated to reflect "
"the changes.  The cache update might take a couple of minutes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ, patch cache ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເພື່ອສະແດງການປ່ຽນແປງ. ການອັບເດດແຄຊ (cache) ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"If you need to change the details of an existing patch, you can do so from "
"the [guimenu]``Patches Management`` page."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Patches Management``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and Deleting Existing Patch Alerts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:47
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Manage Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:48
msgid "Click the advisory name of the patch to see the patch details."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ advisory ຂອງແພັດເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:49
msgid "Make the changes as required, and click btn:[Update Patch]."
msgstr "ທຳການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"To delete a patch, select the patch in the [guimenu]``Patches Management`` "
"page, and click btn:[Delete Patches]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບແພັດຊ໌, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແພັດຊ໌ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Patches Management``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:51
msgid "Deleting patches might take a few minutes."
msgstr "ການລຶບແພັດອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply Patches to Clients"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:53
msgid ""
"When a patch is ready, you can apply it to clients either singly, or with "
"other patches."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັດພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳມັນໄປໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ທັງແບບແພັດດຽວ ຫຼື ພ້ອມກັບແພັດອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Each package within a patch is part of one or more channels.  If the client "
"is not subscribed to the channel, the update is not installed."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັກເກດພາຍໃນແພັດແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ແຊນແນວນັ້ນ, ການອັບເດດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If the client has a more recent version of a package already installed, the "
"update is not installed.  If the client has an older version of the package "
"installed, the package is upgraded."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍມີແພັກເກດເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ການອັບເດດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍມີແພັກເກດເວີຊັນເກົ່າກວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່, ແພັກເກດນັ້ນຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying All Applicable Patches"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview] and select "
"the client you want to update."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:58
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Software[Patches] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Software[Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:59
msgid "Click btn:[Select All] to select all applicable patches."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Select All] ເພື່ອເລືອກແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:60
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Patches] to update the client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If you are signed in with Administrator privileges, you can also perform "
"larger batch upgrades for clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍສິດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (Administrator), ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດ ທຳການອັບເກຣດແບບກຸ່ມໃຫຍ່ (batch upgrades) ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying a Single Patch to Multiple Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດດຽວໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:63
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Patch List]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Patch List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Locate the patch you want to apply, and click the number under the "
"``Systems`` column for that patch."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ໝາຍເລກໃນຖັນ ``Systems`` ສຳລັບແພັດຊ໌ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Select the clients you want to apply the patch to, and click btn:[Apply "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:66
msgid "Confirm the list of clients to perform the update."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Multiple Patches to Multiple Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍແພັດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview] and check "
"the clients you want to update to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອັບເດດເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager] and naviagte to the "
"[guimenu]``Patches`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager] ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Patches``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Select the patches you want to apply to the clients and click btn:[Apply "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:71
msgid "Schedule a date and time for the update to occur, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ທຳການອັບເດດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:72
msgid ""
"To check the progress of the update, navigate to menu:Schedule[Pending "
"Actions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການອັບເດດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Scheduled package updates are installed using the contact method configured "
"for each client.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບ ແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພະລັງງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can power on, power off, and reboot clients using the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດເຄື່ອງ, ປິດເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ຣີບູດລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This feature uses either the IPMI or Redfish protocol and is managed using a "
"{cobbler} profile.  The selected client must have a power management "
"controller supporting one of these protocols."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ IPMI ຫຼື Redfish ແລະ ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍໃຊ້ {cobbler} profile. ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກຕ້ອງມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມການຈັດການພະລັງງານທີ່ຮອງຮັບໜຶ່ງໃນໂປຣໂຕຄໍເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For Redfish, ensure you can establish a valid SSL connection between the "
"client and the {productname} Server.  You must have trusted the certificate "
"authority used to sign the SSL Server Certificate of the Redfish management "
"controller.  The CA certificate must be in ``.pem`` format, and stored on "
"the {productname} Server at [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``.  When you "
"have saved the certificate, run [command]``update-ca-certificate``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Redfish, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSL ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖືໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຊັນ SSL Server Certificate ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ Redfish. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ຕ້ອງເປັນຮູບແບບ ``.pem`` ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ທີ່ [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``. ເມື່ອບັນທຶກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``update-ca-certificate``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Power Management"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຈັດການພະລັງງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client you want to manage, and navigate to the menu:Provisioning[Power "
"Management] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Provisioning[Power Management]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:7
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select the power management protocol to use."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຈັດການພະລັງງານທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Complete the details for the power management server, and click the "
"appropriate button for the action to take, or click btn:[Save only] to save "
"the details without taking any action."
msgstr "ຕື່ມລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຊີເວີຈັດການພະລັງງານໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Save only] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກລາຍລະອຽດໂດຍບໍ່ທຳການໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can apply power management actions to multiple clients at the same time "
"by adding them to the system set manager.  For more information about using "
"the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການປະຕິບັດການຈັດການພະລັງງານກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ system set manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Management and {cobbler}"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພະລັງງານ ແລະ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The first time you use a power management feature, a {cobbler} system record "
"is automatically created, if one does not yet exist for the client.  These "
"automatically created system records are not bootable from the network, and "
"include a reference to a dummy system image.  This is needed because "
"{cobbler} does not currently support system records without profiles or "
"images."
msgstr "ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການຈັດການພະລັງງານ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ {cobbler} (system record) ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້, ແລະ ຈະມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ dummy system image. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພາະວ່າໃນປັດຈຸບັນ {cobbler} ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີ profile ຫຼື images."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{cobbler} power management uses fence-agent tools to support protocols other "
"than IPMI.  Only IPMI and Redfish protocols are supported by {productname}.  "
"You can configure your client to use other protocols by adding the "
"fence-agent names as a comma-separated list to the "
"[option]``java.power_management.types`` configuration parameter in the "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` configuration files."
msgstr "{cobbler} power management ນຳໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື fence-agent ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບໂປຣໂຕຄໍອື່ນໆນອກຈາກ IPMI. ມີພຽງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ IPMI ແລະ Redfish ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ client ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຊື່ fence-agent ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ (ຄັ່ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ) ໃນພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``java.power_management.types`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [path]``rhn.conf``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Products"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, software is made available in products.  Your {suse} "
"subscription allows you to access a range of different products, which you "
"can browse and select in the {productname} {webui} by navigating to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊອບແວຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບຜະລິດຕະພັນ. ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) {suse} ຂອງເຈົ້າ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດ ເລືອກເບິ່ງ ແລະ ເລືອກໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Products contain any number of software channels.  Click the `Show product's "
"channels` icon to see the channels included in the product.  When you have "
"added a product and synchronized successfully, you have access to the "
"channels provided by the product, and can use the packages in the product on "
"your {productname} Server and clients."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະປະກອບມີແຊນແນວຊອບແວຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ `Show product's channels` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງແຊນແນວທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແຊນແນວທີ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນສະໜອງໃຫ້, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ແພັກເກດໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:4
msgid "For more information, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:setup-wizard.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:setup-wizard.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ (Bootstrap Script)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Registering clients with a bootstrap script gives you control over "
"parameters, and can help if you have to register a large number of clients "
"at once.  This method works for both Salt and traditional clients."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມພາຣາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆໄດ້ ແລະ ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເມື່ອຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນບາດດຽວ. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບ Salt ແລະ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To register clients using a bootstrap script, we recommend you create a "
"template bootstrap script to begin, which can then be copied and modified.  "
"The bootstrap script you create is executed on the client when it is "
"registered, and ensures all the necessary packages are deployed to the "
"client.  There are some parameters contained in the bootstrap script, which "
"ensure the client system can be assigned to its base channel, including "
"activation keys and GPG keys."
msgstr "ໃນການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງສະຄຣິບຕົ້ນແບບ (template) ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງກັອບປີ້ ແລະ ປັບແກ້. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ຈະຖືກລັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເມື່ອມີການລົງທະບຽນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ. ໃນສະຄຣິບຈະມີພາຣາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດເຂົ້າກັບ base channel ໄດ້, ລວມທັງ activation keys ແລະ GPG keys."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It is important that you check the repository information carefully, to "
"ensure it matches the base channel repository.  If the repository "
"information does not match exactly, the bootstrap script cannot download the "
"correct packages."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນ repository ຢ່າງລະອຽດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ມັນຕົງກັບ repository ຂອງແຊນແນວພື້ນຖານ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນ repository ບໍ່ຕົງກັນ, ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດາວໂຫລດແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"All clients need a bootstrap repository.  It is automatically created and "
"regenerated on the {productname} Server when products are synchronized.  A "
"bootstrap repository includes packages for installing Salt on clients, and "
"for registering Salt or traditional clients.  For more information about "
"creating a bootstrap repository, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງການ bootstrap repository. ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌. bootstrap repository ປະກອບມີແພັກເກດສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt ແລະ ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys and Uyuni Client Tools"
msgstr "GPG Keys ແລະ Uyuni Client Tools"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The GPG key used by Uyuni Client Tools is not trusted by default.  When you "
"create your bootstrap script, add a path to the file containing the public "
"key fingerprint with the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY`` parameter."
msgstr "GPG key ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Uyuni Client Tools ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຊື່ອຖືໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງ bootstrap script, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີລາຍນິ້ວມື public key (fingerprint) ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:8
msgid ""
"openSUSE Leap 15 and SLE 15 use Python 3 by default.  Bootstrap scripts "
"based on Python 2 must be re-created for openSUSE Leap 15 and SLE 15 "
"systems.  If you register openSUSE Leap 15 or SLE 15 systems using Python 2, "
"the bootstrap script fails."
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15 ແລະ SLE 15 ໃຊ້ Python 3 ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Python 2 ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສ້າງໃໝ່ສຳລັບລະບົບ openSUSE Leap 15 ແລະ SLE 15. ຖ້າເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ openSUSE Leap 15 ຫຼື SLE 15 ໂດຍໃຊ້ Python 2, ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Bootstrap Script with [command]``mgr-bootstrap``"
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command generates custom bootstrap scripts.  "
"A bootstrap script is used by {productname} client systems for simplifying "
"their initial registration and configuration."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງ custom bootstrap scripts. bootstrap script ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບ {productname} client ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The arguments [option]``--activation-keys`` and [option]``--script``, are "
"the only mandatory arguments.  On the {productname} Server, as root at the "
"command line execute it with the mandatory arguments.  Replace "
"[systemitem]``<ACTIVATION_KEYS`` and [systemitem]``<EDITED_NAME>`` with your "
"values:"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``--activation-keys`` ແລະ [option]``--script`` ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ. ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍສິດ root ພ້ອມພາຣາມິເຕີດັ່ງກ່າວ. ປ່ຽນ [systemitem]``<ACTIVATION_KEYS>`` ແລະ [systemitem]``<EDITED_NAME>`` ດ້ວຍຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=<ACTIVATION_KEYS> "
"--script=bootstrap-<EDITED_NAME>.sh\n"
msgstr "mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=<ACTIVATION_KEYS> --script=bootstrap-<EDITED_NAME>.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command offers several other options, "
"including the ability to set a specific hostname, set specific GPG keys, and "
"set the registration method (traditional, salt-minion, or salt-bundle)."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການກຳນົດ hostname, GPG keys, ແລະ ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ (traditional, salt-minion, ຫຼື salt-bundle)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [literal]``mgr-bootstrap`` man page, or run "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap --help``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໜ້າ man page ຂອງ [literal]``mgr-bootstrap``, ຫຼື ດຳເນີນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-bootstrap --help``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Bootstrap Script from {webui}"
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create an editable bootstrap "
"script."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#.  2022-10-26, ke: In step 2, check whether we can use {productname} macro.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Bootstrap Script]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bootstrap Script]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Configuration - Bootstrap`` dialog, uncheck "
"the [guimenu]``Bootstrap using Salt`` checkbox if you are installing a "
"traditional client."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Configuration - Bootstrap``, ໃຫ້ເອົາເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກອອກຈາກ [guimenu]``Bootstrap using Salt`` ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:20
msgid "For Salt clients, leave it checked."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຖືກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The required fields are pre-populated with values derived from previous "
"installation steps."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For details on each setting, see "
"xref:reference:admin/bootstrap-script.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:admin/bootstrap-script.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Update] to create the script."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອສ້າງສຄຣິບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The bootstrap script is generated and stored on the server in the "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap`` directory."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can access the bootstrap script over HTTPS.  Replace "
"[literal]``<example.com>`` with the host name of your {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຜ່ານ HTTPS. ປ່ຽນ [literal]``<example.com>`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Do not disable SSL in your bootstrap script.  Ensure that [guimenu]``Enable "
"SSL`` is checked in the {webui}, or that the setting `USING_SSL=1` exists in "
"the bootstrap script.  If you disable SSL, the registration process requires "
"custom SSL certificates."
msgstr "ຫ້າມປິດການໃຊ້ງານ SSL ໃນ bootstrap script ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ [guimenu]``Enable SSL`` ຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ໃນ {webui}, ຫຼື ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `USING_SSL=1` ໃນ bootstrap script. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປິດ SSL, ຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ SSL certificates ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more about custom certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ປັບແກ້ສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can copy and modify the template bootstrap script you created to "
"customize it.  A minimal requirement when modifying a bootstrap script for "
"use with {productname} is the inclusion of an activation key.  Most packages "
"are signed with GPG, so you also need to have trusted GPG keys on your "
"system to install them."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກ່າຍ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຕົ້ນແບບທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕໍ່າໃນການແກ້ໄຂສຄຣິບ bootstrap ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ແມ່ນ ການໃສ່ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key). ແພັກເກດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບດ້ວຍ GPG, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີກຸນແຈ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In this procedure, you need to know the exact name of your activation keys.  "
"Navigate to menu:Home[Overview] and, in the [guimenu]``Tasks`` box, click "
"[guimenu]``Manage Activation Keys``.  All keys created for channels are "
"listed on this page.  You must enter the full name of the key you wish to "
"use in the bootstrap script exactly as presented in the key field.  For more "
"information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ຊື່ທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງ activation keys ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Home[Overview] ແລະ ໃນກ່ອງ [guimenu]``Tasks``, ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Manage Activation Keys``. keys ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້ານີ້. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃສ່ຊື່ເຕັມຂອງ key ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນ bootstrap script ໃຫ້ກົງກັບທີ່ປາກົດໃນຊ່ອງ key ທຸກປະການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Modifying a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບແກ້ສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:33
msgid ""
"On your {productname} Server, as root at the command line change to the "
"bootstrap directory with:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ໃນຖານະ root ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ bootstrap ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Create and rename two copies of the template bootstrap script for use with "
"each of your clients."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນຊື່ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຕົ້ນແບບສອງຊຸດ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles12.sh\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles15.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles12.sh\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles15.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:37
msgid "Open [path]``bootstrap-sles15.sh`` for modification."
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``bootstrap-sles15.sh`` ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Scroll down until you can see the text shown below.  If ``exit 1`` exists in "
"the file, comment it out by typing a hash or pound sign (&#35;) at the "
"beginning of the line.  This activates the script.  Enter the name of the "
"key for this script in the ``ACTIVATION_KEYS=`` field:"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນລົງມາຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. ຖ້າມີ ``exit 1`` ໃນໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນ (comment) ໂດຍການພິມເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash (&#35;) ຢູ່ໜ້າແຖວ. ນີ້ຈະເປັນການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ. ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງ key ສຳລັບສະຄຣິບນີ້ໃນຊ່ອງ ``ACTIVATION_KEYS=``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo \"Enable this script: comment (with #'s) this block (or, at least "
"just\"\n"
"echo \"the exit below)\"\n"
"echo\n"
"#exit 1\n"
msgstr ""
"echo \"Enable this script: comment (with #'s) this block (or, at least just\"\n"
"echo \"the exit below)\"\n"
"echo\n"
"#exit 1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# can be edited, but probably correct (unless created during initial "
"install):\n"
"# NOTE: ACTIVATION_KEYS *must* be used to bootstrap a client machine.\n"
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=1-sles15\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\n"
msgstr ""
"# can be edited, but probably correct (unless created during initial install):\n"
"# NOTE: ACTIVATION_KEYS *must* be used to bootstrap a client machine.\n"
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=1-sles15\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When you have finished, save the file, and repeat this procedure for the "
"second bootstrap script."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຊຸດທີສອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:42
msgid ""
"By default, bootstrap script will try to install "
"[package]``venv-salt-minion`` for Salt clients if it's available in the "
"bootstrap repository and [package]``salt-minion`` if there is no Salt bundle "
"in the bootstrap repository.  It is posible to avoid installing Salt bundle "
"and keep using [package]``salt-minion`` if you need it for some reason."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ສະຄຣິບຈະພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ສຳລັບ Salt clients ຖ້າມີຢູ່ໃນ bootstrap repository ແລະ ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ [package]``salt-minion`` ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ Salt bundle. ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກບໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt bundle ແລະ ໃຊ້ ``salt-minion`` ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect Clients"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:45
msgid ""
"When you have finished creating your script, you can use it to register "
"clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງສຄຣິບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:47
msgid "On the {productname} Server, log in as root."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍສິດ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:48
msgid "At the command prompt, and change to the bootstrap directory:"
msgstr "ໃນເທີມິນໍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ bootstrap:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Run this command to execute the bootstrap script on the client; replace "
"[systemitem]``EXAMPLE.COM`` with the host name of your client:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອ execute bootstrap script ຢູ່ເທິງ client; ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [systemitem]``EXAMPLE.COM`` ດ້ວຍ hostname ຂອງ client ຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat bootstrap-sles15.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "cat bootstrap-sles15.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:52
msgid "Alternatively, on the client, run this command:"
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-sles15.sh | "
"/bin/bash\n"
msgstr "curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-sles15.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:54
msgid ""
"To avoid problems, make sure the bootstrap script is executed using "
"[command]``bash``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ bootstrap script ຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``bash``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:55
msgid ""
"This script downloads the required dependencies located in the repositories "
"directory you created earlier."
msgstr "ສຄຣິບນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ repositories ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the script has finished running, you can check that your client is "
"registered correctly by opening the {productname} {webui} and navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Overview] to ensure the new client is listed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍລົງທະບຽນຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍເປີດ {productname} {webui} ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Overview] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If you used the script to register the Salt client, open the {productname} "
"{webui} and navigate to menu:Salt[Keys] to accept the client key."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ Salt client, ໃຫ້ເປີດ {productname} {webui} ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Salt[Keys] ເພື່ອກົດຍອມຮັບຄີ (key) ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manual Salt client registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Salt client ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In most cases, Salt clients are registered accurately with the default "
"bootstrap methods.  However, you can use Salt to register the client to the "
"{productname} Server manually by editing the Salt minion file on the client, "
"and providing the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the server.  This "
"method uses ports 4505 and 4506 inbound to the server.  This method requires "
"no configuration on the {productname} Server aside from ensuring that these "
"ports are open."
msgstr "ໂດຍສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວ, Salt clients ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍວິທີ bootstrap ມາດຕະຖານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ Salt minion ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ລະບຸ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ພອດ 4505 ແລະ 4506. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄ່າໃດໆໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ນອກຈາກການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Registering on the command line is also possible with traditional clients, "
"but it requires more steps.  It is not covered here.  Use the bootstrap "
"script procedure to register traditional clients.  For more information, see "
"xref:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ command line ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ມີຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນກວ່າ. ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ເວົ້າເຖິງຢູ່ນີ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບແທນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This procedure requires that you have installed the "
"[package]``venv-salt-minion`` (Salt bundle) or the [package]``salt-minion`` "
"package on the Salt client before registration.  Both use configuration "
"files in different locations and filenames remain the same.  The systemd "
"service filename is different."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` (Salt bundle) ຫຼື [package]``salt-minion`` ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ. ທັງສອງຢ່າງໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ແຕ່ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄືກັນ. ສ່ວນຊື່ບໍລິການ systemd ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping this way will only work if you use the "
"[package]``salt-minion`` being part of the client tools channels or of an "
"official {suse} distributions."
msgstr "ການ bootstrapping ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື client (client tools channels) ຫຼື ຈາກ {suse} distribution ທີ່ເປັນທາງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Bundle configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Bundle ([package]``venv-salt-minion``)"
msgstr "Salt Bundle ([package]``venv-salt-minion``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:9
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:10
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:11
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:12
msgid "systemd service file: [path]``venv-salt-minion.service``"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ systemd service: [path]``venv-salt-minion.service``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about the Salt bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt bundle, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Salt Bundle Configuration File"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:34
msgid ""
"On the Salt client, open the [literal]``minion`` configuration file.  The "
"configuration file is either located at:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ Salt client, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [literal]``minion``. ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຈະຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion\n"
msgstr "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the file add or edit the FQDN of the {productname} Server or Proxy, and "
"the activation key if any. Also add the other configuration parameters "
"listed below."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy, ແລະ ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (ຖ້າມີ). ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: SERVER.EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr "master: SERVER.EXAMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    activation_key: \"<Activation_Key_Name>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    activation_key: \"<Activation_Key_Name>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"server_id_use_crc: adler32\n"
"enable_legacy_startup_events: False\n"
"enable_fqdns_grains: False\n"
msgstr ""
"server_id_use_crc: adler32\n"
"enable_legacy_startup_events: False\n"
"enable_fqdns_grains: False\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:23
msgid "Restart the [systemitem]``venv-salt-minion`` service:"
msgstr "Restart ການບໍລິການ [systemitem]``venv-salt-minion``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:44
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, accept the new client key; replace "
"[systemitem]``<client>`` with the name of your client:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບ (accept) client key ໃໝ່; ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [systemitem]``<client>`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ client ຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Minion configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Salt Minion"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Minion ([package]``salt-minion``)"
msgstr "Salt Minion ([package]``salt-minion``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:29
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/salt/``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:30
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/minion``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/salt/minion``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:31
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf``"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:32
msgid "systemd service file: [path]``salt-minion.service``"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ systemd service: [path]``salt-minion.service``"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Salt Minion Configuration File"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:46
msgid ""
"For more information about the Salt minion configuration file, see "
"https://docs.saltstack.com/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:2
msgid "There are several ways to register clients to your {productname} Server."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, we recommend that you register clients using the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you want more control over the process, have to register many clients, or "
"are registering traditional clients, we recommend that you create a "
"bootstrap script."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For Salt clients and even more control over the process, executing single "
"commands on the command line can be useful."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ແລະ ຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການຢ່າງລະອຽດ, ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຜ່ານ command line ກໍມີປະໂຫຍດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:8
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The client must have the date and time synchronized correctly with the "
"{productname} Server before registration."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງມີການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You must create an activation key first, to use bootstrap script or command "
"line method.  For more information about creating activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານກ່ອນ, ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຫຼື ວິທີ command line. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Do not register the {productname} Server to itself.  The {productname} "
"Server must be managed individually or by using another separate "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about using multiple servers, "
"see xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫ້າມລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Server ເຂົ້າກັບຕົວມັນເອງ. {productname} Server ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ {productname} Server ອື່ນທີ່ແຍກກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-alibaba.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{alibabaclo} Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {alibabaclo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-alibaba.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can register {alibabaclo} clients to your {productname} Server.  The "
"method and details vary depending on the operating system of the client."
