#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Snapshots"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກສະຖານະການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configuration Snapshots)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Snapshots record the package profile, configuration files, and {productname} "
"settings for a client at a set point in time.  You can roll back to older "
"snapshots to restore previous configuration settings."
msgstr "Snapshots ຈະບັນທຶກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກດ, ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນຊ່ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບ (roll back) ໄປຫາ snapshot ເກົ່າເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Snapshots are supported on traditional clients only.  Salt clients do not "
"support this feature."
msgstr "Snapshots ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Snapshots are captured automatically after some actions occur.  You can also "
"manually take a snapshot at any time.  We recommend that you ensure you have "
"a current snapshot before performing any potentially destructive action on "
"your clients."
msgstr "Snapshots ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັນທຶກ snapshot ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີ snapshot ລ້າສຸດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Snapshots are enabled by default.  You can disable automatic snapshots by "
"setting [parameter]``enable_snapshots=0`` in the [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file."
msgstr "Snapshots ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [parameter]``enable_snapshots=0`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``rhn.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Manage your snapshots by navigating to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"selecting the client you want to manage.  Navigate to the "
"menu:Provisioning[Snapshots] tab to see a list of all current snapshots for "
"the selected client.  Click the name of a snapshot to see more information "
"about the changes recorded in the snapshot.  You can use the subtabs in the "
"menu:Provisioning[Snapshots] tab to see the changes that rolling back to the "
"selected snapshot makes to:"
msgstr "ຈັດການ snapshots ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Provisioning[Snapshots] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ snapshots ທັງໝົດ. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ snapshot ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແຖບຍ່ອຍເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫາກຍ້ອນກັບໄປຫາ snapshot ນັ້ນ ໃນສ່ວນຂອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:7
msgid "Group memberships"
msgstr "ການເປັນສະມາຊິກກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:8
msgid "Channel subscriptions"
msgstr "ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:9
msgid "Installed packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:10
msgid "Configuration channel subscriptions"
msgstr "ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:12
msgid "Snapshot tags"
msgstr "ແທັກຂອງ Snapshot"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You can use a snapshot to roll back most changes to a client, but not all of "
"them.  For example, you cannot roll back multiple updates, and you cannot "
"roll back a product migration.  Always ensure you have taken a backup before "
"performing upgrades on your clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ snapshot ເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບການປ່ຽນແປງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງໝົດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບການອັບເດດຫຼາຍໆຄັ້ງ ຫຼື ຍ້ອນກັບການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (product migration) ໄດ້. ຄວນສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ສະເໝີກ່ອນການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Snapshot Tags"
msgstr "ແທັກຂອງ Snapshot"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Snapshot tags allow you to add meaningful descriptions to your snapshots.  "
"You can use tags to record extra information about snapshots, such as a last "
"known working configuration, or a successful upgrade."
msgstr "ແທັກຂອງ snapshot ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃສ່ snapshots ໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແທັກເພື່ອບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ດີລ້າສຸດ ຫຼື ການອັບເກຣດທີ່ສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Manage your snapshot tags by navigating to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"selecting the client you want to manage.  Navigate to the "
"menu:Provisioning[Snapshot Tags] tab to see a list of all current snapshot "
"tags for the selected client.  Click [guimenu]``Create System Tag``, enter a "
"description, and click the btn:[Tag Current Snapshot] button."
msgstr "ຈັດການແທັກ snapshots ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Provisioning[Snapshot Tags] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄລິກທີ່ [guimenu]``Create System Tag``, ປ້ອນຄຳອະທິບາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Tag Current Snapshot]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Snapshots on Large Installations"
msgstr "Snapshots ໃນລະບົບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:18
msgid ""
"There is no maximum number of snapshots that {productname} keeps.  This "
"means that the database that stores the snapshots grows as you add more "
"clients, packages, channels, and configuration changes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ snapshots ທີ່ {productname} ຈະເກັບໄວ້. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບ snapshots ຈະໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆ ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແພັກເກດ, ຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງການກຳນົດຄ່າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snapshots.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If you have a large installation, with thousands of clients, you can use the "
"{productname} API to create a recurring cleanup script on a recurring "
"schedule to ensure that old snapshots are deleted regularly.  Alternatively, "
"you can disable the feature by setting [parameter]``enable_snapshots=0`` in "
"the [path]``rhn.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນພັນໆເຄື່ອງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອສ້າງສະຄຣິບທຳຄວາມສະອາດ snapshots ເກົ່າເປັນໄລຍະ. ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [parameter]``enable_snapshots=0`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``rhn.conf``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/add_channels_cli.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Software Channels at the Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (Software Channels) ຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/add_channels_cli.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/add_channels_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/add_channels_cli.adoc:4
msgid "Synchronize the channels:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/add_channels_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_label> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_label_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_label> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_label_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[automatic "
"synchronization] is turned off, synchronize the channels:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ອັດຕະໂນມັດ] ຖືກປິດໄວ້, ໃຫ້ທຳການຊິ້ງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:6
msgid "Ensure the synchronization is complete before continuing."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊິ້ງຄ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:2
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels.  Ensure you specify the correct architecture:"
msgstr "ໃນເທີມິນໍຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິດ root ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະບຸສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (architecture) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"-a <architecture> \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"-a <architecture> \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``mgr-sync`` command to add the appropriate channels:"
msgstr "ໃນເທີມິນໍຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິດ root ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sync`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_1>\n"
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_2>\n"
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_1>\n"
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_2>\n"
"mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Synchronization starts automatically.  If you want to synchronize the "
"channels manually, use:"
msgstr "ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊິ້ງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync sync --with-children <channel_name>\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync sync --with-children <channel_name>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Software Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Locate the appropriate products for your client operating system and "
"architecture using the search bar, and check the appropriate product.  This "
"will automatically check all mandatory channels.  Also all recommended "
"channels are checked as long as the [guimenu]``include recommended`` toggle "
"is turned on.  Click the arrow to see the complete list of related products, "
"and ensure that any extra products you require are checked."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add Products] and wait until the products have finished "
"synchronizing."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add Products] ແລະ ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະຊິ້ງຄ໌ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/appstream_admon.adoc:1
msgid ""
"The AppStream repository provides modular packages.  This results in the "
"{productname} {webui} showing incorrect package information.  You cannot "
"perform package operations such as installing or upgrading directly from "
"modular repositories using the {webui} or API."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ AppStream ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກດແບບ modular. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} {webui} ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງຈາກຄັງເກັບ modular ຜ່ານ {webui} ຫຼື API ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/appstream_admon.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use Salt states to manage modular packages on Salt "
"clients, or use the [command]``dnf`` command on the client.  For more "
"information about CLM, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt states ເພື່ອຈັດການແພັກເກດ modular ໃນ Salt clients ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``dnf`` ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CLM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/arch-other-note.adoc:1
msgid ""
"In the following section, descriptions often default to the "
"[literal]``x86_64`` architecture.  Replace it with other architectures if "
"appropriate."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ຄຳອະທິບາຍມັກຈະກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ [literal]``x86_64``. ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປັນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອື່ນຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress from the Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກ Command Prompt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``tail`` command to check the synchronization log file:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``tail`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log) ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_cli.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channel) ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_cli.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be sure that "
"the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງທັງ base channel ແລະ child channel ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_suma.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ຜ່ານ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_suma.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab.  This dialog displays a completion bar "
"for each product when they are being synchronized."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ເລືອກແຖບ [guimenu]``Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_suma.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], then "
"click the channel associated to the repository.  Navigate to the "
"[guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, then click [guimenu]``Sync`` and check "
"[systemitem]``Sync Status``."
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ກົດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Repositories`` ແລະ ກວດສອບ [systemitem]``Sync Status``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress from the {webui} "
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ຜ່ານ {webui} "

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, then click [guimenu]``Sync`` "
"and check [systemitem]``Sync Status``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Repositories``, ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ [guimenu]``Sync`` ແລະ ກວດສອບ [systemitem]``Sync Status``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:1
msgid ""
"To register your clients, you need a bootstrap repository.  By default, "
"bootstrap repositories are automatically created, and regenerated daily for "
"all synchronized products.  You can manually create the bootstrap repository "
"from the command prompt, using this command:"
msgstr "ໃນການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ bootstrap repository. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຄັງເກັບນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດໃໝ່ທຸກໆມື້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on registering your clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. EOL Client Systems
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/eol-clients.adoc:1
msgid ""
"When the distibution reaches end-of-life, it enters grace period of 3 months "
"when the support is considered deprecated.  After that period, the product "
"is considered unsupported.  Any support may only be available on the "
"best-effort basis."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (end-of-life), ມັນຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ຊ່ວງໄລຍະຜ່ອນຜັນ 3 ເດືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/eol-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For more information about end-of-life dates, see "
"https://endoflife.software/operating-systems."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວັນທີໝົດອາຍຸ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://endoflife.software/operating-systems"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:1
msgid ""
"When you have created all the channels, you can associate them with the "
"repositories you created:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Associating Channels with Repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຊ່ອງທາງກັບ Repositories"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Channels], and click the channel to associate."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, and check the repository to "
"associate with this channel."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Repositories``, ແລະ ເລືອກ repository ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Update Repositories] to associate the channel and the repository."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Update Repositories] ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມໂຍງຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເຂົ້າກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:6
msgid "Repeat for all channels and repositories you need to associate."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:7
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab to set a recurring schedule "
"for synchronization of this repository."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Sync`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງການຊິງໂຄໄນແບບຊໍ້າຄືນສຳລັບ repository ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_associate.adoc:8
msgid "Click btn:[Sync Now] to begin synchronization immediately."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Sync Now] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຊິ້ງຄ໌ໃນທັນທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Channel] and set the appropriate parameters for the "
"channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent Channel`` field, select the appropriate base "
"channel."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Parent Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Repeat for all channels you need to create.  There should be one custom "
"channel for each custom repository."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ. ຄວນມີຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄັງເກັບຊອບແວກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can check that you have created all the appropriate channels and "
"repositories, by navigating to menu:Software[Channel List > All]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channel List > All]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_repos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Custom Repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Repositories ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_repos.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Repositories]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_repos.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Repository] and set the appropriate parameters for the "
"repository."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_repos.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/manual_repos.adoc:5
msgid "Repeat for all repositories you need to create."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳສຳລັບທຸກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/traditional_client_warning.adoc:1
msgid ""
"This version of {productname} is compatible with {salt} and traditional "
"clients (on some operating systems). SUSE will deprecate traditional clients "
"in the next {productname} {productnumber} release."
msgstr "{productname} ເວີຊັນນີ້ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ {salt} ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (ໃນບາງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ). SUSE ຈະເລີ່ມຍົກເລີກການຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມໃນການປ່ອຍ {productname} {productnumber} ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/traditional_client_warning.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The release that follows {productname} {productnumber} will not support "
"traditional clients and is planned for 2023."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນທີ່ຈະອອກຕາມຫຼັງ {productname} {productnumber} ຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເຊິ່ງມີແຜນຈະປ່ອຍໃນປີ 2023."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/traditional_client_warning.adoc:3
msgid ""
"We encourage all new deployments to use {salt} clients exclusively, and to "
"migrate existing traditional clients to {salt}."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ທຸກການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ມາເປັນ {salt}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trust GPG Keys on Clients"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອຖື GPG Keys ເທິງ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Operating systems either trust their own GPG keys directly or at least ship "
"them installed with the minimal system.  But third party packages signed by "
"a different GPG key need manual handling.  The clients can be successfully "
"bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  However, you cannot install "
"new client tool packages or update them until the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການມັກຈະເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ຂອງຕົນເອງໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍກໍມີການຕິດຕັ້ງມານຳໃນລະບົບຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. ແຕ່ແພັກເກດຈາກພາຍນອກທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຄີ GPG ອື່ນແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຮັດ bootstrap ໄດ້ສຳເລັດເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຄີ GPG ຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກເຊື່ອຖືເທື່ອກໍຕາມ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອັບເດດພວກມັນໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າຄີຈະຖືກເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Salt clients now use GPG key information entered for a software channel to "
"manage the trusted keys.  When a software channel with GPG key information "
"is assigned to a client, the key is trusted as soon as the channel is "
"refreshed or the first package gets installed from this channel."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ Salt clients ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ GPG key ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເພື່ອຈັດການຄີທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້. ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ GPG key ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ຄີນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອຖືທັນທີເມື່ອມີການຣີເຟຣຊຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທຳອິດຈາກຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The GPG key URL parameter in the software channel page can contain multiple "
"key URLs separated by \"whitespace\".  In case it is a file URL, the GPG key "
"file must be deployed on the client before the software channel is used."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ URL ຂອງຄີ GPG ໃນໜ້າຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ສາມາດປະກອບມີຫຼາຍ URL ໂດຍແຍກກັນດ້ວຍ \"ຍະຫວ່າງ\" (whitespace). ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເປັນ URL ຂອງໄຟລ໌, ໄຟລ໌ຄີ GPG ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການວາງລະບົບເທິງລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວນັ້ນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The GPG keys for the Client Tools Channels of {redhat} based clients are "
"deployed on the client into [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/`` and can be "
"referenced with file URLs.  Same is the case with the GPG keys of Expanded "
"Support clients.  Only in case a software channel is assigned to the client "
"they will be imported and trusted by the system."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະຫັດ GPG ສໍາລັບຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {redhat} ແມ່ນຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໄວ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/`` ແລະ ສາມາດອ້າງອີງດ້ວຍ URL ຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ກໍລະນີດຽວກັນກັບກຸ່ມລະຫັດ GPG ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ Expanded Support. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຈາກລະບົບ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Because Debian based systems sign only metadata, there is no need to specify "
"extra keys for single channels.  If a user configures an own GPG key to sign "
"the metadata as described in \"Use Your Own GPG Key\" in "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[] the deployment and trust of that "
"key is executed automatically."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກລະບົບທີ່ອີງຕາມ Debian ຈະເຊັນສະເພາະ metadata ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຄີເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງດຽວ. ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄີ GPG ຂອງຕົນເອງເພື່ອເຊັນ metadata ດັ່ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ \"Use Your Own GPG Key\" ໃນ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[] ການວາງລະບົບ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອຖືຄີນັ້ນຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "User defined GPG keys"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະຫັດ GPG ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:8
msgid "Users can define their own GPG keys to be deployed to the client."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກຳນົດລະຫັດ GPG ຂອງຕົນເອງເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By providing some pillar data and providing the GPG key files in the {salt} "
"filesystem, they are automatically deployed to the client."
msgstr "ໂດຍການສະໜອງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ບາງສ່ວນ ແລະ ສະໜອງໄຟລ໌ຄີ GPG ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {salt}, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກວາງໄປຍັງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:10
msgid ""
"These keys are deployed into [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/`` on RPM based "
"operating systems and to [path]``/usr/share/keyrings/`` on Debian systems:"
msgstr "ຄີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ RPM ແລະ [path]``/usr/share/keyrings/`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ Debian:"

#.  I think the cat command is here to show the contents of the file.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Define the pillar key [literal``custom_gpgkeys`` for the client you want to "
"deploy the key to and list the names of the key file."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ pillar key [literal]``custom_gpgkeys`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#.  In this case, the cat is superfluous.
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat /srv/pillar/mypillar.sls\n"
"custom_gpgkeys:\n"
"  - my_first_gpg.key\n"
"  - my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"
msgstr ""
"cat /srv/pillar/mypillar.sls\n"
"custom_gpgkeys:\n"
"  - my_first_gpg.key\n"
"  - my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"

#.  I think the ls command is here to show the contents of the directory.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Additionally in the {salt} filesystem create a directory named [path]``gpg`` "
"and store there the GPG key files with the name specified in the "
"[iteral]``custom_gpgkeys`` pillar data."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນ {salt} filesystem ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂຟນເດີຊື່ [path]``gpg``."

#.  In this case, the ls is superfluous.
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ls -la /srv/salt/gpg/\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_first_gpg.key\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"
msgstr ""
"ls -la /srv/salt/gpg/\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_first_gpg.key\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The keys are now deployed to the client at "
"[path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key`` and "
"[path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg``."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ລະຫັດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key`` ແລະ [path]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg`` ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The last step is to add the URL to the GPG key URL field of the software "
"channel.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the "
"channel you want to modify.  Add to [guimenu]``GPG key URL`` the value "
"[literal]``file:///etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key``."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນການເພີ່ມ URL ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ GPG key URL ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys in Bootstrap Scripts"
msgstr "ຄີ GPG ໃນສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting GPG Keys on Clients Using a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, check the contents of "
"the [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` directory.  This directory contains all "
"available public keys.  Take a note of the key that applies to the channel "
"assigned to the client you are registering."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບເນື້ອໃນໃນໂຟນເດີ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Open the relevant bootstrap script, locate the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` "
"parameter and add the required key.  For example:"
msgstr "ເປີດ bootstrap script ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ຄົ້ນຫາພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"
msgstr "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/snippets/trust_gpg.adoc:22
msgid "You do not need to delete any previously stored keys."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລຶບຄີໃດໆທີ່ເຄີຍເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

