#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sle-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported {sle-micro} Client Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໄຄລແອນ {sle-micro} ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sle-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The operating system you run on a client is supported by the organization "
"that supplies the operating system.  {sle-micro} is supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍອົງກອນທີ່ສະໜອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນ. {sle-micro} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sle-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{sle-micro} is only supported as regular minion ([systemitem]``default`` "
"contact method) for the time being. We are working on managing it as Salt "
"SSH client ([systemitem]``salt-ssh`` contact method), too."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະນີ້ {sle-micro} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນຖານະ minion ແບບປົກກະຕິ (ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ [systemitem]``default``) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງພັດທະນາການຈັດການໃນຖານະລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH (ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ [systemitem]``salt-ssh``) ຢູ່ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sle-micro.adoc:16
