#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sles.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This table lists the availability of various features on {suse} and "
"{opensuse} clients.  This table covers all variants of the {sle} operating "
"system, including {slsa}, {sleda}, {sles} for SAP, and {sles} for HPC."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {suse} ແລະ {opensuse}. ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ລວມເຖິງທຸກລຸ້ນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sle}, ລວມທັງ {slsa}, {sleda}, {sles} ສຳລັບ SAP, ແລະ {sles} ສຳລັບ HPC."

