#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Clients and Features"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} is compatible with a range of client technologies.  You can "
"install traditional or Salt clients, running {sle} or another Linux "
"operating system, with a range of hardware options."
msgstr "{productname} ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບເຕັກໂນໂລຊີໄຄລແອນທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ທັງໄຄລແອນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional) ຫຼື Salt, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ງານໃນ {sle} ຫຼື ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ Linux ອື່ນໆ, ພ້ອມກັບທາງເລືອກຮາດແວທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section contains summary of supported client systems. For a detailed "
"list of features available on each client, see the following pages."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບົດສະຫຼຸບຂອງລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງໃນໜ້າຕໍ່ໆໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Client Systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຄລແອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Supported operating systems for traditional and Salt clients are listed in "
"this table."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບໄຄລແອນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (Traditional) ແລະ Salt ແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:7
msgid "{check} clients running this operating system are supported by {suse}"
msgstr "{check} ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນີ້ ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:8
msgid "{cross} clients running this operating system are not supported by {suse}"
msgstr "{cross} ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນີ້ ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{question} clients are under consideration, and may or may not be supported "
"at a later date."
msgstr "{question} ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການພິຈາລະນາ, ແລະ ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Client operating system versions and SP levels must be under general support "
"(normal or LTSS) to be supported with {productname}.  For details on "
"supported product versions, see https://www.suse.com/lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features.adoc:11
