#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information, see the man page on your {productname} server for "
"[command]``virtual-host-gatherer``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ໜ້າ man page ໃນ {productname} server ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບ [command]``virtual-host-gatherer``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "man virtual-host-gatherer\n"
msgstr "man virtual-host-gatherer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The `README` file of that package provides background information about the "
"`type` of a hypervisor, etc.:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ `README` ຂອງແພັກເກດນັ້ນຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານກ່ຽວກັບ `type` ຂອງ hypervisor, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/doc/packages/virtual-host-gatherer/README.md\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/doc/packages/virtual-host-gatherer/README.md\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:22
msgid "The man page and the `README` file also contain example configuration files."
msgstr "ໜ້າຄູ່ມື ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ `README` ຍັງມີຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "VHM and Google Compute Engine"
msgstr "VHM ແລະ Google Compute Engine"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from Google "
"Compute Engine (GCE)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ virtual host manager (VHM) ເພື່ອລວບລວມ instances ຈາກ Google Compute Engine (GCE)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The VHM you create needs to have the correct permissions assigned to access "
"the GCE VM."
msgstr "VHM ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດສິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ GCE VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log in to your Google Cloud Platform account as an administrator, and use "
"the Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) tool to ensure that the "
"service account has the appropriate roles."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Google Cloud Platform ຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Cloud IAM ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າບັນຊີບໍລິການ (service account) ມີບົດບາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a GCE VHM"
msgstr "ສ້າງ GCE VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To run a VHM, your {productname} Server needs to have port 443 open, to "
"access the clients."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລັນ VHM, {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ 443 ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Before you begin, log in to the GCE panel, and download a certificate file.  "
"Store this file locally on your {productname} Server, and take note of the "
"path."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ GCE panel, ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate file)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a GCE VHM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ GCE VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``Google Compute Engine`` from the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create] ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Google Compute Engine`` ຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add a Google Conpute Engine Virtual Host Manager`` "
"section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Add a Google Compute Engine Virtual Host Manager``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Service Account Email`` field, type the email address "
"associated with your service account."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Service Account Email``, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບັນຊີບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Cert Path`` field, type the local path on the "
"{productname} Server to the key that you downloaded from the GCE panel."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Cert Path``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໃນ {productname} Server ໄປຫາຄີ (key) ທີ່ທ່ານດາວໂຫຼດມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Project ID`` field, type the project ID used by the GCE "
"instance."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Project ID``, ໃຫ້ພິມ ID ໂຄງການທີ່ GCE instance ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:20
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Zone`` field, type the zone your VM is located in."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Zone``, ໃຫ້ພິມໂຊນທີ່ VM ຂອງທ່ານຕັ້ງຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigning Permissions"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດສິດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ERROR: {'domain': 'global', 'reason': 'forbidden', 'message': \"Required "
"'compute.zones.list' permission for 'projects/project-id'\"}\n"
"ERROR: Could not connect to the Google Compute Engine Public Cloud using "
"specified credentials.\n"
msgstr ""
"ERROR: {'domain': 'global', 'reason': 'forbidden', 'message': \"Required 'compute.zones.list' permission for 'projects/project-id'\"}\n"
"ERROR: Could not connect to the Google Compute Engine Public Cloud using specified credentials.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_google.json -o out_google.json -vvv\n"
msgstr "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_google.json -o out_google.json -vvv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:31
msgid "The [path]``input_google.json`` file should contain this information:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ [path]``input_google.json`` ຄວນປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"google_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"GoogleCE\",\n"
"        \"service_account_email\": \"mail@example.com\",\n"
"        \"cert_path\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"project_id\": \"project-id\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"google_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"GoogleCE\",\n"
"        \"service_account_email\": \"mail@example.com\",\n"
"        \"cert_path\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"project_id\": \"project-id\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "GCE UUID"
msgstr "GCE UUID"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Instances running on the Google public cloud report this UUID to "
"{productname} Server:"
msgstr "Instances ທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນ Google public cloud ຈະລາຍງານ UUID ນີ້ໄປຫາ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "152986662232938449\n"
msgstr "152986662232938449\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "VHM and Kubernetes"
msgstr "VHM ແລະ Kubernetes"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:2
msgid "You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to manage {kube} clusters."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໂຮສສະເໝືອນ (VHM) ເພື່ອຈັດການຄລັສເຕີ {kube} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use {productname} with {kube}, you will need to have your {productname} "
"Server configured for container management, with all required channels "
"present, and a registered container build host available."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ {productname} ຮ່ວມກັບ {kube}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ສຳລັບການຈັດການຄອນເທນເນີ, ໂດຍມີທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ມີໂຮສສຳລັບສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:5
msgid "You also require:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:6
msgid "At least one {kube} cluster available on your network."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄລັສເຕີ {kube} ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``virtual-host-gatherer-Kubernetes`` package installed on "
"the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``virtual-host-gatherer-Kubernetes`` ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:8
msgid "{kube} version 1.5.0 or higher."
msgstr "{kube} ເວີຊັນ 1.5.0 ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:9
msgid "Docker version 1.12 or higher on the container build host."
msgstr "Docker ເວີຊັນ 1.12 ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a {kube} VHM"
msgstr "ສ້າງ {kube} VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:11
msgid "{kube} clusters are registered with {productname} as a VHM."
msgstr "ຄລັສເຕີ {kube} ຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ໃນຖານະ VHM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You will need a ``kubeconfig`` file to register and authorize your {kube} "
"cluster.  You can get a ``kubeconfig`` file using the {kube} command line "
"tool ``kubectl``.  ``kubectl config view --flatten=true`` provides the "
"configuration with the certificate files embedded as needed for the VHM."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໄຟລ໌ ``kubeconfig`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດຄລັສເຕີ {kube} ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາໄຟລ໌ ``kubeconfig`` ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງ ``kubectl``. ``kubectl config view --flatten=true`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ VHM."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a {kube} VHM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ {kube} VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``Kubernetes Cluster``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Kubernetes Cluster``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add a Kubernetes Virtual Host Manager`` section, use these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Add a Kubernetes Virtual Host Manager``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Select the [path]``kubeconfig`` file that contains the required data for the "
"{kube} cluster."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ [path]``kubeconfig`` ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຄລັສເຕີ {kube}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``context`` field, select the appropriate context for the "
"cluster."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``context``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກບໍລິບົດ (context) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:20
msgid "This is specified in the [path]``kubeconfig`` file."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``kubeconfig``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing the Nodes in a Cluster"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງໂນດ (Nodes) ໃນຄລັສເຕີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:24
msgid "Select the {kube} cluster."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄລັສເຕີ {kube}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:25
msgid "Refresh the node data by clicking btn:[Schedule refresh data]."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໂນດໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄລິກ btn:[Schedule refresh data]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The node data can take a few moments to update.  You might need to refresh "
"your browser window to see the updated information."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໂນດອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຄາວໜຶ່ງເພື່ອອັບເດດ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໂຫຼດໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີໃໝ່ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Any connection or authentication problems are logged to "
"[path]``gatherer.log``."
msgstr "ບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ [path]``gatherer.log``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Node data is not refreshed during registration.  You need to manually "
"refresh the data to see it."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໂນດຈະບໍ່ຖືກໂຫຼດໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ກົດໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອເບິ່ງມັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve Image Runtime Data"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິເມຈ (Image Runtime Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can view runtime data about {kube} images in the {productname} {webui}, "
"by navigating to menu:Images[Image List]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈຂອງ {kube} ໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Image List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:31
msgid "The image list table contains three columns:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງລາຍຊື່ອອິເມຈປະກອບມີສາມຖັນ (columns):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:32
msgid "[guimenu]``Revision``:"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Revision``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:33
msgid ""
"A sequence number that increments on every rebuild for images built by "
"{productname}, or on every import for externally built images."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກລຳດັບທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ສ້າງອິເມຈໃໝ່ໂດຍ {productname}, ຫຼື ໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:34
msgid "[guimenu]``Runtime``:"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Runtime``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Overall status of the running instances for each image in registered "
"clusters."
msgstr "ສະຖານະໂດຍລວມຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instances) ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອິເມຈໃນຄລັສເຕີທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:36
msgid "[guimenu]``Instances``:"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Instances``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Number of instances running this image across all the clusters registered in "
"{productname}.  You can see a breakdown of numbers by clicking the pop-up "
"icon next to the number."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານອິເມຈນີ້ໃນທຸກຄລັສເຕີທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕົວເລກໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນປັອບອັບຂ້າງຕົວເລກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:38
msgid "The [guimenu]``Runtime`` column displays one of these status messages:"
msgstr "ຖັນ [guimenu]``Runtime`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມສະຖານະໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:39
msgid "``All instances are consistent with SUSE Manager``:"
msgstr "``All instances are consistent with SUSE Manager``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:40
msgid ""
"All the running instances are running the same build of the image as tracked "
"by {productname}."
msgstr "ທຸກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກແມ່ນໃຊ້ງານອິເມຈເວີຊັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ {productname} ຕິດຕາມຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:41
msgid "``Outdated instances found``:"
msgstr "``Outdated instances found``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Some of the instances are running an older build of the image.  You might "
"need to redeploy the image."
msgstr "ພົບວ່າບາງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານອິເມຈເວີຊັນເກົ່າ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ (redeploy) ອິເມຈໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:43
msgid "``No information``:"
msgstr "``No information``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:44
msgid ""
"The checksum of the instance image does not match the image data contained "
"in {productname}.  You might need to redeploy the image."
msgstr "ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງອິເມຈໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ກົງກັບຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ (redeploy) ອິເມຈໃໝ່."

#.  This procedure needs help. LKB 2019-10-03
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building an Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:46
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Images[Stores]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Stores]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:47
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to create an image store."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ (image store)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:48
msgid "Navigate to menu:Images[Profiles]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:49
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to create an image profile."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:50
msgid "You will need to use a dockerfile that is suitable to deploy to {kube}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ dockerfile ທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ (deploy) ໄປທີ່ {kube}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:51
msgid "Navigate to menu:Images[Build] to build an image with the new profile."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:52
msgid "Deploy the image into one of the registered {kube} clusters."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ (Deploy) ອິເມຈເຂົ້າໄປໃນໜຶ່ງໃນຄລັສເຕີ {kube} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:53
msgid "You can do this with the [command]``kubectl`` tool."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``kubectl``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:54
msgid ""
"The updated data should now be available in the image list at "
"menu:Images[Image List]."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຄວນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ອິເມຈທີ່ menu:Images[Image List]."

#.  This procedure needs help. LKB 2019-10-03
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing a Previously Deployed Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈທີ່ເຄີຍໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ (deploy) ມາກ່ອນແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:56
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Images[Image Stores]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Image Stores]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Add the registry that owns the image you want to import, if it is not "
"already there."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເຣຈິສຕຣີ (registry) ທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງອິເມຈທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າ, ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:58
msgid "Navigate to menu:Images[Image List] and click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Image List] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Import]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Complete the fields, select the image store you created, and click "
"btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນໃນຫ້ອງຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ເລືອກບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Import]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The imported image should now be available in the image list at "
"menu:Images[Image List]."
msgstr "ອິເມຈທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຄວນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ອິເມຈທີ່ menu:Images[Image List]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Rebuilding a Previously Deployed Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ເຄີຍໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ (deploy) ມາກ່ອນແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:62
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Images[Image List], locate "
"the row that contains the image you want to rebuild, and click "
"btn:[Details]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Image List], ຊອກຫາແຖວທີ່ມີອິເມຈທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:63
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Build Status`` section, and click btn:[Rebuild]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Build Status``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Rebuild]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:64
msgid "The rebuild can take some time to complete."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຄາວໜຶ່ງຈຶ່ງຈະສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When the rebuild has successfully completed, the runtime status of the image "
"is updated in the image list at menu:Images[Image List].  This shows that "
"the instances are running a previous build of the image."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກ (runtime) ຂອງອິເມຈຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນລາຍຊື່ອິເມຈທີ່ menu:Images[Image List]. ສິ່ງນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານອິເມຈເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:66
msgid ""
"You can only rebuild images if they were originally built with "
"{productname}.  You cannot rebuild imported images."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງອິເມຈຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ສະເພາະອິເມຈທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາແຕ່ທຳອິດດ້ວຍ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Retrieving Additional Runtime Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການເຮັດວຽກ (Runtime Data) ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Images[Image List], locate "
"the row that contains the running instance, and click btn:[Details]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Images[Image List], ຊອກຫາແຖວທີ່ມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:69
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Overview`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Overview``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:70
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Image Info`` section, there is data in the "
"[guimenu]``Runtime`` and [guimenu]``Instances`` fields."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Image Info``, ຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Runtime`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Instances``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:71
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Runtime`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Runtime``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:72
msgid ""
"This section contains a information about the {kube} pods running this image "
"in all the registered clusters.  The information in this section includes:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ {kube} pods ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານອິເມຈນີ້ໃນທຸກຄລັສເຕີທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ຂໍ້ມູນໃນສ່ວນນີ້ລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:73
msgid "Pod name."
msgstr "ຊື່ Pod."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:74
msgid "Namespace which the pod resides in."
msgstr "ເນມສະເປສ (Namespace) ທີ່ Pod ນັ້ນຕັ້ງຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:75
msgid "The runtime status of the container in the specific pod."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຄອນເທນເນີໃນ Pod ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Permissions and Certificates"
msgstr "ສິດອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:77
msgid ""
"You can only use [path]``kubeconfig`` files with {productname} if they "
"contain all embedded certificate data."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ [path]``kubeconfig`` ກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນມີຂໍ້ມູນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນຄົບຖ້ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:78
msgid "The API calls from {productname} are:"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ຈາກ {productname} ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:79
msgid "``GET /api/v1/pods``"
msgstr "``GET /api/v1/pods``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:80
msgid "``GET /api/v1/nodes``"
msgstr "``GET /api/v1/nodes``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:81
msgid "The minimum recommended permissions for {productname} are:"
msgstr "ສິດອະນຸຍາດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບ {productname} ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:82
msgid "A ClusterRole to list all the nodes:"
msgstr "ClusterRole ສຳລັບການສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂນດທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resources: [\"nodes\"]\n"
"verbs: [\"list\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"resources: [\"nodes\"]\n"
"verbs: [\"list\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:84
msgid ""
"A ClusterRole to list pods in all namespaces (role binding must not restrict "
"the namespace):"
msgstr "ClusterRole ສຳລັບການສະແດງລາຍຊື່ pods ໃນທຸກໆເນມສະເປສ (ການຜູກມັດບົດບາດ ຫຼື role binding ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຈຳກັດເນມສະເປສ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resources: [\"pods\"]\n"
"verbs: [\"list\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"resources: [\"pods\"]\n"
"verbs: [\"list\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:86
msgid ""
"If ``/pods`` returns a 403 reponse, the entire cluster is ignored by "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າ ``/pods`` ສົ່ງຄ່າຕອບກັບ 403, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄລັສເຕີທັງໝົດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-kubernetes.adoc:87
msgid ""
"For more information on working with RBAC Authorization, see "
"https://kubernetes.io/docs/admin/authorization/rbac/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດວຽກກັບການອະນຸຍາດແບບ RBAC, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://kubernetes.io/docs/admin/authorization/rbac/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with Nutanix"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Virtualization ກັບ Nutanix"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{suse} is a Nutanix ecosystem partner and SUSE Manager has obtained the "
"Nutanix-ready certification in the \"Nutanix AHV integrated\" category."
msgstr "{suse} ເປັນພັນທະມິດໃນລະບົບນິເວດຂອງ Nutanix ແລະ SUSE Manager ໄດ້ຮັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງ Nutanix ໃນໝວດหมู่ \"Nutanix AHV integrated\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about Nutanix integrations, see "
"https://www.nutanix.com/partners/technology-alliances/suse"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ Nutanix, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://www.nutanix.com/partners/technology-alliances/suse"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can use Nutanix AHV virtual machines with {productname} by setting up a "
"virtual host manager (VHM).  To begin, you need to set up a VHM on your "
"{productname} Server, and inventory the available VM hosts."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ Nutanix AHV ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການ virtual host (VHM). ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ VHM ເທິງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ສຳຫຼວດຂໍ້ມູນ (inventory) ຂອງ VM host ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "VHM Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Ensure you have installed the [systemitem]``virtual-host-gatherer-Nutanix`` "
"package on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຊຸດຊອບແວ [systemitem]``virtual-host-gatherer-Nutanix`` ໃນ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To run a VHM, your {productname} Server must have port 9440 open to access "
"the Nutanix Prism Element API."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ VHM ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ 9440 ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ Nutanix Prism Element API."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Nutanix VHM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Nutanix VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``Nutanix AHV``."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create] ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Nutanix AHV``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add a Nutanix AHV Virtual Host Manager`` section, use "
"these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Add a Nutanix AHV Virtual Host Manager``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Hostname`` field, type the fully qualified domain name "
"(FQDN) or host IP address."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Hostname``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Port`` field, type the Prism Element API port to use (for "
"example, [parameter]``9440``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Port``, ໃຫ້ພິມພອດ Prism Element API ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``9440``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Username`` field, type the username associated with the VM "
"host."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Username``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ VM host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, type the password associated with the VM "
"host user."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ VM host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:20
msgid "On the [guimenu]``Virtual Host Managers`` page select the new VHM."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Virtual Host Managers``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ VHM ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Connecting to the Nutanix Prism API server from a browser using HTTPS can "
"sometimes log an ``invalid certificate`` error.  If this occurs, refreshing "
"the data from the virtual host manager fails.  A valid SSL certificate (not "
"self-signed) is required on your Nutanix API server."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີບເວີ Nutanix Prism API ຈາກບຣາວເຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTPS ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``invalid certificate``. ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ຈາກຕົວຈັດການໂຮສສະເໝືອນຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ self-signed) ໃນເຊີບເວີ Nutanix API ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are using a custom CA authority for your Nutanix SSL certificate, "
"copy the custom CA certificate to [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors`` on the "
"{productname} Server.  Re-trust the certificate by running the "
"[command]``update-ca-certificates`` command on the command line, and restart "
"the spacewalk services."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ CA ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Nutanix SSL ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ນັ້ນໄປທີ່ [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors`` ໃນ {productname} Server. ຢັ້ງຢືນຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``update-ca-certificates`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໄລ, ແລ້ວເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ spacewalk ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:24
msgid ""
"After your VHM has been created and configured, Taskomatic runs data "
"collection automatically.  If you want to manually perform data collection, "
"navigate to menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers], select the appropriate VHM, "
"and click btn:[Refresh Data]."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ VHM ຂອງທ່ານຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, Taskomatic ຈະເລີ່ມເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Virtual Host Managers], ເລືອກ VHM ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Refresh Data]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:25
msgid ""
"{productname} ships with a tool called [command]``virtual-host-gatherer`` "
"that can connect to VHMs using their API, and request information about "
"virtual hosts.  [command]``virtual-host-gatherer`` maintains the concept of "
"optional modules, where each module enables a specific VHM.  This tool is "
"automatically invoked nightly by Taskomatic.  Log files for the "
"[command]``virtual-host-gatherer`` tool are located at "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/gatherer.log``."
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມື [command]``virtual-host-gatherer``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with VMWare"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use VMWare vSphere virtual machines, including ESXi and vCenter, "
"with {productname} by setting up a virtual host manager (VHM)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To begin, you need to set up a VHM on your {productname} Server, and "
"inventory the available VM hosts.  Taskomatic can then begin data collection "
"using the VMs API."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ VHM ເທິງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ສຳຫຼວດຂໍ້ມູນ VM host ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຈາກນັ້ນ Taskomatic ຈະສາມາດເລີ່ມເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ API ຂອງ VM ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To run a VHM, your {productname} Server needs to have port 443 open, to "
"access the VMWare API."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:7
msgid ""
"VMWare hosts use access roles and permissions to control access to hosts and "
"guests.  Ensure that any VMWare objects or resources that you want to be "
"inventoried by the VHM have at least [parameter]``read-only`` permissions.  "
"If you want to exclude any objects or resources, mark them with "
"[parameter]``no-access``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When you are adding new hosts to {productname}, you need to consider if the "
"roles and permissions that have been assigned to users and objects need to "
"be inventoried by {productname}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມ host ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາວ່າຍັງມີບົດບາດ ແລະ ສິດທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ວັດຖຸ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກສຳຫຼວດໂດຍ {productname} ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more on users, roles, and permissions, see the VMWare vSphere "
"documentation: https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-vSphere/index.html"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a VMWare VHM"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``VMWare-based``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add a VMWare-based Virtual Host Manager`` section, use "
"these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Port`` field, type the ESXi API port to use (for example, "
"[parameter]``443``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Port``, ໃຫ້ພິມພອດ ESXi API ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``443``)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Connecting to the ESXi server from a browser using HTTPS can sometimes log "
"an ``invalid certificate`` error.  If this occurs, refreshing the data from "
"the virtual hosts server fails.  To correct the problem, extract the "
"certificate from the ESXi server, and copy it to "
"[path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors``.  Re-trust the certificate by running the "
"[command]``update-ca-certificates`` command on the command line, and restart "
"the spacewalk services."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີບເວີ ESXi ຈາກບຣາວເຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTPS ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``invalid certificate``. ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ດຶງເອົາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກເຊີບເວີ ESXi, ແລ້ວກັອບປີ້ໄປທີ່ [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors``. ຢັ້ງຢືນຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``update-ca-certificates``, ແລ້ວເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ spacewalk ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting SSL Errors on VMWare"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you see SSL errors while configuring your VMWare installation, you need "
"to download the CA certificate file from VMWare, and trust it on "
"{productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting VMWare CA Certificates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:29
msgid "Download the CA Certificate from your VMWare installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can do this by logging in to your vCenter {webui}, and clicking "
"btn:[Download trusted root CA certificates]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ vCenter {webui} ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Download trusted root CA certificates]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:31
msgid ""
"If the downloaded CA certificates file is in ``.zip`` format, extract the "
"archive."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ``.zip``, ໃຫ້ເຮັດການແຕກໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The certificate files have a number as an extension.  For example, "
"``certificate.0``."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະມີຕົວເລກເປັນນາມສະກຸນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``certificate.0``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Copy the certificate files to your {productname} Server, and save them to "
"the [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`` directory."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄປຫາ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Change the filename suffix on the copied certificate to either ``.crt`` or "
"``.pem``."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຄັດລອກມາໃຫ້ເປັນ ``.crt`` ຫຼື ``.pem``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:35
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, update the CA "
"certificate record:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃນໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດບັນທຶກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr "update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Managers"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Virtual Host Managers (VHMs) are used to gather information from a range of "
"client types."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host (VHMs) ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາກຫຼາຍປະເພດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"VHMs can be used to collect private or public cloud instances and organize "
"them into virtualization groups.  With your virtualized clients organized "
"this way, Taskomatic collects data on the clients for display in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  VHMs also allow you to use subscription matching on "
"your virtualized clients."
msgstr "VHMs ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮວບຮວມ instance ຂອງ private ຫຼື public cloud ແລະ ຈັດພວກມັນເຂົ້າເປັນກຸ່ມ virtualization. ເມື່ອຈັດລະບຽບລູກຂ່າຍ virtual ຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບນີ້ແລ້ວ, Taskomatic ຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຈາກລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອມາສະແດງໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. VHMs ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription matching) ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ virtual ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can create a VHM on your {productname} Server, and use it to inventory "
"available public cloud instances.  You can also use a VHM to manage clusters "
"created with {kube}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ VHM ເທິງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດຂໍ້ມູນ instance ຂອງ public cloud ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ VHM ເພື່ອຈັດການ cluster ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ {kube} ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#.  We could probably use a diagram here, to convey the meaning behind this:
#.  Virtual Host Managers (VHMs) can be used to manage one or more virtual hosts.
#.  Virtual Hosts are hypervisors provided by a third party.
#.  Each virtual host can contain one or more virtual guests.
#.  --LKB 2017-07-15
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with Amazon Web Services, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-aws.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ຮ່ວມກັບ Amazon Web Services, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-aws.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with Microsoft Azure, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-azure.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ຮ່ວມກັບ Microsoft Azure, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-azure.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with Google Compute Engine, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-gce.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ກັບ GCE, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-gce.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with {kube}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-kubernetes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ກັບ {kube}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:vhm-kubernetes.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with Nutanix, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-nutanix.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ຮ່ວມກັບ Nutanix, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-nutanix.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with VMWare vSphere, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-vmware.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ຮ່ວມກັບ VMWare vSphere, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-vmware.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information on using a VHM with other hosts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm-file.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHM ຮ່ວມກັບ host ອື່ນໆ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm-file.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You must have a virtualization add-on subscription for each host with the "
"Virtualization Server entitlement in {productname}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ virtualization add-on ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຮສທີ່ມີສິດເປັນ Virtualization Server ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with Xen and KVM"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Virtualization ດ້ວຍ Xen ແລະ KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:2
msgid "Xen and KVM virtualized clients can be managed directly in {productname}."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ Xen ແລະ KVM ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To begin, you need to set up a virtual host on your {productname} Server.  "
"You can then set up autoinstallation using {ay} or {kickstart} for future "
"virtual hosts, and for virtual guests."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສສະເໝືອນໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart} ສຳລັບໂຮສສະເໝືອນ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section also includes information about administering your virtual "
"guests after they have been installed."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຍັງປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການບໍລິຫານຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນຂອງທ່ານຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The way that you set up Xen or KVM on a VM host depends on what operating "
"system you want to use on its associated guests."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ Xen ຫຼື KVM ໃນໂຮສ VM ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກ (guests) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For {suse} operating systems, see the SLES Virtualization Guide available "
"from "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ຄູ່ມື SLES Virtualization ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For {rhel} operating systems, refer to the Red Hat documentation for your "
"version."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {rhel}, ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງຈາກເອກະສານຂອງ Red Hat ຕາມເວີຊັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` formula will help you with "
"initializing the host.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:virt-xenkvm.adoc#virt-xenkvm-host-formula[]."
msgstr "ສູດ (formula) [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` ຈະຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂຮສ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:virt-xenkvm.adoc#virt-xenkvm-host-formula[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"{productname} uses [systemitem]``libvirt`` to install and manage guests.  "
"You must have the [package]``libvirt-daemon`` package installed on your "
"host.  In most cases, the default settings are sufficient and you do not "
"need to adjust them.  However, if you want to access the VNC console on your "
"guests as a non-root user, you need to perform some configuration changes.  "
"For more information about how to set this up, consult the relevant "
"documentation for your operating system."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``libvirt`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``libvirt-daemon`` ໃນໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງ VNC console ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ root, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You need a bootstrap script on the {productname} Server.  Your bootstrap "
"script must include the activation key for your host.  We also recommend "
"that you include your GPG key for additional security.  For more on creating "
"a bootstrap script, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ໃນ {productname} Server. ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງມີ activation key ສຳລັບໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃສ່ GPG key ນຳເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When your bootstrap script is ready, execute it on the host to register it "
"with the {productname} Server.  For more on client registration, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນມັນໃນໂຮສເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:15
msgid "With the [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` formula, initialize the host:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂຮສດ້ວຍສູດ (formula) [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``:"

#.  CHECKIT: is the last step still needed?
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Initializing [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the [guimenu]``System Details`` "
"page for the host, and click the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ຂອງໂຮສ, ແລ້ວຄລິກແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Select the [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` formula, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:19
msgid "Click the [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` subtab."
msgstr "ຄລິກແທັບຍ່ອຍ [systemitem]``Virtualization Host``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:20
msgid "Check the settings, and click btn:[Save Formula]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:21
msgid "Apply the Highstate for the changes to take effect."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ (Apply) Highstate ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Restart the [systemitem]``salt-minion`` service to activate the new "
"configuration:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ [systemitem]``salt-minion`` ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For traditional clients, by default, VM hosts use the [systemitem]``rhnsd`` "
"service to check for scheduled actions.  The check occurs every four hours, "
"to balance load in environments where there are a lot of clients.  This can "
"create delays of up to four hours before an action is carried out.  When you "
"are managing VM guests, this long delay is not always ideal, especially for "
"actions like rebooting a guest.  To address this, you can disable the "
"[systemitem]``rhnsd`` service, and enable the [daemon]``osad`` service.  The "
"[daemon]``osad`` service receives commands using a jabber protocol, and "
"executes commands instantly."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional clients), ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໂຮສ VM ຈະໃຊ້ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ການກວດສອບຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນທຸກໆສີ່ຊົ່ວໂມງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມລ່າຊ້າ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດບໍລິການ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ [daemon]``osad`` ແທນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:25
msgid ""
"To disable the [systemitem]``rhnsd`` service, and enable the "
"[daemon]``osad`` daemon, run these commands as the root user:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດບໍລິການ [systemitem]``rhnsd`` ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [daemon]``osad``, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຖານະ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"service rhnsd stop\n"
"service rhnsd disable\n"
msgstr ""
"service rhnsd stop\n"
"service rhnsd disable\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"service osad enable\n"
"service osad start\n"
msgstr ""
"service osad enable\n"
"service osad start\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstall VM Guests"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກ VM ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You can use {ay} or {kickstart} to automatically install and register Xen "
"and KVM guests."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກ Xen ແລະ KVM ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You need an activation key for the VM host you want to register the guests "
"to, and for each guest."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ activation key ສຳລັບໂຮສ VM ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກໃຫ້, ແລະ ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Your activation key must have the [systemitem]``provisioning`` and "
"[systemitem]``Virtualization Platform`` entitlements.  Your activation key "
"must also have access to the [package]``mgr-virtualization-host`` and "
"[package]``mgr-osad`` packages.  For more on creating activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Activation key ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດ [systemitem]``provisioning`` ແລະ [systemitem]``Virtualization Platform``. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແພັກເກດ [package]``mgr-virtualization-host`` ແລະ [package]``mgr-osad`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If you want to automatically register the guests with {productname} after "
"installation, you need to create a bootstrap script.  For more on creating a "
"bootstrap script, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກກັບ {productname} ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງສະຄຣິບ bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation of VM guests works only if they are configured as "
"Traditional clients.  Salt clients can be created using a template disk "
"image, but not by using {ay} or {kickstart}."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ VM guests ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເປັນຄລາຍເອນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (Traditional clients) ເທົັ້ນ.  ຄລາຍເອນ Salt ສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຮູບພາບດິດ (disk image), ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍການໃຊ້ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Autoinstallable Distribution)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:35
msgid ""
"You need to create an autoinstallable distribution on the VM host to be able "
"to autoinstall clients from {productname}.  The distribution can be made "
"available from a mounted local or remote directory, or on a loop-mounted ISO "
"image."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນໂຮສ VM ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The configuration of the autoinstallable distribution differs depending on "
"whether you are using a SLES or {rhel} operating system on your guests.  The "
"packages for a {rhel} installation are fetched from the associated base "
"channel.  Packages for installing {suse} systems are fetched from the "
"autoinstallable distribution.  Therefore, for SLES systems, the "
"autoinstallable distribution must be a complete installation source."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ SLES ຫຼື {rhel} ໃນເຄື່ອງເກສຂອງທ່ານ.  ແພັກເກດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {rhel} ແມ່ນຖືກດຶງມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.  ແພັກເກດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ {suse} ແມ່ນຖືກດຶງມາຈາກຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.  ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສຳລັບລະບົບ SLES, ຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຕ້ອງເປັນແຫຼ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ສົມບູນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paths for autoinstallable distributions"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງ (Paths) ສຳລັບຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operating System Type | Kernel Location | initrd Location\n"
"| {rhel} | [path]``images/pxeboot/vmlinuz``    | "
"[path]``images/pxeboot/initrd.img``\n"
"| SLES | [path]``boot/<arch>/loader/initrd`` | "
"[path]``boot/<arch>/loader/linux``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ | ທີ່ຕັ້ງ Kernel | ທີ່ຕັ້ງ initrd\n"
"| {rhel} | [path]``images/pxeboot/vmlinuz``    | [path]``images/pxeboot/initrd.img``\n"
"| SLES | [path]``boot/<arch>/loader/initrd`` | [path]``boot/<arch>/loader/linux``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In all cases, ensure that the base channel matches the autoinstallable "
"distribution."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ base channel ກົງກັບຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure you have a installation media available to your VM "
"Host.  It can be on a network resource, a local directory, or an "
"loop-mounted ISO image.  Additionally, ensure that all files and directories "
"are world-readable."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານມີສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໂຮສ VM ແລ້ວ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Use only letters, numbers, hyphens (``-``), periods (``.``), and underscores "
"(``_``), and ensure the name is longer than four characters."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ຂີດກາງ (``-``), ຈຸດ (``.``), ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (``_``), ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຫຼາຍກວ່າສີ່ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:47
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Base Channel`` field, select the channel that matches the "
"installation source."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Base Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ທີ່ກົງກັບແຫຼ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:48
msgid "This channel is used as the package source for non-{suse} installations."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງແພັກເກດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Installer Generation`` field, select the operating system "
"version that matches the installation source."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Installer Generation``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ກົງກັບແຫຼ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When you have created an autoinstallable distribution, you can edit it by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] and selecting "
"the distribution you want to edit."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and Upload an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation profiles contain all the installation and configuration "
"data needed to install a system.  They can also contain scripts to be "
"executed after the installation is complete."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:57
msgid ""
"{kickstart} profiles can be created using the {productname} {webui}, by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], clicking "
"btn:[Create New Kickstart File], and following the prompts."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ຜ່ານ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:58
msgid ""
"You can also create {ay} or {kickstart} autoinstallation profiles by hand.  "
"{suse} provides templates of {ay} installation files that you can use as a "
"starting point for your own custom files.  You will find them at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart} ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້.  {suse} ໄດ້ສະໜອງແມ່ແບບຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {ay} ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງເອງ.  ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນພວກມັນໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If you are using {ay} to install SLES, you also need to include this "
"snippet:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ {ay} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ SLES, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃສ່ສ່ວນນີ້ໄປນຳ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<products config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  <listentry>SLES</listentry>\n"
"</products>\n"
msgstr ""
"<products config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  <listentry>SLES</listentry>\n"
"</products>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:61
msgid ""
"For more on {ay}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {ay}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:62
msgid ""
"For more on {kickstart}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[], or refer to "
"the Red Hat documentation for your installation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {kickstart}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫຼດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Profiles] and click btn:[Upload Kickstart/AutoYaST File]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Upload Kickstart/AutoYaST File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Create Autoinstallation Profile`` section, use these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Create Autoinstallation Profile``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:66
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a unique name for the profile."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Use only letters, numbers, hyphens (``-``), periods (``.``), and underscores "
"(``_``), and ensure the name is longer than six characters."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ຂີດກາງ (``-``), ຈຸດ (``.``), ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (``_``), ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຫຼາຍກວ່າຫົກຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree`` field, select the autoinstallable "
"distribution you created earlier."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Autoinstall Tree``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` field, select the relevant Guest "
"type (for example, [parameter]``KVM Virtualized Guest``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Virtualization Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດເຄື່ອງລູກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``KVM Virtualized Guest``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:70
msgid "Do not choose [guimenu]``Xen Virtualized Host`` here."
msgstr "ຢ່າເລືອກ [guimenu]``Xen Virtualized Host`` ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:71
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to manually create your autoinstallation profile, you "
"can type it directly into the [guimenu]``File Contents`` field."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດພິມລົງໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File Contents`` ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:72
msgid ""
"If you have a file already created, leave the [guimenu]``File Contents`` "
"field blank."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ອຍຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File Contents`` ໃຫ້ວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:73
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``File to Upload`` field, click btn:[Choose File], and use "
"the system dialog to select the file to upload."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File to Upload``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Choose File] ເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:74
msgid ""
"If the file is successfully uploaded, the filename is shown in the "
"[guimenu]``File to Upload`` field."
msgstr "ຖ້າອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ສຳເລັດ, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File to Upload``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:75
msgid ""
"The contents of the uploaded file is shown in the [guimenu]``File Contents`` "
"field."
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File Contents``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:76
msgid "If you need to make edits, you can do so directly."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:77
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save your changes and store the profile."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:78
msgid ""
"When you have created an autoinstallation profile, you can edit it by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and selecting the "
"profile you want to edit.  Make the desired changes and save your settings "
"by clicking btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:79
msgid ""
"If you change the [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` of an existing "
"{kickstart} profile, it might also modify the bootloader and partition "
"options, potentially overwriting any custom settings.  Carefully review the "
"[guimenu]``Partitioning`` tab to verify these settings before making "
"changes."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນ [guimenu]``Virtualization Type`` ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ທີ່ມີຢູ່, ມັນອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕົວບູດ (bootloader) ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບແທັບ [guimenu]``Partitioning`` ຢ່າງລະອຽດກ່ອນປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically Register Guests"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:81
msgid ""
"When you install VM guests automatically, they are not registered to "
"{productname}.  If you want your guests to be automatically registered as "
"soon as they are installed, you can add a section to the autoinstallation "
"profile that invokes a bootstrap script, and registers the guests."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກ VM ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ທັນທີ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມສ່ວນທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:82
msgid ""
"This section gives instructions for adding a bootstrap script to an existing "
"{ay} profile."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳວິທີການເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay} ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:83
msgid ""
"For more information about creating a bootstrap script, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[].  For instructions "
"on how to do this for {kickstart}, refer to the Red Hat documentation for "
"your installation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[].  ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບ {kickstart}, ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງເອກະສານຂອງ Red Hat ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Bootstrap Script to an {ay} Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Ensure your bootstrap script contains the activation key for the VM guests "
"you want to register with it, and that is located on the host at "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap_vm_guests.sh``."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ມີ activation key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Profiles], and select the {ay} profile to associate this script with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], ແລ້ວເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay} ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``File Contents`` field, add this snippet at the end of the "
"file, immediately before the closing ``</profile>`` tag."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File Contents``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສ່ວນນີ້ລົງໃນທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ ກ່ອນແທັກປິດ ``</profile>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:88
msgid ""
"Ensure you replace the example IP address [literal]``192.168.1.1`` in the "
"snippet with the correct IP address for your {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປ່ຽນທີ່ຢູ່ IP [literal]``192.168.1.1`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ IP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<scripts>\n"
"  <init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"    <script>\n"
"      <interpreter>shell</interpreter>\n"
"      <location>\n"
"        http://192.168.1.1/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_vm_guests.sh\n"
"      </location>\n"
"    </script>\n"
"  </init-scripts>\n"
"</scripts>\n"
msgstr ""
"<scripts>\n"
"  <init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"    <script>\n"
"      <interpreter>shell</interpreter>\n"
"      <location>\n"
"        http://192.168.1.1/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap_vm_guests.sh\n"
"      </location>\n"
"    </script>\n"
"  </init-scripts>\n"
"</scripts>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:90
msgid "Click menu:Update[] to save your changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:Update[] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:91
msgid ""
"If your {ay} profile already contains a ``<scripts>`` section, do not add a "
"second one.  Place the bootstrap snippet inside the existing ``<scripts>`` "
"section."
msgstr "ຖ້າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay} ມີສ່ວນ ``<scripts>`` ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຢ່າເພີ່ມສ່ວນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປ. ໃຫ້ວາງສ່ວນ bootstrap ໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ ``<scripts>`` ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:93
msgid ""
"Once you have everything set up, you can start to autoinstall your VM "
"guests."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸກຢ່າງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກ VM ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Each VM host can only install one guest at a time.  If you are scheduling "
"more than one autoinstallation, make sure you time them so that the next "
"installation does not begin before the previous one has completed.  If a "
"guest installation starts while another one is still running, the running "
"installation is canceled."
msgstr "ໂຮສ VM ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກໄດ້ພຽງເທື່ອລະໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີການກຳນົດເວລາຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນໜ້າສຳເລັດແລ້ວກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມອັນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:95
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview], and select "
"the VM host you want to install guests on."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview], ແລ້ວເລືອກໂຮສ VM ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:96
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guiitem]``Virtualization`` tab, and the "
"[guimenu]``Provisioning`` subtab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guiitem]``Virtualization``, ແລະ ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Provisioning``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:97
msgid ""
"Select the autoinstallation profile you want to use, and specify a unique "
"name for the guest."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້, ແລະ ລະບຸຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:98
msgid "Choose a proxy if applicable and enter a schedule."
msgstr "ເລືອກພຣັອກຊີ (proxy) ຖ້າມີ ແລະ ໃສ່ກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:99
msgid ""
"To change the guest's hardware profile and configuration options, click "
"btn:[Advanced Options]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮາດແວ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Advanced Options]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:100
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish] to complete."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish] ເພື່ອສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage VM Guests"
msgstr "ຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກ VM (VM Guests)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to manage your VM Guests, including "
"actions like shutting down, restarting, and adjusting CPU, and memory "
"allocations."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກ VM ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງການປິດເຄື່ອງ, ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງການຈັດສັນ CPU ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:103
msgid ""
"To do this, you need your Xen or KVM VM host registered to the {productname} "
"Server, and have the [daemon]``libvirtd`` service running on the host.  For "
"traditional clients, you also need the [package]``mgr-cfg-actions`` package "
"installed on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນໂຮສ VM Xen ຫຼື KVM ກັບ {productname} Server ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີບໍລິການ [daemon]``libvirtd`` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:104
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], and "
"click on the VM host for the guests you want to manage.  Navigate to the "
"[guimenu]``Virtualization`` tab to see all guests registered to this host, "
"and access the management functions."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ໂຮສ VM ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:105
msgid ""
"For more information on managing VM guests using the {webui}, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-virtualization.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກ VM ຜ່ານ {webui}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-virtualization.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization"
msgstr "Virtualization"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use {productname} to manage virtualized clients in addition to "
"regular traditional or Salt clients.  In this type of installation, a "
"virtual host is installed on the {productname} Server to manage any number "
"of virtual guests.  If you choose to, you can install several virtual hosts "
"to manage groups of guests."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກລູກຂ່າຍປົກກະຕິໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The range of capabilities that virtualized clients have depends on the "
"third-party virtualization provider you choose."
msgstr "ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ virtualization ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Xen and KVM hosts and guests can be managed directly in {productname}.  This "
"enables you to autoinstall hosts and guests using {ay} or {kickstart}, and "
"manage guests in the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂຮສ (host) ແລະ ເກສ (guest) ຂອງ Xen ແລະ KVM ສາມາດຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ {productname}.  ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໂຮສ ແລະ ເກສ ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ {ay} ຫຼື {kickstart}, ແລະ ຈັດການເກສໃນ {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For VMWare, including VMWare vSphere, and Nutanix AHV, {productname} "
"requires you to set up a virtual host manager (VHM) to control the VMs.  "
"This gives you control over the hosts and guests, but in a more limited way "
"than available with Xen and KVM; {productname} cannot create or edit VMs on "
"VMWare vSphere or Nutanix AHV."
msgstr ""

#. So I looked it up in their docs: "VMWare vSphere is a suite of virtualization applications that includes ESXi and vCenter Server". So I think using "VMWare vSphere" implies ESXi and vCenter without having to spell them out. Happy to be proven wrong. --LKB 2019-07-10
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Other third-party virtualization providers are not directly supported by "
"{productname}.  However, if your provider allows you to export a JSON "
"configuration file for the VM, you can upload that configuration file to "
"{productname} and manage it with a VHM."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອື່ນໆອາດຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ JSON ໄດ້, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນກັບ VHM ໃນ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about using VHMs to manage virtualization, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ VHMs, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Virtualized Hosts"
msgstr "ຈັດການໂຮສສະເໝືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure that the client you want to use as a virtualization "
"host has the ``Virtualization Host`` system type assigned to it.  Both "
"traditional and Salt clients can be used as virtual hosts.  Navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Systems List] and click the name of the client to use as a "
"virtualization host.  If the ``Virtualization Host`` system type is not "
"listed, initialize the [systemitem]``Virtualization Host`` formula.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:virt-xenkvm.adoc#virt-xenkvm-host[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າລູກຂ່າຍມີປະເພດລະບົບເປັນ ``Virtualization Host`` ແລ້ວ."

#.  2023-11-02, ke: is this still the case?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a client has the ``Virtualization Host`` system type, the "
"[guimenu]``Virtualization`` tab is available in the System Details page for "
"the client.  The [guimenu]``Virtualization`` tab allows you to create and "
"manage virtual guests, and manage storage pools and virtual networks."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍມີປະເພດເປັນ ``Virtualization Host``, ແທັບ [guimenu]``Virtualization`` ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Virtual Guests"
msgstr "ສ້າງເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Guests)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You can add virtual guests to your virtualization hosts within the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນເຂົ້າໃນໂຮສຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Virtual Guest"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], click "
"the name of the virtualization host, and navigate to the "
"[guimenu]``Virtualization`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List], ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ໂຮສ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Virtualization``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:15
msgid "In the [guimenu]``General`` section, complete these details:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``General``, ໃຫ້ກອກຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:16
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Guests`` subtab, click btn:[Create Guest]."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Guests``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create Guest]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:17
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type the name of the guest."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Hypervisor`` field, select the hypervisor to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Hypervisor``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຮເປີໄວເຊີ (hypervisor) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Virtual Machine Type`` field, select either fully "
"virtualized or para-virtualized."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Virtual Machine Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະເປັນແບບ fully virtualized ຫຼື para-virtualized."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Maximum Memory`` field, type the upper size limit for the "
"guest disk, in MiB."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Maximum Memory``, ໃຫ້ພິມຂີດຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດ ເປັນ MiB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Virtual CPU count``, type the number of vCPUs for the "
"guest."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Virtual CPU count``, ໃຫ້ພິມຈຳນວນ vCPUs ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Architecture`` field, select the emulated CPU architecture "
"to use on the guest.  By default, the architecture selected matches the "
"virtual host."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Architecture``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ CPU ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມັນຈະກົງກັບໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Auto-installation Profile`` field, select the "
"auto-installation tool to use to install the guest.  Leave this field blank "
"if you do not want to use auto-installation."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Auto-installation Profile``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຄື່ອງມືການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Disks`` section, complete the details of the virtual disk "
"to use with the client.  In the [guimenu]``Source template image URL`` "
"field, ensure you type the path to an operating system image.  If you do not "
"do this, your guest is created with an empty disk."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Disks``, ໃຫ້ກອກຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Networks`` section, complete the details of the virtual "
"network interface to use with the client.  Leave the "
"[guimenu]``MAC address`` field blank to generate a MAC address."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Networks``, ໃຫ້ກອກຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Graphics`` section, complete the details of the graphics "
"driver to use with the client."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Graphics``, ໃຫ້ກອກຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Schedule a time for the guest to be created, and click btn:[Create] to "
"create the guest."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງເຄື່ອງລູກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:28
msgid "The new virtual guest starts as soon as it has successfully been created."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກທັນທີທີ່ຖືກສ້າງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You can add virtual guests on a pacemaker cluster within the {productname} "
"{webui}, too."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມ virtual guests ໃນ pacemaker cluster ພາຍໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a cluster managed Virtual Guest"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍຄລັສເຕີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Follow the ``Creating a Virtual Guest`` procedure on one of the nodes of the "
"cluster with the following additions:"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ ``ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນ`` ໂດຍມີສ່ວນເພີ່ມເຕີມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:32
msgid "Ensure the [guimenu]``Define as a cluster resource`` field is checked."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Define as a cluster resource`` ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path to the cluster shared folder for VM definitions`` "
"field, type the path to a folder shared by all cluster nodes where the guest "
"configuration will be stored."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Path to the cluster shared folder...``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Make sure every disk is located on a storage pool shared by all the cluster "
"nodes."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທຸກດິສກ໌ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (storage pool) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທຸກໂນດຂອງຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:35
msgid "Virtual Guests managed by a cluster can be live migrated."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກສະເໝືອນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍຄລັສເຕີສາມາດເຮັດ live migration ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Support and VM Zones"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບຂອງ SUSE ແລະ ໂຊນຂອງ VM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Public cloud providers use regions to define the physical geographic "
"location of the datacenter providing virtual machines.  For example, "
"[systemitem]``US-East``, or [systemitem]``Asia``."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Public cloud ໃຊ້ພາກພື້ນ (regions) ເພື່ອກຳນົດສະຖານທີ່ທາງພູມສາດຂອງສູນຂໍ້ມູນ (datacenter)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Regions are then further divided into zones.  For example, the "
"[systemitem]``US-East`` region might contain zones called "
"[systemitem]``us-east-2a`` and [systemitem]``us-east-2b``, among others."
msgstr "ພາກພື້ນຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນໂຊນ (zones). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພາກພື້ນ [systemitem]``US-East`` ອາດຈະປະກອບມີໂຊນ [systemitem]``us-east-2a`` ແລະ [systemitem]``us-east-2b``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:39
msgid ""
"{suse} uses the zone of a virtual machine to determine the appropriate "
"subscription to provide.  If all of your VMs are provided by the same zone, "
"you are within the terms and conditions of the ``1-2 Virtual Machines`` "
"subscription."
msgstr "{suse} ໃຊ້ໂຊນຂອງ VM ເພື່ອກຳນົດການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If your VMs are provided by different zones, even if they are within the "
"same region, you might not meet the conditions of the ``1-2 Virtual "
"Machines`` subscription.  In this case, check your subscription carefully."
msgstr "ຫາກ VM ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຄົນລະໂຊນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບາງປະເພດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງລະອຽດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For {byos} instances ({byoslongform}), all installed products are passed to "
"the subscription matcher.  If your public cloud instances are {payg} "
"({payglongform}), their base products are excluded from the subscription "
"matcher counting."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {byos} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ({byoslongform}), ຜະລິດຕະພັນທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຕົວຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້.  ຖ້າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາວສາທາລະນະຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນ {payg} ({payglongform}), ຜະລິດຕະພັນພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການນັບຂອງຕົວຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The calculation about whether an instance is {payg} or {byos} is done at the "
"time of registration or when a hardware refresh action is executed."
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ວ່າເປັນ {payg} ຫຼື {byos} ຈະເຮັດໃນຕອນລົງທະບຽນ ຫຼື ຕອນອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virtualization.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf or contact {suse}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf ຫຼື ຕິດຕໍ່ {suse}."
